 sequel that, until a late, lamentably foolish turn, balances blockbuster bombast with human-scale drama, child-friendly comedy and gushers of tears. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hey, Evildoers, Here’s Webbing in Your Eye', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hey, Evildoers, Here’s Webbing in Your Eye', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Webb, Marc (1974- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garfield, Andrew', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DeHaan, Dane', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stone, Emma', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Foxx, Jamie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Amazing Spider-Man 2 (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-01T12:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/22f4bdc8-4105-5014-acac-63e0329787b7', 'word_count': 1378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/22f4bdc8-4105-5014-acac-63e0329787b7'}, {'abstract': 'At a charity event on Wednesday, the chief of Goldman Sachs was overheard recounting a dinner with Jamie Dimon and Peter Sands, where they traded stories from the dark days of 2008.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/01/a-dinner-among-survivors-of-the-financial-crisis/', 'snippet': 'At a charity event on Wednesday, the chief of Goldman Sachs was overheard recounting a dinner with Jamie Dimon and Peter Sands, where they traded stories fr