commercial theater, despite betraying few signs of visual, aural or narrative control.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/arts/altered1/altered1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mysterious Adventure of the Good Night’s Sleep', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Altered States of Plaine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gaglia, Nick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Altered States of Plaine (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-01T20:17:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Kenigsberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kenigsberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/05b0e7c2-2505-5484-a325-bb6041b524da', 'word_count': 259, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05b0e7c2-2505-5484-a325-bb6041b524da'}, {'abstract': 'Yael Averbuch, who plays for the Washington Spirit of the National Women’s Soccer League, has the same competitive drive and perfectionism that she did when she was 8.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/sports/soccer/8-things-about-me-that-havent-changed-since-i-was-8.html', 'snippet': 'Yael Averbuch, who plays for the Washington Spirit of the National Women’s Soccer League, has the same competitive drive and perfectionism that she did when she was 8.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I often write about change — the constant fluctuations in my thought process and reinvention of myself as a person and a soccer player. My environment and situation are constantly in flux. This year in the National Women’s Soccer League is no different.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/sports/soccer/02yael1/02yael1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 476, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/sports/soccer/02yael1/02yael1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 476, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',