 feature lists of synonyms, many gleaned from Roget’s Thesaurus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/arts/design/mel-bochner-turns-up-the-volume-in-strong-language.html', 'snippet': '“Mel Bochner: Strong Language,” an exhibition at the Jewish Museum, spotlights word paintings that feature lists of synonyms, many gleaned from Roget’s Thesaurus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Words have been the subjects and primary constituents of the enigmatic yet acerbically provocative paintings Mel Bochner has been creating over the past 12 years. “Mel Bochner: Strong Language,” an elegantly produced exhibition at the Jewish Museum, gives them their due and traces their roots back to text-based works that Mr. Bochner created in the ’60s and early ’70s, when he was one of New York’s pre-eminent Conceptual artists. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Secret Power of Synonyms', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Secret Power of Synonyms', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bochner, Mel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Language and Languages', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jewish Museum (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-01T21:20:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ken Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ken', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/67125204-1a7e-518c-9bc9-2d605437824c', 'word_count': 1040, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67125204-1a7e-518c-9bc9-2d605437824c'}, {'abstract': 'Stanley L. Cohen first entered a contingent guilty plea to two counts of failing to file tax returns; then he attended a hearing to see if Sulaiman Abu Ghaith still wanted him as a lawyer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/nyregion/lawyers-split-day-in-court-as-defendant-and-counsel.html', 'snippet': 'Stanley L. Cohen first entered a contingent guilty plea to two counts of failing to file tax returns; then he attended a hearing to see if Sulaiman Abu Ghaith still wanted him as a lawyer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As often occurs in busy courthouses, lawyers appear repeatedly on the same day, before different judges, in different courtrooms.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/02/nyregion/02COHENweb/02COHENweb-thumbStanda