ulus VR is prompting accusations from his old employer that he went too far in helping the company improve its technology.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/01/game-legend-carmack-at-center-of-oculus-dispute/', 'snippet': 'John Carmack is one of the most celebrated technical wizards in the video game business. Now his involvement with the virtual reality start-up Oculus VR is prompting accusations from his old employer that he went too far in helping the company imp...', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Carmack is one of the most celebrated technical wizards in the video game business, known for pushing the boundaries of the medium with Quake, Doom and other pioneering games. Most recently, he took up virtual reality as a cause, seeing in it a way to make games more immersive than those played on computer and television screens.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/01/business/01bits-oculus/01bits-oculus-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/01/business/01bits-oculus/01bits-oculus-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/01/business/01bits-oculus/01bits-oculus-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/01/business/01bits-oculus/01bits-oculus-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/01/business/01bits-oculus/01bits-oculus-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': '