ctor general is investigating allegations that the hospital created a secret waiting list for patients intended to hide long wait times for appointments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two top administrators at the Department of Veterans Affairs health care system in Phoenix have been placed on leave at the request of the department’s inspector general, who is investigating allegations that the hospital created a secret waiting list for patients intended to hide long wait times for appointments. Congressional officials have said as many as 40 veterans may have died while awaiting care, though none of the deaths have explicitly been tied to longer wait times.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'V.A. Hospital Officials in Phoenix Are Placed on Leave', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'V.A. Hospital Officials in Phoenix Are Placed on Leave', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oppel, Richard A Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shinseki, Eric K', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Phoenix (Ariz)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Helman, Sharon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robinson, Lance E', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-02T02:16:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Oppel', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt:/