es.com/2014/05/02/nyregion/2-brothers-sentenced-to-maximum-for-killing.html', 'snippet': 'A judge said it was “an easy call” to give Ralph and Keith Stokes 25 years to life for pummeling a man in the head more than 32 times and stabbing him repeatedly with a fork.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The murder victim was found kneeling with his head resting on his bed in Hamilton Heights, his feet bound with a dog leash and a belt, his wrists tied behind the back with a scarf, his mouth and nose covered with packing tape. He had been pummeled in the head more than 32 times and stabbed repeatedly with a fork. One ear had been cut in half. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2 Brothers Sentenced to Maximum for Killing a Manhattan Man', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '2 Brothers Sentenced to Maximum for Killing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romo, Charles Z Jr (1964-2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hamilton Heights (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stokes, Keith', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stokes, Ralph', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-02T03:47:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6af25322-5a42-5b94-ad3e-b9aafe615966', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6af25322-5a42-5b94-ad3e-b9aafe615966'}, {'abstract