 Trump National Golf Club in Bedminster, N.J.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/sports/golf/trump-courses-to-host-two-events.html', 'snippet': 'The P.G.A. of America provided the developer Donald Trump with a double gift, announcing that it had awarded the 2017 Senior P.G.A. Championship to Trump National Golf Club in Washington, and the 2022 P.G.A. Championship to Trump National Golf Clu...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The P.G.A. of America provided the developer Donald Trump with a double gift, announcing that it had awarded the 2017 Senior P.G.A. Championship to Trump National Golf Club in Washington, and the 2022 P.G.A. Championship to Trump National Golf Club in Bedminster, N.J. This week, Trump agreed to acquire the Turnberry Resort in Scotland, which is part of the rotation of courses that host the British Open. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump Courses to Host Two Events', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump Courses to Host Two Events', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Professional Golfers Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Trump National Golf Club', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-02T04:47:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4271928-ebd7-55f6-bd9f-ac08d3014886', 'word_count': 137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4271928-ebd7-55f6-bd9f-ac08d3014886'}, {'abstract': 'The real effects of the United States’ sanctions on Russia over its intervention in Ukraine appear to be more psychological than tangible, economic specialists say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/world/europe/so-far-us-sanctions-over-ukraine-may-be-inflicting-only-limited-pain-on-russia.html', 'snippet': 'The real effects of the United States’ sanctions on Russia over its intervention in Ukraine appear to be more psychological than tangible, economic specialists say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As it tries to punish Moscow for its intervention in Ukraine, the White House asserts that the sanctions it has imposed have had a “significant impact” on Russia’s economy, but their real effect so far, according to economic specialists, appears to be more psychological than tangible.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/world/SANCTIONS/SANCTIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/02/world/SANCTIONS/SANCTIONS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/world/SANCTIONS/SANCTIONS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/world/SANCTIONS/SANCTIONS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/world/SANCTIONS/SANCTIONS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name