 in her Instagrams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An avid Instagrammer, the fashion designer Julia Leach chronicles unexpected treasures hiding in plain sight, from sky-blue vistas in Athens to smooth stones in the sand in Riviera Nayarit, Mexico. “When I travel, pure moments that have graphic sensibility and emotional simplicity always catch my eye,” the former creative director of Kate Spade says. These discoveries serve as inspiration for Chance, Leach’s nascent line of breezy basics, including striped boat-neck T-shirts, cotton caftans and woven hats — the kind of clothing that makes one want to head off and seek the sun. ', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '38', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/t-magazine/11travel-look-chance/11travel-look-chance-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/t-magazine/11travel-look-chance/11travel-look-chance-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/t-magazine/11travel-look-chance/11travel-look-chance-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/t-magazine/11travel-look-chance/11travel-look-chance-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/t-magazine/11travel-look-chance/11travel-look-chance-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/11/t-