04/realestate/for-sale-by-owner-in-park-slope-a-steep-learning-curve.html', 'snippet': 'Selling your own apartment, an author discovers, is not so easy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have always disliked brokers. When my husband and I first set out to buy an apartment in 2004, we felt harassed by the pushy hoverers who chased us with sign-in sheets and referred to closets as “baby nooks.” It seemed their only goal was to create an unwarranted frenzy over each unit as a way of getting some idiot to pay far too much.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 651}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 944, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1887, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/realestate/04cov/04cov-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType