Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Deacon, Dan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'M I A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Monae, Janelle', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moroder, Giorgio', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peacock, Annette', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chic (Music Group)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kraftwerk (Music Group)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pet Shop Boys (Music Group)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-02T16:34:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Ratliff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ratliff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3aad93b-abee-57a8-a1f8-009b86741e97', 'word_count': 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3aad93b-abee-57a8-a1f8-009b86741e97'}, {'abstract': 'When I took my oldest child for her college tours, I tried to chat with my fellow parents. Now I know better.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/02/advice-for-parents-touring-colleges-dont-talk/', 'snippet': 'When I took my oldest child for her college tours, I tried to chat with my fellow parents. Now I know better.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ask my son, who is a junior in high school, if he remembers the Great College Schlep of 2011 with his big sister and he will still fume that it was no kind of summer vacation. Maybe not, but on that virgin tour through 1,200 miles of Anywhere, U.S.A., my husband and I learned a lot about our daughter, the college applicant. She dreaded going away from home more than we realized. She worried about the transition from high school to college, panicking over whether she would she make friends there. She was also consumed with worry in equal parts over whether her roommate would be a psycho, and how she might handle Starbucks withdrawal. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1224, 'width': 1632, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/02/us/motherlode-college-tour/motherlode-college-tour-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Advice for Parents Touring Colleges: Don’t Talk', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': 