terial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1907ce85-74ed-5f53-b4e9-72bd7ae14567', 'word_count': 347, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1907ce85-74ed-5f53-b4e9-72bd7ae14567'}, {'abstract': 'We were all scared of the Beast. I just didn’t realize that was the point.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/04/magazine/the-monster-of-kings-island.html', 'snippet': 'We were all scared of the Beast. I just didn’t realize that was the point.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The monsters of Southern Ohio had long wait lines and strict height requirements. But one behemoth in particular — a roller coaster called the Beast — served as a rite of passage for us kids of Cincinnati. Even before I saw the roller coaster, its infamy was scored in my mind by way of the Beast’s ubiquitous logo: two manacled claws straddling a railroad track that disappeared into a fiery hellhole.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '66', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/magazine/04lives1/mag-04Lives-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 372, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/magazine/04lives1/mag-04Lives-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 372, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/magazine/04lives1/mag-04Lives-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/04/magazine/04lives1/mag-04Lives-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/magazine/04lives1/mag-04Lives-t_CA0-thumbLar