erary voice, as well as a Syrian one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/03/books/osama-alomar-pursues-his-literary-ambitions-in-exile.html', 'snippet': 'Though he drives a cab in Chicago six days a week to make ends meet, the exiled writer Osama Alomar has hopes of becoming a distinct American literary voice, as well as a Syrian one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — In the Arab world, the Syrian writer Osama Alomar has a growing reputation as the author of short, clever parables that comment obliquely on political and social issues. But here, where he has lived in exile since 2008, he spends most of his time as the driver of Car 45 at the Horizon Taxi Cab company.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/03/arts/03jpALOMAR1/03jpALOMAR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum