m in Brooklyn, part of the Red Bull Music Academy festival, blurred the lines between professional and amateur, while recalling an illicit rave.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the famed house music D.J. Todd Terry was playing Thursday night, it was difficult to know what direction to look in. On one part of the floor of the Brooklyn Night Bazaar, a circle of people watched dancers working quick, smooth routines before ceding the floor. Nearby, another circle oohed and aahed over a man who made a lighted cigarette disappear and reappear in his mouth.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vying for Bragging Rights, Prancing Pros and Amateurs', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vying for Bragging Rights, Prancing Pros and Amateurs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Bull Music Academy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-02T22:29:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Caramanica', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Caramanica', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1cded7e-491a-5995-8f3b-102d2a99fd27', 'word_count': 579, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1cded7e-491a-5995-8f3b-102d2a99fd27'}, {'abstract': 'The latest New York Times/CBS News Poll is based on telephone interviews conducted April 30 and May 1 with 1,054 adults throughout the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/03/sports/basketball/how-the-poll-was-conducted.html', 'snippet': 'The latest New York Times/CBS News Poll is based on teleph