 bombing of the destroyer Cole. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The chief prosecutor at the Guantánamo Bay war-crimes court has asked a judge to set aside an order that requires the government to give defense lawyers sweeping amounts of classified details related to the Central Intelligence Agency’s treatment of Abd al-Rahim al-Nashiri, a Saudi detainee accused of orchestrating the 2000 bombing of the destroyer Cole.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guantánamo Prosecutor Fights Handing Secrets Over to Defense', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Guantánamo Prosecutor Fights Handing Secrets Over to Defense', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nashiri, Abd al-Rahim al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martins, Mark S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guantanamo Bay Naval Base (Cuba)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cole (USS)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-03T16:23:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee2c0c2a-85bd-5b4e-b692-dd5dae8265ad', 'word_count': 738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee2c0c2a-85bd-5b4e-b692-dd5dae8265ad'}, {'abstract': 'In a no-nonsense manual, an investment adviser has this warning for the young: Save now or pay later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/04/your-money/a-path-to-retirement-for-those-far-from-it.html', 'snippet': 'In a no-nonsense manual, an investment adviser has this warning for the young: Save now or pay later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a big retirement problem in America, maybe even a crisis. Many working people won’t have enough money to leave their jobs and live in comfort and security. How many are in jeopardy is debatable, but the problem’s existence is not.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 265, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 265}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 905, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/04/business/4-STRA/4-STRA-thumbLarge.jpg'