ast-round victory over Fabiano Caruana, who had bested him earlier in the event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In winning the Shamkir 2014 chess tournament in Azerbaijan, Magnus Carlsen was able to exact revenge in the last round against Fabiano Caruana, one of two players who defeated him earlier in the event.\xa0 ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Azerbaijan, Carlsen Wins When It Counts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Azerbaijan, Carlsen Wins When It Counts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McClain, Dylan Loeb', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Chess Federation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carlsen, Magnus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Azerbaijan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caruana, Fabiano', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-03T23:10:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Chess', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dylan Loeb McClain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dylan', 'middlename': 'Loeb', 'lastname': 'McClain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fee21fa2-3666-5a0f-9806-bca7c2b69440', 'word_count': 448, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fee21fa2-3666-5a0f-9806-bca7c2b69440'}, {'abstract': 'At the Kentucky Derby, outrageous hats are as much of an attraction as the horses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/sports/100000002860929/on-top-at-the-derby.html', 'snippet': 'At the Kentucky Derby, outrageous hats are as much of an attraction as the horses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the Kentucky Derby, outrageous hats are as mu