rand of basketball to succeed against Miami in the second round of the playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/05/sports/basketball/nets-know-how-to-beat-heat-unconventionally.html', 'snippet': 'Coach Jason Kidd will have to rely on the flexibility of his roster and an unorthodox brand of basketball to succeed against Miami in the second round of the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If there has been one defining characteristic of the Nets since Brook Lopez went down for the season, it is flexibility. Coach Jason Kidd has done well to make the most of what he has, but this flexibility is possible only because of the Nets’ physical skill sets and intelligence. Not only do the Nets have players like Paul Pierce and Shaun Livingston, who can fulfill a variety of needs and defy traditional definitions of their positions, they have a team smart enough to adjust on the fly. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/05/sports/subBECKLEY/subBECKLEY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 586, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/05/sports/subBECKLEY/subBECKLEY-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 586}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/05/sports/subBECKLEY/subBECKLEY-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1001, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/05/sports/subBECKLEY/subBECKLEY-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1508, 'width': 1543, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/05/sports/subBECKLEY/subBECKLEY-