distinctive, cartoonish record sleeve art, most notably for Michael Jackson’s “Dangerous” album, Aerosmith’s “Love in an Elevator” single, and records by the Red Hot Chili Peppers and Tyler the Creator. Now he is, in a limited way, becoming a record producer as well. While assembling “The Gay 90s West,” a thematic show of his paintings based on 19th-century themes, Mr. Ryden told The Hollywood Reporter, he decided to invite some of his friends in the pop music world to contribute to an accompanying album.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Offbeat Gallery Show With Its Own Soundtrack', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Offbeat Gallery Show  With Its Own Soundtrack', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-05T16:32:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/afcecf28-a58a-51ce-ae47-e0fa4193bf98', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/afcecf28-a58a-51ce-ae47-e0fa4193bf98'}, {'abstract': 'An Oklahoma lawmaker said he didn’t care how his state put inmates to death.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/05/no-comment-necessary-fed-to-the-lions/', 'snippet': 'An Oklahoma lawmaker said he didn’t care how his state put inmates to death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Responding to Tuesday’s\xa0botched execution\xa0of an Oklahoma inmate, a local lawmaker said it didn’t matter how the state put citizens to death.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline'