6f-4f3172f2858a'}, {'abstract': 'Graco says its rear-facing seats are easily removed in an emergency, but federal regulators take issue with a defective buckle and order tests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/automobiles/safety-agency-pressures-graco-to-recall-more-child-seats.html', 'snippet': 'Graco says its rear-facing seats are easily removed in an emergency, but federal regulators take issue with a defective buckle and order tests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration is increasing pressure on Graco Children’s Products to recall about 1.8 million car safety seats the agency deems dangerous, and has ordered a series of tests. The goal, the agency said, is to see how long a malfunctioning buckle would delay freeing an infant during an emergency.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/automobiles/06GRACO-image/06GRACO-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 501, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/automobiles/06GRACO-image/06GRACO-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 501, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/automobiles/06GRACO-image/06GRACO-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/06/automobiles/06GRACO-image/06GRACO-image-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/automobiles/06GRACO-image/06GRACO-image-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumb