3805-7bd8-5949-bf36-03bd2b90cb4e'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Rooney, a health and fitness expert who frequently travels as a motivational speaker and trainer, says language barriers are rarely an issue among athletes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/business/learning-to-laugh-through-the-pain.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Rooney, a health and fitness expert who frequently travels as a motivational speaker and trainer, says language barriers are rarely an issue among athletes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’VE been traveling for business for about 15 years. I’ve always been involved in sports training. I have degrees in physical therapy and exercise science, and have worked with many professional athletes, like football players or mixed martial artists. I was even a member of the United States bobsled team. When I developed my strength and conditioning program, called Training for Warriors, my travel schedule became insane. I’ve been to 25 countries so far doing motivational speaking, training or some combination of both.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/business/06flier/06flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/business/06flier/06flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/business/06flier/06flier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/business/06flier/06flier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail'