'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5dade075-f095-5947-b0f8-da25127d3522'}, {'abstract': '“The Spring Fling: First Love” is a collection of plays by writers with impressive credentials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/theater/the-spring-fling-first-love-at-the-access-theater.html', 'snippet': '“The Spring Fling: First Love” is a collection of plays by writers with impressive credentials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Attention struggling playwrights: Should you need inspiration, avoid Shakespeare, Molière and the like. Their skills could frustrate you. Instead, see “The Spring Fling: First Love,” six short plays so tedious that they may actually serve a purpose: You’ll find yourself thinking, “If that can get staged, my work must have a chance.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 320}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1092, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06FLING/06FLING-thumbStandard.j