 224, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4c3e495-ea82-5994-a545-27c7797fea60'}, {'abstract': 'Azad Ali has turned around more than two dozen faded homes in Victorian Flatbush, Brooklyn, and helped revive what was once the “wrong” side of Prospect Park.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/nyregion/renovator-of-victorian-beauties-profits-from-preservation.html', 'snippet': 'Azad Ali has turned around more than two dozen faded homes in Victorian Flatbush, Brooklyn, and helped revive what was once the “wrong” side of Prospect Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the enclaves of Victorian Flatbush — Prospect Park South, Ditmas Park, Midwood — no two houses look exactly alike, though many share the same grand flourishes, with turrets, wraparound porches and columns inside and out. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/nyregion/06appraisal-01/06appraisal-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/nyregion/06appraisal-01/06appraisal-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/nyregion/06appraisal-01/06appraisal-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/nyregion/06appraisal-01/06appraisal-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/nyregion/06appraisal-01/06appraisal-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_