-island-circus-accident-linked-to-metal-fastener.html', 'snippet': 'Fire officials in Providence said an accident that injured nine performers with the Ringling Brothers and Barnum & Bailey Circus on Sunday apparently occurred when a metal fastener snapped.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fire officials in Providence said an accident that injured nine performers with the Ringling Brothers and Barnum & Bailey Circus on Sunday apparently occurred when a metal fastener snapped, causing an apparatus to plummet 30 feet to the ground. Eight of the performers remained at Rhode Island Hospital on Monday, with two listed in critical condition and the rest in serious or good condition. The circus canceled two performances on Monday but said performances planned for Hartford later this week would proceed as scheduled. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rhode Island: Circus Accident Linked to Metal Fastener', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rhode Island: Circus Accident Linked to Metal Fastener', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ringling Bros and Barnum & Bailey Circus', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bidgood, Jess', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Circuses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rhode Island', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Providence (RI)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Falls', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-06T02:36:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe843224-6764-5de3-ab34-eec877f77df1', 'word_count': 84, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe843224-6764-5de3-ab34-eec877f77df1'}, {'abstract': 'The African National Congress, the party of Nelson Mandela, is poised to win the nation’s fifth democratic election, but it faces declining support among voters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/world/africa/in-south-africa-anc-is-counting-on-the-past.html', 'snippet': 'The African National Congress, the party of Nelson Mandela, is poised to win the nation’s fifth democratic election, but it faces declining support among voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALEXANDRA, South Africa — In this poor black township on the outskirts of Johannesburg, the campaign posters exhorting voters to return the African National Congress to power in Wednesday’s election reached deep into the party’s glorious past.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/world/SAFRICA-2/SAFRICA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/world/SAFRICA-2/SAFRICA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/world/SAFRICA-2/SAFRICA-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/world/SAFRICA-2/SAFRICA-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image