s to experimental orchestral music – an interest he developed as a teenage violist – will join the Wordless Music Orchestra in September for a concert performance of his “There Will Be Blood” film score. The performances, on Sept. 19 and 20 at the United Palace Theater in Washington Heights, will include a full screening of the 2007 Paul Thomas Anderson film, with the orchestra playing the score live. (Besides the sections composed by Mr. Greenwood, the score includes music by Arvo Pärt and Brahms.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 904}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1997, 'width': 1325, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbeat-jg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/arts/06artsbeat-jg/06artsbe