mer warehouse space of the Staatsoper Unter den Linden, is an extension of the West-Eastern Divan Orchestra.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — The Barenboim-Said Academy unveiled the architectural model for its new headquarters at a news conference on Tuesday here and announced an official opening date of October 2016. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Plans for Barenboim-Said Academy in Berlin Unveiled', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barenboim, Daniel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Staatsoper', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'West-Eastern Divan Orchestra', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Berlin (Germany)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-06T15:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rebecca Schmid', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rebecca', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmid', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea8a32c7-ff87-53fc-a95b-45b09066e0b3', 'word_count': 305, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea8a32c7-ff87-53fc-a95b-45b09066e0b3'}, {'abstract': 'An exploration of the voguing tradition moves dance back from the barre and closer to the bar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/07/arts/dance/french-and-american-dance-festival-all-around-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'An exploration of the voguing tradition moves dance back from the barre and closer to the bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is no chief curator, no unifying aesthetic and no central headquarters for Danse: A Fren