es. While the\xa0red carpet boasted no shortage of on-theme voluminous ball gowns and opera gloves — as worn by\xa0Sarah Jessica Parker in Oscar de La Renta, Karen\xa0Elson in Zac Posen and Suki Waterhouse in a stunning Burberry — the most interesting looks of the evening deviated from that formula. From Star\xa0Wars prints and exposed midriffs to brocade cigarette pants and\xa0austere minimalism, T salutes the women who politely declined the dress code\xa0and instead demonstrated what a fashion red carpet is really all about.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Most Daring Red-Carpet Ensembles From Last Night’s Met Gala', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-06T17:00:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f73af136-b4cb-5a98-bc83-8a890dc07c3a', 'word_count': 120, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f73af136-b4cb-5a98-bc83-8a890dc07c3a'}, {'abstract': 'Do you have a question about the polio vaccine? Ask Well. Your question may be answered by our reporter, Donald G. McNeil, Jr.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2014/05/07/health/06askwell_polio.html', 'snippet': 'Do you have a question about the polio vaccine? Ask Well. Your question may be answered by our reporter, Donald G. McNeil, Jr.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Do you have a question about the polio vaccine? Ask Well. Your question may be answered by our reporter, Donald G. McNeil, Jr.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'imag