ation at the decommissioned Domino Sugar Factory in Brooklyn opens this week, shares a few of her favorite things.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/06/kara-walker-likes-aerobics-dangelo/', 'snippet': 'The artist, whose installation at the decommissioned Domino Sugar Factory in Brooklyn opens this week, shares a few of her favorite things.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, the artist Kara Walker will unveil a major new public artwork at at the decommissioned Domino Sugar factory in Williamsburg, Brooklyn, presented by Creative Time, the elaborately titled “A Subtlety, or the Marvelous Sugar Baby, an Homage to the unpaid and overworked Artisans who have refined our Sweet tastes from the cane fields to the Kitchens of the New World on the occasion of the demolition of the Domino Sugar Refining Plant.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/t-magazine/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/06/t-magazine/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/t-magazine/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/t-magazine/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW/06walker-miller-slide-HVOW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/06/t-