months away, Mayor Bill de Blasio, the City Council and a state senator have suggestions on how to achieve a more fairly funded parks system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/07/nyregion/focusing-on-lesser-known-open-spaces-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'With New York City’s 2015 budget deadline two months away, Mayor Bill de Blasio, the City Council and a state senator have suggestions on how to achieve a more fairly funded parks system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the past year, the notion of “park equity” — that all of New York City’s parks should be equally well kept — has emerged as a hot topic in public policy discussions. It was the subject of a City Council hearing last month, and there is even a #ParkEquity hashtag on Twitter.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07parks/07parks-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07parks/07parks-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07parks/07parks-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07parks/07parks-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07parks/07parks-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/07/nyregion/07pa