s, according to a French news agency.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/07/chinese-police-to-help-with-tourist-influx-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'The move comes as Chinese travelers in France have experienced a rising number of robberies and assaults, according to a French news agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'France has invited the Chinese police to Paris this summer to help with the pressures of huge numbers of Chinese tourists visiting the French capital, Agence France-Presse reported, citing a French Interior Ministry official. The move comes as Chinese travelers in France have experienced a rising number of robberies and assaults, the French news agency said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/world/07sino-paris01/07sino-paris01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th