iam Scarlett and Alexei Ratmansky; a festival of George Balanchine’s cherished Black and White ballets; the principal dancer Wendy Whelan’s farewell performance; and the company premiere of “La Sylphide” by its ballet master in chief, Peter Martins.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City Ballet’s 2014-15 Season to Feature Ballets by Peck, Scarlett and Ratmansky', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'First Times, Fests and Farewells', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Balanchine, George', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Peck, Justin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ratmansky, Alexei', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Koch, David H, Theater', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York City Ballet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T14:06:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c0835b6-2974-5d34-ac67-8350040dfaa6', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c0835b6-2974-5d34-ac67-8350040dfaa6'}, {'abstract': 'The West Memphis Three are now the subjects of a fifth movie, the scripted feature “Devil’s Knot.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/movies/west-memphis-three-inspire-yet-another-film-devils-knot.html', 'snippet': 'The West Memphis Three are now the subjects of a fifth movie, the scripted feature “Devil’s Knot.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In one form or another, Damien Echols has now been a s