1-2669-528e-81c5-ead40ebd1745'}, {'abstract': '“In Berlin, people practice more understatement with their clothing,” said Ron Dietze in a vintage handmade leather coat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/fashion/street-style-in-berlin-Kreuzberg-germany.html', 'snippet': '“In Berlin, people practice more understatement with their clothing,” said Ron Dietze in a vintage handmade leather coat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The central Kreuzberg neighborhood has evolved from one of the poorest in Berlin to one of the trendiest. It is where Ron Dietze (with his wife and two daughters) was walking along the graffiti-lined streets on the way to dinner. Dressed in a fitted black suit, a black turtleneck and a cherry-red leather trench coat, Mr. Dietze said he usually wore more color, higher heels and even the occasional skirt. On this day, however, he said he wanted to dress “a bit classier” for his daughter’s birthday celebration. This interview has been edited and condensed.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/fashion/08zINTERSECTION2/08zINTERSECTION2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/fashion/08zINTERSECTION2/08zINTERSECTION2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/fashion/08zINTERSECTION2/08zINTERSECTION2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/fashion/08zINTERSECTION2/08zINTERSECTION2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':