is the No. 1 album. But there is at least some news on the music charts this week: after a 10-week run, Pharrell Williams’s ubiquitous “Happy” has finally been dethroned as the top song.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Single Hits No. 1; Top Album Is ‘Frozen’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T20:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Sisario', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sisario', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab07dd17-521b-58d8-9d64-da2fd668c036', 'word_count': 331, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab07dd17-521b-58d8-9d64-da2fd668c036'}, {'abstract': 'With lodging incorporated into new airports or expansions, travelers who have long layovers or are attending conferences may not have to leave the grounds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/business/hotels-near-the-terminal-some-even-attached.html', 'snippet': 'With lodging incorporated into new airports or expansions, travelers who have long layovers or are attending conferences may not have to leave the grounds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KUALA LUMPUR, Malaysia — Before the year is over, China will eclipse the United States as the country with the largest number of residents traveling internationally, according to a new study by Oxford Economics commissioned by the travel technology company Amadeus. Similarly, Asia, the Middle East and South America are experiencing increases in the number of people flying long distances, according to the International Air Transport Association. Such robust growth is prompting a construction boom in hotels incorporated into new airports or airport expansions.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/HOTEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/HOTEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/HOTEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/HOTEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/08HOTEL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/08HOTEL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08HOTEL/08HOTEL-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hotels Near the Terminal, Some Even Attached', 'kicker': 'Business Travel', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hotels Near the Terminal, Some Even Attached', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Negroni, Christine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Business Travel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam