ary since the 1980s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/upshot/a-familiar-refrain-cut-calories.html', 'snippet': 'Americans may have heeded the call to drink fewer martinis, but they have consumed more calories than necessary since the 1980s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times is converting all of its 1964 issues into a digitized, searchable format. Each week, The Upshot will unearth an item from 50 years ago and put it in the light of today. “A Cut in Calories Urged for Nation” appeared on May 7 and can be seen in its original format on TimesMachine. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/upshot/08UP-calories/08UP-calories-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 267, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/upshot/08UP-calories/08UP-calories-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1036, 'width': 270, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/upshot/08UP-calories/08UP-calories-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/upshot/08UP-calories/08UP-calories-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/upshot/08UP-calories/08UP-calories-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Familiar Refrain: Cut Calories', 'kicker': 'Archive Dive', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calories',