ral events, partnered with the art fair on its V.I.P. lounge this year.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/07/neuehouse-new-york-frieze-david-rockwell/', 'snippet': 'The young co-working space in Gramercy Park, which has quickly become known for its jet-setting entrepreneurs and its innovative cultural events, partnered with the art fair on its V.I.P. lounge this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the chief appeals of Frieze New York is its buzzy restaurant partners, which for this weekend’s edition include Roberta’s, Mission Cantina and Frankies Spuntino. This year, the fair adds a different kind of lifestyle partner in the clublike co-working space Neuehouse, which has become a hot location for start-ups and cultural programming since opening its David Rockwell-designed office on 25th Street last year. For Frieze, Neuehouse created the V.I.P. tent,\xa0an oasis in the middle of the fair’s whirl of activity on Randall’s Island. “Part of the exploration here is that the place that one works, the place that one creates should be stimulating visually and emotionally, and art is a very important part of that,” says the Neuehouse co-founder Joshua Abram of the decision to partner with Frieze.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/t-magazine/07binlot-neuehouse/07binlot-neuehouse-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'By Design | Neuehouse Brings Its Artisanal Aesthetic to Frieze New York', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interior Design and Furnishings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rockwell, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gramercy Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T20:30:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Binlot', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Binlot', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3e5776d-9654-5e0d-8560-391ff2976da0', 'word_count': 325, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c3e5776d-9654-5e0d-8560-391ff2976da0'}, {'abstract': 'To compete for high-value business travelers, airlines are engaged in an amenities arms race, investing in better seats, private terminals and hosts of other perks for their premium passengers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/business/piling-on-the-luxury.html', 'snippet': 'To compete for high-value business travelers, airlines are engaged in an amenities arms race, investing in better seats, private terminals and hosts of other perks for their premium passengers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For most travelers, flying in style may be a thing of the past, but airlines are determined to bring back some glamour to air travel, at least for those sitting in the front of the plane. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 929, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 929}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 662, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1323, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/business/08FLIGHT_ILLO/08FLIGHT_ILLO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe