fety Association said that motorcyclists deaths are down, but the weather probably kept riders off the roads.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/automobiles/motorcyclist-deaths-may-have-decreased-in-2013.html', 'snippet': 'The Governors Highway Safety Association said that motorcyclists deaths are down, but the weather probably kept riders off the roads.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Based on preliminary data provided by the highway departments of all 50 states and the District of Columbia, motorcyclist deaths in the United States appear to have decreased 7 percent in 2013, according to an analysis released Tuesday by the Governors Highway Safety Association, a nonprofit organization. But motorcyclist safety has not improved over all in the last 15 years, the group said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Motorcyclist Deaths May Have Decreased in 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Motorcycles, Motor Bikes and Motorscooters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Governors Highway Safety Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T21:38:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cheryl Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cheryl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1eb273c2-b9bf-5f9b