rtheast this week, the area’s senator, a resident and the Nigerian news media reported on Wednesday, as more than 200 schoolgirls abducted by the militants, known as Boko Haram, remained missing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Islamist Militants Kill Hundreds of Civilians in Northeastern Nigeria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Islamist Militants Kill Hundreds of Civilians in Northeastern Nigeria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boko Haram', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T22:11:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09125877-ce3d-5d0f-a23b-7d498721b819', 'word_count': 484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09125877-ce3d-5d0f-a23b-7d498721b819'}, {'abstract': 'Meet Alexandra Chemla of ArtBinder, an iPad app that lets art galleries showcase works and keep track of inventory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/fashion/meet-alexandra-chemla-of-artbinder.html', 'snippet': 'Meet Alexandra Chemla of ArtBinder, an iPad app that lets art galleries showcase works and keep track of inventory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AGE 27', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/fashion/08Z2SUBUPNEXT/08Z2SUBUPNEXT-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 600, '