een Offsite are two new additions to the New York design scene in May.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/garden/new-fairs-add-to-design-mix.html', 'snippet': 'Industry City/Design and Sight Unseen Offsite are two new additions to the New York design scene in May.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Happily for New York designers, the entity once known as New York Design Week now stretches over a goodly part of May. Helping to fill the time are two new design fairs. From May 10 to 20, Wanted Design, an annual furniture show in Chelsea organized by Odile Hainaut and Claire Pijoulat, will open a separate exhibition in the 30,000-square-foot Industry City complex in Sunset Park, Brooklyn. The show, called Industry City/Design, will have three sections: one about objects, like Italian TobeUs cars made from wood salvaged from Hurricane Sandy; one about processes, like the creation of Alpi Group’s decorative woods, and one devoted to local design organizations.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/garden/08CURROPEN2/08CURROPEN2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 377, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/garden/08CURROPEN2/08CURROPEN2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 377}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/garden/08CURROPEN2/08CURROPEN2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/garden/08CURROPEN2/08CURROPEN2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1288, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'