'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/opinion/love-and-stuff.html', 'snippet': 'After her mother passes away, the filmmaker Judith Helfand struggles to pack up her things — figuring out what to keep and how to let go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was a kid I loved Mother’s Day. I got to make breakfast in bed for my mom. As I got older I started to resent it. I would tell her: this is between us — not you, me and Hallmark. Every day is Mother’s Day. More than gifts, what she always wanted was time. Time with me, with my brothers, with her grandchildren, with my father (may he rest in peace), the guy who made her a mother to begin with. The gift of time always trumped stuff.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/07/multimedia/opdoc-mother/opdoc-mother-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Love and Stuff’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Mother's Day", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T23:48:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Helfand', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Helfand', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f5a93a5-1f3b-56ea-ba22-2dcc0d2309be', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f5a93a5-1f3b-56ea-ba22-2dcc0d2309be'}, {'abstract': 'The article represents the culmination of a long relationship between the former White House intern and the glossy magazine.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/07/how-vanity-fair-landed-the-monica-lewinsky-story/', 'snippet': 'The article represents the culmination of a long relationship between the former White House intern and the glossy magazine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday night, the wife of former Vice President Dick Cheney offered her take on Monica Lewinsky’s essay — “Shame and Survival” — in the June issue of Vanity Fair magazine. It was part of a Clinton conspiracy, she said, an effort to “get that story out of the way” before the 2016 presidential campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Vanity Fair Landed the Monica Lewinsky Story', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carter, Graydon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friend, David', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hitchens, Christopher', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewinsky, Monica S', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ritts, Herbert Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vanity Fair', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T23:49:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By JONATHAN MAHLER', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MAHLER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/869e8ac1-059d-5cd7-859f-b482c309f9a0', 'word_count': 374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/869e8ac1-059d-5cd7-859f-b482c309f9a0'}, {'abstract': 'The authorities on Wednesday said they had charged two sergeants in the country’s National Guard in the death of a 23-year-old woman who was shot during antigovernment protests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/world/americas/venezuela-arrests-in-shooting-of-antigovernment-protester.html', 'snippet': 'The authorities on Wednesday said they had charged two sergeants in the country’s National Guard in the death of a 23-year-old woman who was shot during antigovernment protests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The authorities on Wednesday said they had charged two sergeants in the country’s National Guard in the death of a 23-year-old woman who was shot during antigovernment protests. The shooting of the woman, Geraldín Moreno, in February in Valencia, the country’s third-largest city, provoked outrage and fueled allegations that the protests sweeping Venezuela in recent months had been violently repressed. Witnesses said that Ms. Moreno was on the ground when a soldier shot her in the face at close range. President Nicolás Maduro has said repeatedly that his government defends human rights and that it is vigorously investigating allegations of wrongdoing by security forces. A human rights lawyer, Gonzalo Himiob, pointed to an apparent lack of progress in other investigations and questioned the government’s commitment to holding violators accountable. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Venezuela: Arrests in Shooting of Antigovernment Protester', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Venezuela: Arrests Made in Death of Antigovernment Protester', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maduro, Nicolas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moreno, Geraldin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-07T23:50:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/6dd0e60e-db31-545d-b143-82a6c09ace27', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6dd0e60e-db31-545d-b143-82a6c09ace27'}, {'abstract': 'Publishers of online video at the Digital Content NewFronts indicated they were trying to make it easier for marketers and agencies to spend on video.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/business/media/for-online-video-publishers-a-new-tack-on-luring-ad-dollars.html', 'snippet': 'Publishers of online video at the Digital Content NewFronts indicated they were trying to make it easier for marketers and agencies to spend on video.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS a well-received annual presentation of new digital offerings to Madison Avenue ends, publishers are seeking to keep the momentum going by making it easier for marketers and agencies to spend advertising dollars on online video — whether or not that money is being shifted from television ad budgets.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/Adco/Adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 834, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/business/Adco/Adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 834}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/Adco/Adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/business/Adco/Adco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1731, 'width': 1246, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Online Video Publishers, a New Tack on Luring Ad Dollars', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Online Video Publishers, a New Tack on Luring Ad Dollars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elliott, Stuart', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rothenberg, Randall', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-08T00:01:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stuart Elliott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stuart', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Elliott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d810c94c-d3f4-5c19-bfbe-58811af4d1f4', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d810c94c-d3f4-5c19-bfbe-58811af4d1f4'}, {'abstract': 'The dangerous standoff between Russia and Ukraine could be moving toward a resolution if President Vladimir Putin remains true to his words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/opinion/amid-tensions-a-gesture-from-putin.html', 'snippet': 'The dangerous standoff between Russia and Ukraine could be moving toward a resolution if President Vladimir Putin remains true to his words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If President Vladimir Putin of Russia means what he said on Wednesday, the dangerous standoff over Ukraine could be moving toward a resolution. After meeting with the Swiss president, Didier Burkhalter, who is the current chairman of the Organization for Security and Cooperation in Europe, Mr. Putin said Russian troops have been pulled back from the Ukrainian border, and he urged pro-Russian rebels in southeastern Ukraine to call off a referendum on secession that they had scheduled for Sunday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Tensions, a Gesture From Putin', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Tensions, a Gesture From Putin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-08T00:02:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/6845916a-37ac-5faf-bf1e-0502f1e30758', 'word_count': 624, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6845916a-37ac-5faf-bf1e-0502f1e30758'}, {'abstract': 'The service comes bundled by Cricket Wireless, a prepaid wireless phone carrier. AT&T acquired Muve, when it bought Cricket’s parent, Leap Wireless.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/business/media/muve-music-service-is-said-to-be-up-for-sale-by-att.html', 'snippet': 'The service comes bundled by Cricket Wireless, a prepaid wireless phone carrier. AT&T acquired Muve, when it bought Cricket’s parent, Leap Wireless.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the most successful music subscription services in the United States may be up for grabs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Muve Music Service Is Said to Be Up for Sale by AT&T', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cricket Communications Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muve Music', 'rank': 3,