/article/6ee5b04d-737e-5335-b6c3-7a24cfd3ac38'}, {'abstract': 'The Nationals have seen enough, in 83 major league starts, from Stephen Strasburg to understand how few peers can match his mastery of three exceptional pitches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/sports/baseball/nationals-put-trust-in-strasburg-even-when-he-falters.html', 'snippet': 'The Nationals have seen enough, in 83 major league starts, from Stephen Strasburg to understand how few peers can match his mastery of three exceptional pitches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — When the question came to him, with the cameras on, Stephen Strasburg chose calculated sarcasm. How often does he have all his pitches working the way he did Wednesday?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1258, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/sports/CITY-KEPNER/CITY-KE