: 'Shannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/462bdadd-f434-53d6-b89d-a343e2ecdd74', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/462bdadd-f434-53d6-b89d-a343e2ecdd74'}, {'abstract': 'Dementia is not something we doctors talk much about. We all have many patients with dementia — and more every year — but we never seem to chat about it the way we discuss kidney disease or cancer treatment.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/08/the-silence-of-doctors-around-alzheimers/', 'snippet': 'Dementia is not something we doctors talk much about. We all have many patients with dementia — and more every year — but we never seem to chat about it the way we discuss kidney disease or cancer treatment.', 'lead_paragraph': '“A fate worse than death,” my colleague muttered to me as we examined an elderly man admitted to the hospital with severe dementia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 446, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/11/08/health/08well_ofri/08well_ofri-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't