': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/65db9ab2-1e4d-540f-9451-5fac078052e5', 'word_count': 1023, 'uri': 'nyt://article/65db9ab2-1e4d-540f-9451-5fac078052e5'}, {'abstract': 'The effects of the 1947 partition of India and Pakistan loom over this new history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/books/review/midnights-descendants-by-john-keay.html', 'snippet': 'The effects of the 1947 partition of India and Pakistan loom over this new history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some historical events have such utterly catastrophic consequences that no amount of “what if” counterfactuals can yield a more awful result. World War I, for example, resulted in an enormous number of fatalities, largely entrenched the imperialism that initiated it and paved the way for both Nazism and Stalinism. How could a different path have been worse?', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-CHOTINER/0511-bks-CHOTINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 154, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-CHOTINER/0511-bks-CHOTINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 154}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-CHOTINER/0511-bks-CHOTINER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 264, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-CHOTINER/0511-bks-CHOTINER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type':