cly traded company on June 6.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Time Warner has officially approved the spinoff of Time Inc. into a separate company and set a date of June 6 for the transaction to become effective, according to a filing dated Thursday that was made with the Securities and Exchange Commission.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Time Warner Sets Date for Time Inc. Spinoff', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Time Warner Sets Date for Spinoff of Time Inc.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Leslie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pearlstine, Norman', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ripp, Joseph A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-08T21:18:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Leslie Kaufman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Leslie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaufman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ce8f052-1623-550b-90af-31a2de813851', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ce8f052-1623-550b-90af-31a2de813851'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of stories set around the time of partition and written with an aching longing for Bombay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/books/review/bombay-stories-by-saadat-hasan-manto.html', 'snippet': 'A collection of stories set around the time of partition and written with an aching longing for Bombay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Saadat Hasan Manto has a good claim to be considered the greatest South Asian writer of the 20th century. In his work, written in Urdu, he incarnated the exuberance, the madness, the alcoholic delirium of his time, when the country he loved cleaved into two and set upon each other, brothers of all religions murdering their infant nephews and raping their sisters-in-law.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 591, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 591}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1008, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 1409, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-MEHTA/0511-bks-MEHTA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge',