s', '_id': 'nyt://article/b40c9642-5bc0-5524-ac44-cce15f3aeb04', 'word_count': 422, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b40c9642-5bc0-5524-ac44-cce15f3aeb04'}, {'abstract': 'A biography of Patna, the capital city of Bihar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/books/review/a-matter-of-rats-by-amitava-kumar.html', 'snippet': 'A biography of Patna, the capital city of Bihar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One night two summers ago, I was in a car speeding across the border into the eastern Indian state of Bihar. The unlit, pitch-black freeway didn’t deter traffic from barreling forward at breakneck speeds. In the inevitable accident, a young man was shredded by a truck. A politician showed up, but instead of taking charge, he distracted the police with laughter and gossip. ', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-FALLEIRO/0511-bks-FALLEIRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-FALLEIRO/0511-bks-FALLEIRO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-FALLEIRO/0511-bks-FALLEIRO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-FALLEIRO/0511-bks-FALLEIRO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1387, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/books/review/0511-bks-FALLEIRO/0511-bks-FALLEIRO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid