014fe538d'}, {'abstract': 'Some recent Ford Escape and C-Max models have air bag and door latch defects; G.M. installed the wrong brake rotors on some sedans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/automobiles/ford-recalls-1-4-million-crossovers-gm-recalls-9000-sedans.html', 'snippet': 'Some recent Ford Escape and C-Max models have air bag and door latch defects; G.M. installed the wrong brake rotors on some sedans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In two actions, Ford is recalling nearly 1.4 million vehicles from the 2013-14 model years for an air bag malfunction and door handles that may not latch properly, the automaker said Friday. The air bag issue covers about 692,500 Escape and C-Max models, including 591,000 in the United States, about 78,000 in Canada and almost 19,700 in Mexico.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/automobiles/10RECALL-image1/10RECALL-image1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/automobiles/10RECALL-image1/10RECALL-image1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/automobiles/10RECALL-image1/10RECALL-image1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/automobiles/10RECALL-image1/10RECALL-image1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 827, 'width': 1188, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/automobiles/10RECALL-image1/10RECALL-image1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thum