porarily creates more opportunities for industry groups to lobby Congress, and for legislators to shake down the beneficiaries of the tax breaks for contributions, Victor Fleischer writes in the Standard Deduction column.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/09/with-gridlock-comes-piecemeal-tax-legislation/', 'snippet': 'Renewing the tax package temporarily creates more opportunities for industry groups to lobby Congress, and for legislators to shake down the beneficiaries of the tax breaks for contributions, Victor Fleischer writes in the Standard Deduction colum...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Substantive tax legislation is nowhere to be seen. The campaign to overhaul the tax code is on hold, despite a couple of years of concerted effort by Representative Dave Camp, the outgoing chairman of the House Ways and Means Committee, and Senator Max Baucus, who left his post as chairman of the Senate Finance Committee to become the United States Ambassador to China. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/business/dbpix-gridlock2/dbpix-gridlock2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/business/dbpix-gridlock2/dbpix-gridlock2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/business/dbpix-gridlock2/dbpix-gridlock2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/business/dbpix-gridlock2/dbpix-gridlock2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit'