/antiques-dealer-david-duncan-at-home.html', 'snippet': 'The antiques dealer David Duncan lives over his shop on East 60th Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As an antiques dealer, David Duncan is usually focused on the past. But 10 years ago, he looked into the future and concluded the only way to guarantee his survival as a Manhattan shopkeeper was to own his own building. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Objects From the Lively Past', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Objects From the Lively Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duncan, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-09T19:36:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Shaw', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shaw', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ceddd64-c692-5be0-9c84-e98190f0ac2e', 'word_count': 1145, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ceddd64-c692-5be0-9c84-e98190f0ac2e'}, {'abstract': 'The marketing of Mother’s Day is often sweetly sentimental. At The Upshot, we’re offering something a little more bracing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/upshot/a-drink-as-complicated-as-motherhood.html', 'snippet': 'The marketing of Mother’s Day is often sweetly sentimental. At The Upshot, we’re offering something a little more bracing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Sunday, mothers will be celebrated with flowers, or with breakfast in bed. On Monday, most will return to jobs where they are likely to be paid less than their male colleagues — precisely because they are mothers. Studies have repeatedly shown that women lose career opportunities and earnings after they have babies (even though fatherhood increases men’s earnings.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/upshot/10up-twist-copy/10up-twist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Drink as Complicated as Motherhood', 'kicker': 'Upshot With a Twist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name