t://article/fac49b70-45a7-5f7e-a83f-cf47b29d0471'}, {'abstract': 'The N.B.A. named Richard Parsons, a prominent business executive, to lead the Los Angeles Clippers on an interim basis as the league moves to strip Donald Sterling of his ownership stake in the franchise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/sports/basketball/nba-installs-parsons-as-clippers-chief-executive.html', 'snippet': 'The N.B.A. named Richard Parsons, a prominent business executive, to lead the Los Angeles Clippers on an interim basis as the league moves to strip Donald Sterling of his ownership stake in the franchise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the N.B.A. pushes forward with its effort to strip Donald Sterling of his ownership of the Los Angeles Clippers, Commissioner Adam Silver on Friday installed Richard D. Parsons, the former chairman of Citigroup and the former chief executive of Time Warner, as the interim chief executive of the Clippers.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/sports/10parsons1/10parsons1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/sports/10parsons1/10parsons1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 754}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/sports/10parsons1/10parsons1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 815, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/sports/10parsons1/10parsons1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1921, 'width': 1528, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/