7e70d49c2ba8'}, {'abstract': 'T’s European editor, Rita Konig, brings us to Spitalfields, one of her favorite spots to shop for cookware, linens and friendly shopkeepers.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/09/spitalfields-antiques-market-london-rita-konig-video/', 'snippet': 'T’s European editor, Rita Konig, brings us to Spitalfields, one of her favorite spots to shop for cookware, linens and friendly shopkeepers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'T’s European editor Rita Konig visits Spitalfields Antiques Market in London, her go-to shopping destination for vintage kitchenalia and home goods that happen to be affordable. “You find these old things, and I think that really adds to your home rather than everything being brand new,” she says. While there, she finds items like linen pillowcases and a wool blanket, chats with the shopkeepers she has gotten to know on a first-name basis and shares her tips for shopping antiques markets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Video Lesson in Antiques Market Shopping', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cookware', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-09T20:09:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb800e9b-28a4-592b-bf5a-435d137358ea', 'word_count': 81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb800e9b-28a4-592b-bf5a-435d137358ea'}, {'abstract': 'The writer takes the city’s party season in stride.', 'web_url': 'htt