it had to leave by Sept. 30 last year, the company was given a reprieve while it sought a new space.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Home for New York Theater Ballet', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Theater Ballet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-09T20:20:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d44300b-3350-5ad1-9c26-55f6199a7b36', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d44300b-3350-5ad1-9c26-55f6199a7b36'}, {'abstract': 'Melissa Clark pan-sears sweet sea scallops and nestles them in a bright, grassy sauce of fresh sorrel and garlic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/dining/100000002871592/scallops-with-sorrel-butter.html', 'snippet': 'Melissa Clark pan-sears sweet sea scallops and nestles them in a bright, grassy sauce of fresh sorrel and garlic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Melissa Clark pan-sears sweet sea scallops and nestles them in a bright, grassy sauce of fresh sorrel and garlic.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/multimedia/clark-scallops-sorrel/clark-scallops-sorrel-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/multimedia/clark-scallops-sorrel/clark-scallops-sorrel-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'c