ctic taste in music, including Loretta Lynn, Bob Dylan and Beyoncé among her favorites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/arts/music/lily-allen-at-home-in-england.html', 'snippet': 'The British singer Lily Allen, who named her new album “Sheezus,” has eclectic taste in music, including Loretta Lynn, Bob Dylan and Beyoncé among her favorites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The British singer Lily Allen was at her home in the English countryside, baking a carrot cake, complete with marzipan carrots. “This is like my third one with these particular carrots, and I’ve kind of got it down,” she said by telephone. “I’m quite pleased.” She posted a photo of the perfectly turned-out cake, frosted and dusted with powdered sugar, on her Instagram account, with the hashtag Sheezus, the name of her new album. For Ms. Allen, 29, domestic bliss can align with pop stardom. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/arts/11SUBPLAYLIST1/11SUBPLAYLIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/arts/11SUBPLAYLIST1/11SUBPLAYLIST1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 736}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/arts/11SUBPLAYLIST1/11SUBPLAYLIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 835, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/arts/11SUBPLAYLIST1/11SUBPLAYLIST1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1670, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/arts/11SUBPLAYLIST1/11SUBPLAYLIST1-t