is free online.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/arts/television/penny-dreadful-showtimes-supernatural-entry.html', 'snippet': 'A new niche for horror TV, this time with a literary bent, in Victorian England, on Showtime. The first episode is free online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Television is clogged with lurid supernatural fare these days — “Salem,” “The Walking Dead,” “American Horror Story,” “The Originals” — so staking out a distinctive place within the genre isn’t easy. “Penny Dreadful” tries to do so with a combination of literary allusion, fine acting, patience and fearlessness, which, at least for the first two episodes, clicks deliciously. Oh dear; another show to add to our ever-growing guilty-pleasure lists.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1004, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1004}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 612, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1625, 'width': 971, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/10/arts/10PENNY/10PENNY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75,