: None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83b6a43c-d984-50ae-a4e0-a83ffb13e0ec', 'word_count': 1416, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83b6a43c-d984-50ae-a4e0-a83ffb13e0ec'}, {'abstract': 'After the problems with the Chevrolet Cobalt, there have been calls for the black boxes in cars to provide the large amount of information now recorded by black boxes in airplanes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/business/experts-seek-smarter-black-boxes-for-cars-and-trucks.html', 'snippet': 'After the problems with the Chevrolet Cobalt, there have been calls for the black boxes in cars to provide the large amount of information now recorded by black boxes in airplanes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A design flaw in the Chevrolet Cobalt and other small cars has led to deaths and injuries for at least a decade, but the analysts at the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration never opened an investigation. All through that period, a few blocks away at a sister agency within the Transportation Department, safety experts were using a program that made extensive use of vehicle data to spot defects and dangerous trends.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/business/Blackbox/Blackbox-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/10/business/Blackbox/Blackbox-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/business/Blackbox/Blackbox-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/