03a9'}, {'abstract': 'The Office of the Director of National Intelligence sent an internal memo to its work force on Friday about its new policy on pre-publication reviews.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/us/politics/memo-revisits-policy-on-citing-leaked-material-to-some-confusion.html', 'snippet': 'The Office of the Director of National Intelligence sent an internal memo to its work force on Friday about its new policy on pre-publication reviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Office of the Director of National Intelligence sent an internal memo to its work force on Friday saying that its new policy on pre-publication review of speeches, books, articles, term papers and other writings permits current and former employees to refer to news articles as long as the officials do not confirm any classified information.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Memo Revisits Policy on Citing Leaked Material, to Some Confusion', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Memo Revisits Policy on Citing Leaked Material, to Some Confusion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Espionage and Intelligence Services', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Director of National Intelligence', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-10T00:50:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'o