ed', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/acbda3af-f343-5848-b2d5-c81dd7b15b4a', 'word_count': 601, 'uri': 'nyt://article/acbda3af-f343-5848-b2d5-c81dd7b15b4a'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Herald remembers the opera singer Lillian Nordica who passed away in 1914.', 'web_url': 'https://iht-retrospective.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/1914-lillian-nordica-succumbs-to-pneumonia/', 'snippet': 'The New York Herald remembers the opera singer Lillian Nordica who passed away in 1914.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BATAVIA, Java — Mme. Nordica was on board the steamship Tasman when that vessel ran ashore in the Torres Straits of the Gulf of Papua on December 27 of last year. The liner got off and proceeded to Thursday Island, which was reached on December 31. All were well on board, with the exception of the prima donna, who was then suffering from nervous prostration. Finally, on reaching Java, it became evident she could go no further for some time to come. After remaining at Batavia for several weeks, she has succumbed in consequence of her determination.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/blogs/10iht-Nordica-art/10iht-Nordica-art-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 492, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/blogs/10iht-Nordica-art/10iht-Nordica-art-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 492, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/10/blogs/10iht-Nordica-art/10iht-Nordica-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/10/blogs/10iht-No