0da4bf-ce32-506e-a266-07867c905ddf'}, {'abstract': 'BurgerFuel hopes a partnership with Subway restaurants and an emphasis on quality and car culture can lure American diners in a competitive industry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/10/business/international/an-upscale-burger-chain-from-new-zealand-aims-at-us.html', 'snippet': 'BurgerFuel hopes a partnership with Subway restaurants and an emphasis on quality and car culture can lure American diners in a competitive industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUCKLAND, New Zealand — Inside the headquarters of BurgerFuel Worldwide is a spray-painted mural of a skull wearing a combat helmet emblazoned with the slogan “Born to Grill.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'An Upscale Burger Chain From New Zealand Aims at U.S.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fast Food Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Zealand', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hamburgers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Subway Restaurants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-10T16:15:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Hutchison', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hutchison', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/837e3ab4-36d9-5d23-91ff-d439351a6470', 'word_count': 1187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/837e3ab4-36d9-5d23-91ff-d439351a6470'}, {'abstract': 'A summer spent as an extra in movies and television shows was supposed to be rejuvenating. It was often anything but.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/jobs/suspended-animation-on-a-hollywood-set.html', 'snippet': 'A summer spent as an extra in movies and television shows was supposed to be rejuvenating. It was often anything but.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The director yelled “Action!” I could feel the wheels of the gurney moving but had no idea where I was headed: I had been instructed to keep my eyes closed. (Was I dead? In a coma? Asleep? Catatonic? No back story was proffered.) There was a quick turn to the left, then a straightaway for 10 feet or so, then another turn, this one to the right. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1349, 'width': 1964, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/11/business/11ONWORK4C/11ONWORK4C-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2