 even a young Asian man to serve sherry to such bewildered hicks as straggled in from time to time.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lost Booksellers of New York', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lost Booksellers of New York', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McMurtry, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Andreas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steloff, Frances (1887-1989)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohn, Marguerite Arnold (1887-1984)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirschenbaum, David (1895-1994)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seven Gables Bookshop (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Book Shop (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Books Ltd (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Strand Bookstore (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ursus Books and Prints (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gotham Book Mart (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Argosy Book Store (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-10T18:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Larry McMurtry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Larry', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McMurtry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c9b7e5f-5241-50bf-a0d5-49b7ac16db64', 'word_count': 843, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c9b7e5f-5241-50bf-a0d5-49b7ac16db64'}, {'abstract': 'The corporate university doesn’t want to hear about sexual assault.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/opinion/sunday/douthat-rape-and-the-college-brand.html', 'snippet': 'The corporate university doesn’t want to hear about sexual assault.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN last week’s column, I wrote about the connection between college social life and socioeconomic stratification, and the way the party scene at many universities, oriented toward heavy drinking and hooking up, creates distinctive challenges for working-class students, whether they’re attracted to its thrills or alienated by its excesses.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/douthat-circular/douthat-circular-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/douthat-circular/douthat-circular-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/douthat-circular/douthat-circular-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/douthat-circular/douthat-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/douthat-circular/douthat-circular-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargew