8531b6c7e8'}, {'abstract': 'Picking seven players with no history of off-the-field scandals or insubordination, the Giants are hoping for immediate and enduring contributions from their draft selections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/sports/football/with-clean-picks-giants-look-beyond-talent.html', 'snippet': 'Picking seven players with no history of off-the-field scandals or insubordination, the Giants are hoping for immediate and enduring contributions from their draft selections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Five of the Giants’ seven 2014 draft picks were team captains in college. Two were National Honor Society members. One is an academic all-American who spent an off-season building homes in Haiti’s poorest neighborhoods. Another graduated from college early and is writing a book.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/giants/giants-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/giants/giants-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/giants/giants-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/giants/giants-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/giants/giants-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 