 C. Sabathia gave up three home runs, two in the third inning, and the Brewers scored a run in the bottom of the seventh to edge the Yankees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/sports/baseball/sabathia-doesnt-lose-but-he-doesnt-have-encouraging-outing.html', 'snippet': 'C. C. Sabathia gave up three home runs, two in the third inning, and the Brewers scored a run in the bottom of the seventh to edge the Yankees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILWAUKEE — The fans at Miller Park cheered C. C. Sabathia when he walked to the mound for the first time Saturday. They also gave him a standing ovation when he came to the plate in his first at-bat. The appreciative cheers were in recognition of the fine work Sabathia did for the Brewers in 2008, even if it was almost six years ago and only for three months.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 761, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1522, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/yankees-1/yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'leg