rclays Center and lifted by their reserves and role players, beat Miami to cut their series deficit to 2-1.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/11/sports/basketball/with-newfound-purpose-nets-storm-back-to-slow-heats-momentum.html', 'snippet': 'The Nets, inspired by a vibrant crowd at Barclays Center and lifted by their reserves and role players, beat Miami to cut their series deficit to 2-1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Nets have spent a huge sum of money to assemble a roster intended to challenge the Miami Heat, the N.B.A.’s two-time defending champions and the standard-bearers of the league. On Saturday night, the Nets received contributions from every corner of that roster to deliver a vital counterpunch in this Eastern Conference semifinal series.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/nets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/nets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/nets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 823, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/nets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1646, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/NETS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/11/sports/NETS-1/NETS-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 't