imes', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, March 24, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T04:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/28b156d6-2054-58cc-86bd-1afbc659894f', 'word_count': 44, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28b156d6-2054-58cc-86bd-1afbc659894f'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, March 23, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/03/23/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-sunday-march-23-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, March 23, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The industry does not like uncertainty. We will find out what happened.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, March 23, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T04:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/e644ac8c-de5c-514e-9710-b7b3b12542bf', 'word_count': 29, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e644ac8c-de5c-514e-9710-b7b3b12542bf'}, {'abstract': 'The singer, who is 68 this month, unleashed feathers and glitter at the Barclays Center in Brooklyn.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/arts/music/in-las-vegas-style-spectacle-cher-flaunts-strength-staying-power-and-physique.html', 'snippet': 'The singer, who is 68 this month, unleashed feathers and glitter at the Barclays Center in Brooklyn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one has to put Cher on a pedestal. She did it herself to start her show at the Barclays Center in Brooklyn on Friday night, as part of her D2K (for “Dressed to Kill”) tour. When a curtain dropped, there she was on a pillar in a giant feathered headdress and a silver-and-sheer dress that flaunted her flanks. “I’m strong, I’m strong enough to rise above,” she sang in her 2013 single, “Woman’s World,” and no one who’s heard Cher repeatedly ascend the pop charts since the 1960s would doubt it.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/12Cher-1/12Cher-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumb