 Sunday, January 12, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/12/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-january-12-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 12, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“He was not an ideologue; he was a political architect. As a military man he knew one thing from the battlefield — you have to seize the initiative, you have to be the one driving the action.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for January 12, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T04:22:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0f474be-291b-52ed-b118-8550439ebfe3', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0f474be-291b-52ed-b118-8550439ebfe3'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 5, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/05/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-sunday-january-5-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 5, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I think we are witnessing a turning point, and it could be one of the worst in all our history. The West is not there, and we are in the hands of two regional powers, the Saudis and Iranians, each of which is fanatical in its own way. I don’t see how they can reach any entente, any rational solution.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, January 5, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T04:23:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/2672ec0f-43a0-5797-a3c2-ea9dc2b16e83', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2672ec0f-43a0-5797-a3c2-ea9dc2b16e83'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, January 1, 2014', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/01/01/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-wednesday-january-1-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, January 1, 2014', 'lead_paragraph': '“De Blasio matters. A lot of us are counting on his success.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Wednesday, January 1, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T04:23:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/5e6c90b6-2e03-51a4-ae81-7765e6cc921d', 'word_count': 37, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5e6c90b6-2e03-51a4-ae81-7765e6cc921d'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, December 30, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/12/30/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-monday-december-30-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, December 30, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '“A father just wants to see his children grow up. Now my children are gone. My wife is gone. Can I ever be happy again?”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Monday, December 30, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-0