i led Ensemble ACJW on Saturday at Zankel Hall in a portrait of the chamber orchestra over the last 100 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/arts/music/ensemble-acjw-at-zankel-hall.html', 'snippet': 'Susanna Malkki led Ensemble ACJW on Saturday at Zankel Hall in a portrait of the chamber orchestra over the last 100 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Part of the pleasure of hearing Ensemble ACJW, the group of young professionals formed under the auspices of Carnegie Hall and the Juilliard School, is considering the myriad options that lie before its members. Will they end up as soloists, orchestral players, educators, entrepreneurs?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chamber Orchestra Works, From Intense to Zany', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chamber Orchestra Works, From Intense to Zany', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woolfe, Zachary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ensemble ACJW', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Malkki, Susanna', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T20:28:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zachary Woolfe', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zachary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Woolfe', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d71f2f1-d861-5f48-b179-91392c685354', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d71f2f1-d861-5f48-b179-91392c685354'}, {'abstract': 'Miki Orihara explores the links between modern choreography and older works in a solo concert.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/arts/dance/miki-orihara-links-todays-choreography-with-yesteryears.html', 'snippet': 'Miki Orihara explores the links between modern choreography and older works in a solo concert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For nearly 30 years, Miki Orihara has been a stalwart member of the Martha Graham Dance Company. Such dedication is an implicit statement of belief in the continued relevance of classic modern dance. But in the program notes for “Resonance,” the solo concert she performed at the La MaMa Moves festival Friday, Ms. Orihara was explicit, arguing for the timelessness of older works and their connections to present-day choreography and concerns. With five short pieces, she danced her case in chronological order. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1410, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/ORIHARA/ORIHARA-thumbStanda