Symphony Orchestra played the final offering of the visionary Spring for Music festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/arts/music/the-pittburgh-symphony-orchestra-plays-at-carnegie-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The Pittsburgh Symphony Orchestra played the final offering of the visionary Spring for Music festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pittsburgh Symphony Orchestra ended the 2014 Spring for Music festival on Saturday night at Carnegie Hall by playing works that shared the theme of spirituality, but of a grim sort, touching on martyrdom, apocalyptic scenes and death and containing an element of gallows humor. This was not just the sixth and last concert of this year’s festival, but the final offering of the whole visionary venture.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 327}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 558, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1116, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/finale1/finale1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbna