', 'value': 'Stress Test: Reflections on Financial Crises (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T21:52:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michiko Kakutani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michiko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kakutani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/35a18375-1942-508b-80bd-8522e7f68a27', 'word_count': 1521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35a18375-1942-508b-80bd-8522e7f68a27'}, {'abstract': 'The daylong annual McDonald’s Gospelfest at the Prudential Center in Newark included many of the greatest living female gospel singers, preceded by a national singing competition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/arts/music/women-who-worship-at-mcdonalds-gospelfest-in-newark.html', 'snippet': 'The daylong annual McDonald’s Gospelfest at the Prudential Center in Newark included many of the greatest living female gospel singers, preceded by a national singing competition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWARK — Consider Erica Campbell, at the McDonald’s Gospelfest Saturday night at the Prudential Center. She’s got the No. 1 album on the Billboard gospel chart, and co-stars in a successful reality show, “Mary Mary,” on We TV. She’s a personage in this precinct, a cross-media star, from whom you’d expect some kind of show. She brought one: herself. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Night of Gospel, Spanning Generations', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Night of Gospel, Spanning Generations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gospel Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Campbell, Erica', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caesar, Shirley', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Houston, Cissy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adams, Yolanda', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, Hezekiah', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cobbs, Tasha', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "McDonald's Corporation", 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-11T21:55:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Ratliff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ratliff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/80e409b5-4a11-561e-aa6f-354422490d46', 'word_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/80e409b5-4a11-561e-aa6f-354422490d46'}, {'abstract': 'Larry Wilmore, a seasoned television writer and producer and “Daily Show” regular, prepares to lead his own commentators on “The Minority Report With Larry Wilmore.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/business/media/larry-wilmore-is-ready-for-the-minority-report.html', 'snippet': 'Larry Wilmore, a seasoned television writer and producer and “Daily Show” regular, prepares to lead his own commentators on “The Minority Report With Larry Wilmore.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Larry Wilmore, named on Friday as host of “The Minority Report,” the show that will fill the 11:30 p.m. slot on Comedy Central, thought the time had passed for him to receive his own late-night show.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/arts/larry/larry-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 725, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'x