stract': 'We used to pull prices out of the air. Then we created a system to estimate the cost of labor and materials — but the system is becoming increasingly flawed.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/the-constant-struggle-to-put-a-price-on-custom-work/', 'snippet': 'We used to pull prices out of the air. Then we created a system to estimate the cost of labor and materials — but the system is becoming increasingly flawed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have two risky projects underway at the moment. The first is to replace our website because it has an unworkable administrative portal and doesn’t display well on mobile devices. The second is related to how we price our conference tables.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Constant Struggle to Put a Price on Custom Work', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downs, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paul Downs Cabinetmakers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-12T11:00:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Downs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7846de65-55cf-53fc-a8e2-026113d86c51', 'word_count': 1690, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7846de65-55cf-53fc-a8e2-026113d86c51'}, {'abstract': 'On Mondays, we publish a Times photo without a caption, headline or other information about its origins. Join the conversation by posting about what you see, and why. A live discussion is offered from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. Eastern time.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/whats-going-on-in-this-picture-may-12-2014/', 'snippet': 'On Mondays, we publish a Times photo without a caption, headline or other information about its origins. Join the conversation by posting about what you see, and why. A live discussion is offered from 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. Eastern time.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Updated: May 13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Going On in This Picture? | May 12, 2014', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-12T11:00:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/327ac9d8-27cc-5797-b1f1-983b131f8faf', 'word_count': 281, 'uri': 'nyt://article/327ac9d8-27cc-5797-b1f1-983b131f8faf'}, {'abstract': 'Economists as cuttlefish.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/desperately-seeking-irrelevance/', 'snippet': 'Economists as cuttlefish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simon Wren-Lewis says most of what needs to be said in response to Tony Yates. But I think it’s important to highlight the self-destructiveness of the attitude on display.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Desperately Seeking Irrelevance', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-12T11:06:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20da3b2f-5480-50dd-8044-eef4eb3d2fc3', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20da3b2f-5480-50dd-8044-eef4eb3d2fc3'}, {'abstract': 'The American pharmaceutical giant is trying to convince British lawmakers that a Pfizer-AstraZeneca combination is viable.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/pfizer-and-astrazeneca-step-up-war-of-words-over-potential-merger/', 'snippet': 'The American pharmaceutical giant is trying to convince British lawmakers that a Pfizer-AstraZeneca combination is viable.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 7:37 p.m. | LONDON – Pfizer pledged on Monday to keep jobs in Britain if it succeeds in taking over the British drug maker AstraZeneca, and it questioned whether AstraZeneca can stand on its own much longer.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/dbpix-drug2/dbpix-drug2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/13/business/dbpix-drug2/dbpix-drug2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/dbpix-drug2/dbpix-drug2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/dbpix-drug2/dbpix-drug2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'l