'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8028602-229a-53ca-a22b-f5aa54ebb5b6', 'word_count': 1839, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8028602-229a-53ca-a22b-f5aa54ebb5b6'}, {'abstract': 'The Muslims of the ancient city of Varanasi are drawn to Arvind Kejriwal of the Aam Aadmi Party, both for his inclusive message and his willingness to take on the Bharatiya Janata Party’s Narendra Modi.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/in-final-lap-varanasis-muslims-rally-behind-kejriwal/', 'snippet': 'The Muslims of the ancient city of Varanasi are drawn to Arvind Kejriwal of the Aam Aadmi Party, both for his inclusive message and his willingness to take on the Bharatiya Janata Party’s Narendra Modi.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VARANASI, India – On Saturday morning, Sajid Ali, 29, drove his motorcycle through the narrow, winding lanes of Machodari, a predominantly Muslim neighborhood of weavers and artisans. Mr. Ali makes his living as a wholesale dealer, a middleman who sells the city’s famous saris from weavers to retailers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/world/asia/12-varanasi-indiaink/12-varanasi-indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/12/world/asia/12-varanasi-indiaink/12-varanasi-indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/world/asia/12-varanasi-indiaink/12-varanasi-indiaink-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 635, 'width': 919, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/world/asia/12-varanasi-indiaink/12-varanasi-indiaink-s