s', 'byline': {'original': 'By Logan Hill', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Logan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hill', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/aeefe20d-4166-5aa3-b471-1cd411132bea', 'word_count': 1361, 'uri': 'nyt://article/aeefe20d-4166-5aa3-b471-1cd411132bea'}, {'abstract': 'Without the budget for big media campaigns, the party has mobilized its network of volunteers to mount a challenge in the most old-fashioned of ways: by spreading their message by one-on-one interactions with voters.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/short-on-resources-aam-aadmi-party-volunteers-canvass-for-votes-on-foot/', 'snippet': 'Without the budget for big media campaigns, the party has mobilized its network of volunteers to mount a challenge in the most old-fashioned of ways: by spreading their message by one-on-one interactions with voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VARANASI, India – On Thursday morning, Rajesh Nagar, 45, a former employee of the Indian Navy, led a team of three students to campaign for Arvind Kejriwal, the leader of the Aam Aadmi Party. Mr. Kejriwal is opposing Narendra Modi, the prime minister candidate of the Bharatiya Janata Party, in a parliamentary race here that has captivated India.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Short on Resources, Aam Aadmi Party Volunteers Canvass for Votes on Foot', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Volunteers and Community Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kejriwal, Arvind', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Modi, Narendra', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aam Aadmi Party (India)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delhi (India)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Varanasi (India)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-12T14:23:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vaibhav Vats', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vaibhav', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vats', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/912f0152-c473-57c7-bd18-0091f6eda706', 'word_count': 1089, 'uri': 'nyt://article/912f0152-c473-57c7-bd18-0091f6eda706'}, {'abstract': 'This spring and summer season, the Hudson Valley sculpture park debuts an exhibition of Zhang Huan’s work and a site-specific installation by Virginia Overton.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/on-view-two-new-projects-at-storm-king-beckon-art-lovers-upstate/', 'snippet': 'This spring and summer season, the Hudson Valley sculpture park debuts an exhibition of Zhang Huan’s work and a site-specific installation by Virginia Overton.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that the frenzy of Frieze weekend has passed, art lovers may be feeling the impulse to ditch the crowds, flee the city and light out for the territory. Fortunately, New York’s outlying regions offer abundant reasons to make the reverse cultural commute, and this spring, Storm King Art Center announces two new ones: the just-opened exhibition “Zhang Huan: Evoking Tradition” and a newly commissioned installation by the sculptor Virginia Overton.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/12/t-magazine/12storm-bengal1/09storm-bengal1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two New Projects at Storm King Beckon Art Lovers Upstate', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Overton, Virginia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name':