tract': 'Victims of bullying had high levels of C-reactive protein, a marker for inflammation, which may be one reason they tend to have more health problems over the long term than children who aren’t bullied.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/12/being-bullied-is-bad-for-your-health/', 'snippet': 'Victims of bullying had high levels of C-reactive protein, a marker for inflammation, which may be one reason they tend to have more health problems over the long term than children who aren’t bullied.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Victims of bullying may develop long-term physical and mental health problems, and now researchers have found one possible reason: Being bullied raises the blood’s level of C-reactive protein, or CRP, a marker of systemic inflammation and a risk factor for cardiovascular and other diseases.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 217, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 215, 'width': 217, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/05/07/health/well-prevention/well-prevention-thumbLarge.jp