3227d7d7f69', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/557caf5f-33d2-519b-9e40-d3227d7d7f69'}, {'abstract': 'The new chief in New York City has promised to end racial discrimination in the department, but it will take more than words to fight the entrenched problem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/opinion/a-new-fire-commissioner.html', 'snippet': 'The new chief in New York City has promised to end racial discrimination in the department, but it will take more than words to fight the entrenched problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In more than three decades as a firefighter, New York City’s new fire commissioner has had a close-up view of the entrenched racial discrimination that led the Justice Department to sue the city, resulting in a court ordering sweeping changes in the department’s hiring policies. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Fire Commissioner', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A New Fire Commissioner ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nigro, Daniel A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Minorities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fire Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T01:07:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb1c3dd6-16ad-5f67-8c78-14c6aa2a63b3', 'word_count': 497, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb1c3dd6-16ad-5f67-8c78-14c6aa2a63b3'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Coughlin, the editor of a small North Carolina paper, oversaw coverage that earned a Pulitzer Prize for public service in 1990.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/business/media/william-coughlin-91-dies-editor-exemplar.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Coughlin, the editor of a small North Carolina paper, oversaw coverage that earned a Pulitzer Prize for public service in 1990.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William J. Coughlin, who after a career as a globe-trotting correspondent landed in a small North Carolina town where he led the local newspaper’s Pulitzer Prize-winning exposure of carcinogens in municipal drinking water, died on Thursday in Bolivia, N.C. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/COUGHLIN-obit/COUGHLIN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/13/business/COUGHLIN-obit/COUGHLIN-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/COUGHLIN-obit/COUGHLIN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 539, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/COUGHLIN-obit/COUGHLIN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1078, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/business/COUGHLIN-obit/COUGHLIN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'