-snub-and-to-a-raid-of-a-delegates-jet.html', 'snippet': 'The plane carrying a group of delegates was turned back by both Ukraine and Romania, and was grounded in Moldova and raided by the local police.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — It began with a state visit by senior Russian officials to a separatist enclave in another country. It ended with Russia threatening economic retribution against several European nations on Monday, after the plane carrying the delegation was grounded in Moldova and raided by the local police.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Vows ‘Harsh’ Response to Airspace Snub and to Raid of a Delegates’ Jet', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia Vows ‘Harsh’ Response to Airspace Snub and to a Raid of a Delegates’ Jet', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roth, Andrew', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moldova', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rogozin, Dmitri O', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'USSR (Former Soviet Union)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Medvedev, Dmitri A', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Romania', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T03:16:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Roth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename':