ials would not estimate the number of people who were still missing, but at least 200 were rescued from the Mediterranean Sea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/world/europe/at-least-14-die-as-migrant-boat-headed-for-italy-sinks-off-libyan-coast.html', 'snippet': 'Italian officials would not estimate the number of people who were still missing, but at least 200 were rescued from the Mediterranean Sea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — A boat packed with hundreds of migrants trying to reach Europe sank in the Mediterranean Sea about 45 miles off the Libyan coast on Monday. At least 14 people died, but more than 200 were rescued in an operation led by the Italian Navy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Least 14 Die as Migrant Boat Headed for Italy Sinks off Libyan Coast', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Least 14 Die as Migrant Boat Headed for Italy Sinks off Libyan Coast', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mediterranean Sea', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mare Nostrum', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and Africa Migrant Crisis', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T03:32:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person':