arity for the Police Department, whose aviation officers rarely have a chance to perform the sort of hiker-rescue operations common to more rugged jurisdictions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It began as a Mother’s Day hike with family and ended like a scene from some Rocky Mountain adventure film: an injured hiker, unable to get down from a treacherous cliffside trail; a rescuer descending by rope from a hovering helicopter.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York City Police Helicopter Rescues Injured Hiker', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City Police Helicopter Rescues Injured Hiker', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rescues', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hikes and Hiking', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALPINE (NJ)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Palisades Interstate Park of NY and NJ', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graham, Amanda', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T04:12:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75f65e53-0056-57c3-b188-b61210708ce4', 'word_count': 633, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75f65e53-0056-57c3-b188-b61210708ce4'}, {'abstract': 'The former Treasury secretary talks about some of the charts he included in his memoir and why they are particularly significant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.co