, 'word_count': 705, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2399426d-82f0-53cf-8628-76607dc3063b'}, {'abstract': 'The violinist performs the Gigue from Bach’s Partita No. 3.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/in-performance-gil-shaham/', 'snippet': 'The violinist performs the Gigue from Bach’s Partita No. 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s In Performance video features the violinist Gil Shaham in a performance of the Gigue from Bach’s Partita No. 3. On May 18 Mr. Shaham will join the Bavarian Radio Symphony Orchestra at Carnegie Hall for a performance of Berg’s Violin Concerto. His most recent album, “1930s Violin Concertos,” a two-CD set released in February, is a compilation of performances of five works, mostly recorded live with major orchestras. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Performance: Gil Shaham', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T15:22:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5b9f840-99d6-5aba-88e8-49752f2372cd', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5b9f840-99d6-5aba-88e8-49752f2372cd'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Stemme will sing the role in the third of three full “Ring” cycles that Washington plans to mount in the spring of 2016.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/nina-stemme-to-sing-brunnhilde-in-washington-operas-ring/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Stemme will sing the role in the third of three full “Ring” cycles that Washington plans to mount in the spring of 2016.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the world’s most sought-after Brünnhildes, the Swedish soprano Nina Stemme, \xa0will sing the role in the nation’s capital in 2016 when Washington National Opera stages Wagner’s complete “Ring” cycle for the first time, after money woes curtailed a previous effort.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 869, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 869}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 707, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1414, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/arts/13artsbeat-nina/13artsbeat-nina-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Nina Stemme to Sing Brünnhilde in Washington Opera’s ‘Ring’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stemme, Nina', 'rank': 