es of abandoned courts dot the landscape in various states of ruin. The pictures were part of the photographer Kenneth O Halloran’s M.F.A. thesis at the University of Ulster last year. It’s the latest in a series of his personal projects with Irish themes, including Tales From the Promised Land, which documented the collapse of the country’s real estate market. The magazine has featured O Halloran’s pictures of dancers at the World Irish Dancing Championships and, most recently, from his trek up Croagh Patrick. Recently I asked him about this latest project of his.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1565, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/08/magazine/handball-blog-1/handball-blog-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No