/highbridge-capital-continues-hiring-spree-in-london/', 'snippet': 'Highbridge Capital Management is expanding its team in Europe, where hedge funds and private equity firms are looking for ways to take part in the region’s slow emergence from financial crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 2:06 p.m. | ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Highbridge Capital Continues Hiring Spree in London', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T15:59:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexandra Stevenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexandra', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stevenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af19e828-a4c1-56cd-8e56-443427524f0f', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af19e828-a4c1-56cd-8e56-443427524f0f'}, {'abstract': 'Airbnb would like to eventually be all things to all travelers, as it introduces two new features that cater to a different sort of guest: the impulsive, the dawdler, the last-minute planner.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/for-late-arrivals-airbnb-broadens-its-approach/', 'snippet': 'Airbnb would like to eventually be all things to all travelers, as it introduces two new features that cater to a different sort of guest: the impulsive, the dawdler, the last-minute planner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the popular imagination, Airbnb is something slightly complicated. It is best known, for instance, for making that long-awaited trip to Paris more interesting and less expensive. But how often does one go to Paris? So the company is broadening its ambitions to appeal to other sorts of travelers. It is introducing Tuesday two new features that cater to a different sort of guest: the impulsive type, the dawdler, the last-minute planner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 1167, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1167}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 527, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1750, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/13/technology/13bits-airbnb/13bits-airbnb-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Late Arrivals, Airbnb Broadens Its Approach', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizati