': 'nyt://article/ae477350-63fc-5fee-9af3-99b8b3493146'}, {'abstract': 'With so many cameras pointed directly at a once untouched land, the real tragedy of one of the worst natural disasters in Afghan history was quite simple. With noise all around, the story of the land and the people who had made a home here had been silenced.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/a-tragedy-of-silence-in-badakhshan/', 'snippet': 'With so many cameras pointed directly at a once untouched land, the real tragedy of one of the worst natural disasters in Afghan history was quite simple. With noise all around, the story of the land and the people who had made a home here had bee...', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABI BARAK, Afghanistan — Hidden in a valley of the Hindu Kush range, the village of Abi Barik went mostly unnoticed for decades. The hour-plus journey it takes to get to the provincial capital from here, along a rugged and unpaved mountain road, ensured that the residents largely kept to themselves.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Tragedy of Silence in Badakhshan', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disasters and Emergencies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Abi Barak (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Badakhshan Province (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T20:09:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ali M. Latifi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ali', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_o