’s documentary “American Jesus” samples the outliers of Christianity in the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/14/movies/american-jesus-looks-at-unusual-versions-of-christianity.html', 'snippet': 'Aram Garriga’s documentary “American Jesus” samples the outliers of Christianity in the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not clear what Aram Garriga thinks he is accomplishing in his simplistic “American Jesus,” but he’s not accomplishing much. Whatever hopes you might have had that this Spanish filmmaker would be able to do for American Christianity what another outsider, Alexis de Tocqueville, did for America as a whole are dashed as soon as the snake-handling minister shows up.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 320, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 320}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 546, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 999, 'width': 1873, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14AMERICAN4/14AMERICAN4-thumbStandard.jpg', 