Rossini’s “La Cenerentola” and an evening performance of Bellini’s “I Puritani.” On this final day, the Met presented two of the three reigning bel canto tenors who had such success at the house this spring: Juan Diego Flórez as the prince in “Cenerentola,” and Lawrence Brownlee as Arturo in “Puritani.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 530, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 530}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 904, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1808, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/arts/14OPERA/14OPERA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Look Back at a Year of Top Voices', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Look Back at a Year of Top V