rounds up his favorites from the second annual collectible design fair in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/13/the-collections-the-top-10-moments-at-collective-2-fair/', 'snippet': 'T’s design editor rounds up his favorites from the second annual collectible design fair in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sunday marked the end of the second annual collectible design fair, Collective 2. For the event’s sophomore edition, the organizers chose a new more central venue, Skylight at Moynihan Station — housed in the imposing former James A. Farley Post Office on 33rd Street — and added 17 new dealers. The fair’s founder, Steven Learner, is determined to differentiate Collective from the rest of New York Design Week — and every detail, from the carefully curated roster of galleries to the vintage Cadillac exhibited by the event’s sponsor, reinforced its distinctiveness. Here, a few of the best in show.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Collections | The Top 10 Moments at Collective 2 Fair', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-13T22:35:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Delavan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Delavan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dfb471ac-2b11-5134-925c-19b3ab264388', 'word_count': 99, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dfb471ac-2b11-5134-925c-19b3ab264388'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court in New York squashed a subpoena served to Airbnb by the state’s attorney general that sought information about the start-up’s users.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.