 three friends of Dzhokhar Tsarnaev, the marathon bombing suspect.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — A federal judge on Tuesday said he wanted to try to find juries in Boston for the trials of three friends of Dzhokhar Tsarnaev, the suspect in last year’s marathon bombings. But he indicated that if impartial jurors could not be found here, he might seek a jury from Springfield, Mass., about 90 miles west.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Wants Trials for 3 in Bombing Case to Stay in Boston', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Seeks to Avoid Moving Bombing Trials From Boston', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsarnaev, Dzhokhar A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodlock, Douglas P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jury System', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phillipos, Robel', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kadyrbayev, Dias', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tazhayakov, Azamat', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Springfield (Mass)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-14T01:07:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67db4699-5069-5dc1-9ed2-93431699b0df', 'word_count': 599, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67db4699-5069-5dc1-9ed2-93431699b0df'}, 