https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/15/upshot/how-to-turn-renters-into-savers.html', 'snippet': 'Owning a home nudges people to set aside money for the future, but a mortgage doesn’t have to be the only vehicle that encourages saving.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some people didn’t like my post on housing-as-food, which illustrated how pro-home ownership policies distorted behavior and the economy. The best pro-housing response I’ve seen (from Megan McArdle, among others) was that homeownership encourages families to save.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/upshot/15up-housing/15up-housing-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Turn Renters Into Savers', 'kicker': 'Rent vs. Buy', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-14T11:20:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Barro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48d682c4-b830-5375-a8c3-a3575e38578c', 'word_count': 713, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48d682c4-b830-5375-a8c3-a3575e38578c'}, {'abstract': 'An analysis of polls shows Republican voters disagree with one another more than Democrats do, suggesting post-2014 challenges.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/15/upshot/democrats-are-unified-gop-is-unified-only-in-opposing-obama.html', 'snippet': 'An analysis of polls shows Republican voters disagree with one another more than Democrats do, suggesting post-2014 challenges.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two prominent Republicans have broken with fellow party members on big issues in recent days: Rand Paul said Republicans shouldn\'t "go too crazy" with stricter voting laws, although he later softened that stance, and Mitt Romney said he favored raising the minimum wage. Similarly, Jeb Bush and Marco Rubio have indicated in recent years that they would be open to reworking the nation’s laws on illegal immigration, a stand that runs counter to the views of most conservatives.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-articleLarge-v2.png', 'height': 111, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-articleLarge-v2.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 111}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 190, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 234, 'width': 1260, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/upshot/14up-unitychart-1400019378089/14up-unitychart-1400019378089-thumbLarge-v2.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Democrats Are Unified; G.O.P. Is Unified Only in Opposing Obama', 'kicker'