“has only just begun heading back toward normal.” Forecasts for growth and inflation remained the same.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/15/business/international/bank-of-england-tempers-expectations-of-a-rate-increase.html', 'snippet': 'Britain’s central bank head said the economy “has only just begun heading back toward normal.” Forecasts for growth and inflation remained the same.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The Bank of England on Wednesday left unchanged its forecasts for growth and inflation in Britain, and indicated that the central bank was getting closer to the point at which it would need to gradually start raising interest rates. Analysts expect the bank to raise its record-low lending rate of 0.5 percent in the first half of next year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bank of England Tempers Expectations of a Rate Increase', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of England', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carney, Mark J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-14T14:54:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenny Anderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28ab7f50-c840-5cb3-afb7-276a62d00218', 'word_count': 668, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28ab7f50-c840-5cb3-afb7-276a62d00218'}, {'abstract': 'Changing behavior isn’t easy, but carrying out good health practices in communities for all to see can be contagious.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/14/peer-pressure-can-be-a-lifesaver/', 'snippet': 'Changing behavior isn’t easy, but carrying out good health practices in communities for all to see can be contagious.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When we hear that someone succumbed to peer pressure or conformed to group expectations, we are inclined to think about it in negative terms. We imagine a young person smoking his first cigarette or an adult parroting the consensus of her community. We know that these social forces can cause people to act in ways that are harmful to themselves and others; but every day we are discovering more ways that they can be harnessed to solve problems in health, education and other areas. This is crucial. For decades, development organizations have spent billions of dollars developing medicines, installing wells, or building clinics or schools that people have not fully used, if they have used them at all.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-jumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/04/25/opinion/opinionator-pog-fixes/opinionator-pog-fixes-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'sub