al mine, anger at the authorities boiled over during a visit by Prime Minister Recep Tayyip Erdogan, who was booed and called a “killer” by protesters.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/14/turkish-prime-minister-jeered-after-mine-disaster/', 'snippet': 'Following a disaster in a coal mine, anger at the authorities boiled over during a visit by Prime Minister Recep Tayyip Erdogan, who was booed and called a “killer” by protesters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, Friday, 9:12 a.m. | As rescuers battled Wednesday to save the lives of coal miners trapped underground in western Turkey, more than 24 hours after an explosion killed at least 274 at the site, anger at the authorities boiled over during a visit by Prime Minister Recep Tayyip Erdogan, who was booed and briefly forced to seek refuge in a shop in the nearby town of Soma.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkish Prime Minister Jeered After Mine Disaster', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soma, Turkey, Mining Disaster (2014)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erdogan, Recep Tayyip', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Soma (Turkey)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-14T20:54:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8