ugh Sunday in Phoenix.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The trial to select the USA-1 team for next year’s Bermuda Bowl world championship in India continues through Sunday in Phoenix. Sixteen teams entered. The bottom 13 seeds played a two-day round robin to eliminate two teams.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/arts/15cards-1/15cards-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 345, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/arts/15cards-1/15cards-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 345, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/arts/15cards-1/15cards-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/arts/15cards-1/15cards-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/arts/15cards-1/15cards-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Selecting USA-1 Bridge Team for the Next Bermuda Bowl', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-14T21:14:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'las