639aca32e4fb'}, {'abstract': 'T recounts the highlights from the frenzied week that has sprung up around Frieze New York, which closed Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/14/art-matters-highlights-from-frieze-week-art-revelry-kara-walker-parties-lily-mcmenamy/', 'snippet': 'T recounts the highlights from the frenzied week that has sprung up around Frieze New York, which closed Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The third edition of Frieze New York cemented the second week in May as the highlight of the city’s art calendar. The festivities’ official start date is fuzzy, but if social media is any indication, it might have been Tuesday at the heavily Instagrammed unveiling of the colossal sugar sphinx by Kara Walker at the Domino Sugar Factory in Williamsburg, where Creative Time, the public art organization that commissioned the work, held its annual gala.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/t-magazine/14roundup-mcgarry1/14roundup-mcgarry1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/14/t-magazine/14roundup-mcgarry1/14roundup-mcgarry1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/t-magazine/14roundup-mcgarry1/14roundup-mcgarry1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 614, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/14/t-magazine/14roundup-mcgarry1/14roundup-mcgarry1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/0