young fashion designers. Over flutes of Champagne, fashion world notables like Karl Lagerfeld, Nicolas Ghesquière, Raf Simons, Anna Wintour and a recent Vogue cover subject, Kanye West, were stalking the atrium-turned-designer-showroom. The 30 semifinalists for the award were tucked away in jam-packed booths, accompanied by a rack of clothes, a model or two and a slight sheen of sweat.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/fashion/15LVMH-combo-copy/15LVMH-combo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge