est this week points to a larger issue that disproportionately hurts young New Yorkers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Alec Baldwin took to Twitter to complain about his arrest on Tuesday, he got at least one thing right: “If you don’t have ID in NY when they write you a summons,” he wrote, “they can take you in.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Many People in City Lack Proper ID, Lawyers Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Many People in City Lack Proper ID, Lawyers Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clifford, Stephanie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Identification Devices', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Baldwin, Alec', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-15T01:55:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Clifford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clifford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7ba8c31c-f83a-5a79-a697-bdb9c2fe80d9', 'word_count': 689, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7ba8c31c-f83a-5a79-a697-bdb9c2fe80d9'}, {'abstract': 'John Lieb sees it like it is.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/14/misinterpretation-of-a-biblical-code/', 'snippet': 'John Lieb sees it like it is.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THURSDAY’S PUZZLE — We continue our biblical theme from yesterday with a crossword puzzle by John Lieb. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Misinterpretation of a Biblical Code', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Crossword Puzzles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-15T02:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Deb Amlen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Deb', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Amlen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25f660bf-93ba-5409-9cec-48cf1b718968', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25f660bf-93ba-5409-9cec-48cf1b718968'}, {'abstract': 'The Rangers, who eliminated Pittsburgh on Tuesday night, will open the Eastern Conference finals on Saturday at Montreal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/15/sports/hockey/after-prevailing-in-two-game-7s-rangers-are-back-at-square-one.html', 'snippet': 'The Rangers, who eliminated Pittsburgh on Tuesday night, will open the Eastern Conference finals on Saturday at Montreal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rangers took a well-deserved day off on Wednesday, luxuriating in the afterglow of rallying from a three-games-to-one deficit and eliminating the Pittsburgh Penguins. There could be no denying their resilient spirit; the brilliance of Henrik Lundqvist, the first N.H.L. goalie to win five consecutive Game 7s; or the team effort that gave the players on the Rangers’ current roster an 83-6 record in Game 7s. \xa0', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1430, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/sports/15rangers1/15rangers1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Prevailing in Two Game 7s, Rangers Are Back at Square One', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Prevailing in Two Game 7s, Rangers Are Back at Square One', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Klein, Jeff Z', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lundqvist, Henrik', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boston Bruins', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Montreal Canadiens', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Playoff Games', 'rank': 7, '