r-bro-its-comrade-to-you/', 'snippet': 'A series of regulations issued by party and government organizations points to an effort to step up manners among officials, and between officials and the public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even if you think the Chinese official you’re dealing with is a bit of a dude, a bro or a boss — don’t call him any of those things. Such terms are signs of unwanted bureaucratic sectarianism and ganglike behavior, according to the Communist Party discipline inspection commission of Guangdong Province.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1397, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/world/15sino-dude01/15sino-dude01-thumb