Big TV Interview Signs Off, Too', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Barbara Walters Retires, the Big TV Interview Signs Off, Too', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walters, Barbara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The View (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABC INC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-15T18:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Mahler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mahler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe5bd94f-2a67-59ba-b537-ac8ee49a964e', 'word_count': 1266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe5bd94f-2a67-59ba-b537-ac8ee49a964e'}, {'abstract': 'The revival of Edward Albee’s 1966 play will be Glenn Close’s return to Broadway after 20 years.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/15/close-lithgow-plimpton-to-star-in-delicate-balance-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'The revival of Edward Albee’s 1966 play will be Glenn Close’s return to Broadway after 20 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The three-time Tony Award winner Glenn Close will return to Broadway for the first time in 20 years to lead a high-powered cast this fall in “A Delicate Balance,” Edward Albee’s Pulitzer Prize-winning dark comedy from 1966 about an upper-middle-class family facing terrors both real and amorphous. The producer Scott Rudin announced the casting and performance plans on Thursday. The director will be Pam MacKi