historic-skeleton-in-mexico-is-said-to-link-modern-native-americans-to-siberians.html', 'snippet': 'DNA in the bones of a teenage girl in an underwater cave in the Yucatán show that she has an Asian-derived genetic lineage, researchers say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most geneticists agree that Native Americans are descended from Siberians who crossed into America 26,000 to 18,000 years ago via a land bridge over the Bering Strait. But while genetic analysis of modern Native Americans lends support to this idea, strong fossil evidence has been lacking.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/science/20skeleton/20skeleton-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Prehistoric Skeleton in Mexico Is Said to Link Modern Indians to Earliest Americans', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Early Humans: Linking Modern Indians to Ancient Americans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Native Americans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTHROPOLOGY', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chatters, James', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Science (Journal)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-15T19:34:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sindya N. Bhanoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sindya', 'middlename': 'N.', 'lastname': 'Bhanoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ea32355-ff5f-51b0-ad8b-c2499395517a', 'word_count': 342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ea32355-ff5f-51b0-ad8b-c2499395517a'}, {'abstract': 'Alexander Pereira was to begin his six-year tenure at La Scala in Milan in October, but the board voted to honor his contract only until 2015.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/arts/music/la-scala-to-fire-incoming-director-after-one-season.html', 'snippet': 'Alexander Pereira was to begin his six-year tenure at La Scala in Milan in October, but the board voted to honor his contract only until 2015.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — In what Mayor Giuliano Pisapia described as an agonizing decision, the board of La Scala on Thursday voted to dismiss that opera theater’s incoming director general at the end of his first season, amid charges of a conflict of interest. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'La Scala to Fire Incoming Director After One Season', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'La Scala to Fire Incoming Director After One Season', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Scala Opera House (Milan, Italy)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pereira, Alexander', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conflicts of Interest', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-15T19:36:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elisabetta Povoledo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elisabetta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Povoledo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/063d05cd-1700-5720-8fbc-d6527158894c', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/063d05cd-1700-5720-8fbc-d6527158894c'}, {'abstract': 'Give me a brisk, strong defense of something I disagree with.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/opinion/egan-the-commencement-bigots.html', 'snippet': 'Give me a brisk, strong defense of something I disagree with.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s commencement season, cellphones off please, no texts or tweets. Even with a hangover from debt, alcohol or regret, grads across the land may be lucky enough to hear something on the Big Day that actually stays with them. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/egan-circular/egan-circular-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228,