{'abstract': 'Offstage, the actors Audra McDonald and Will Swenson retreat to Westchester.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/realestate/audra-mcdonald-and-will-swenson-at-home-in-westchester.html', 'snippet': 'Offstage, the actors Audra McDonald and Will Swenson retreat to Westchester.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After 9/11, Audra McDonald no longer felt safe living in New York City. “I had recently given birth, was still quite hormonal and, like everyone else, I was frightened,” recalled Ms. McDonald, now 43, and a Tony Award nominee for her starring role in the Broadway show “Lady Day at Emerson’s Bar & Grill.” “And I kept saying to my husband ‘we have to leave the city, we have to leave the city.’\xa0” ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/realestate/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/realestate/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/realestate/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/realestate/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy/20140518-LOVE-slide-32BA-copy-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1262, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/realestate/20140518-LOVE-slide-3