9013'}, {'abstract': '“Groundbreakers,” an exhibition at the New York Botanical Garden, pays tribute to the women who designed and photographed the great American gardens of the early 20th century.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/nyregion/groundbreakers-pays-tribute-to-female-landscape-designers.html', 'snippet': '“Groundbreakers,” an exhibition at the New York Botanical Garden, pays tribute to the women who designed and photographed the great American gardens of the early 20th century.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you start your sojourn through the New York Botanical Garden’s multipart “Groundbreakers” exhibition as you are meant to — looking at a show about photography in the gallery next to the library — then when you finally reach the conservatory displays, you will feel overwhelmed by a mosaic of color, texture and pattern, a fragrant allée of floral extravagance. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/16BOTANICAL_SPAN/16BOTANICAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/16BOTANICAL_SPAN/16BOTANICAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/16BOTANICAL_SPAN/16BOTANICAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/16BOTANICAL_SPAN/16BOTANICAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/16BOTANICAL_SPAN/