e dedication of the National September 11 Memorial Museum in Lower Manhattan on Thursday was a story President Obama told about the man in a red bandanna. Bewildered and frightened, the people huddled in the smoke and darkness that day on the 78th floor of the World Trade Center’s south tower heard a voice, clear and calm, leading them to the stairs and to safety. Their guide was a young man holding a red handkerchief over his face. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Man in a Red Bandanna', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Man in a Red Bandanna', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crowther, Welles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National September 11 Memorial and Museum', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'September 11 (2001)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World Trade Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T00:50:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0bbe89f-5753-5815-b48f-bedff22a732b', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0bbe89f-5753-5815-b48f-bedff22a732b'}, {'abstract': 'A guide to jazz performances.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/arts/music/jazz-listings-for-may-16-22.html', 'snippet': 'A guide to jazz performances.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Full reviews of recent jazz performances: nytimes.com/jazz. A searchable guide to these and other shows is at nytimes.com/events.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1