nth ago, which is actually on the late side when it comes to determining Book Review covers. Because we close our subscriber issues 10 days before they hit newsstands, we often plan our covers months in advance. Given that we are covering books, which generally have a set publishing date, the “news” in the book world is known well in advance. This gives us the luxury of time in planning what we think will be the most powerful and compelling cover for each issue.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 650}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 945, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1904, 'width': 1757, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/15/blogs/bookreview518/bookreview518-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLar