rs to its growing literary archive.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/ransom-center-pays-2-million-for-ian-mcewan-papers/', 'snippet': 'The Harry Ransom Center at the University of Texas in Austin will add Mr. McEwan’s papers to its growing literary archive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The British novelist Ian McEwan has become the latest top-tier contemporary writer to have G.T.T. — or “Gone to Texas,” as an abbreviation in the rare book trade calls it. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ransom Center Pays $2 Million for Ian McEwan Papers', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ransom, Harry, Center, The University of Texas at Austin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T15:17:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Schuessler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schuessler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc155d9f-cf8e-5280-91bc-3e31331cdfc8', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc155d9f-cf8e-5280-91bc-3e31331cdfc8'}, {'abstract': 'Are we fat because we overeat, or do we overeat because we’re fat?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/opinion/sunday/always-hungry-heres-why.html', 'snippet': 'Are we fat because we overeat, or do we overeat because we’re fat?', 'lead_paragraph': 'FOR most of the last century, our understanding of the cause of obesity has been based on immutable physical law. Specifically, it’s the first law of thermodynamics, which dictates that energy can neither be created nor destroyed. When it comes to body weight, this means that calorie intake minus calorie expenditure equals calories stored. Surrounded by tempting foods, we overeat, consuming more calories than we can burn off, and the excess is deposited as fat. The simple solution is to exert willpower and eat less.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 842, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 842}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 730, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1460, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/sunday-review/18OBESITY/18OBESITY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Always Hungry? Here’s Why', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Always Hungry? Here’s Why', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ludwig, David S', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedman, Mark I', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Calories', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Journal of the American Medical Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T15:19:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By David S. Ludwig and Mark I Friedman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Ludwig', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': 'I <missing Dot>', 'lastname': 'Friedman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7551beb7-b720-5f3f-92b2-57e4b25e5b49', 'word_count': 1612, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7551beb7-b720-5f3f-92b2-57e4b25e5b49'}, {'abstract': 'Thanks to an influx of chic restaurants, high-end shops and elegant hotels — and a new, direct JetBlue flight from New York — the Colombian city is more vibrant than ever.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/itinerary-fashion-art-food-cartagena/', 'snippet': 'Thanks to an influx of chic restaurants, high-end shops and elegant hotels — and a new, direct JetBlue flight from New York — the Colombian city is more vibrant than ever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sultry city of Cartagena has for some time been a weekend destination for wealthy Colombians and in-the-know international globetrotters. They come to stroll the cobblestone streets lined with faded colonial homes, dance and drink rum at the always bustling Club Havana, and then sleep off their hangovers on the postcard-perfect beaches on the nearby islands. Recently, though, Cartagena has seen an influx of more stylish restaurants, shops and hotels (the Ritz Carlton and Four Seasons are coming soon), which can make the city worthy of a longer stay. And with a new, direct JetBlue flight available from New York, it’s more convenient than ever.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16cartagena-egan/16cartagena-egan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, '