o-to production company for TV science programs blending special effects with a strong scientific foundation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/arts/television/karga-seven-a-go-to-company-for-tv-science-shows.html', 'snippet': 'Karga Seven Pictures has emerged as a go-to production company for TV science programs blending special effects with a strong scientific foundation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A tornado slams into Washington with winds exceeding 260 miles per hour. It topples the five-ton bronze statue at the Jefferson Memorial. It churns the roof of the Lincoln Memorial into a Cuisinart of broken glass and tile. It swiss-cheeses the Washington Monument. What will become of the Capitol? “The dome,” one expert predicts, “is toast.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/18TORNADO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/18TORNADO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/18TORNADO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/18TORNADO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/18TORNADO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/18/arts/18TORNADO1/