llman rail cars evokes a chapter of travel history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/travel/all-aboard-for-a-trip-to-the-past.html', 'snippet': 'Riding between Chicago and New Orleans in restored Pullman rail cars evokes a chapter of travel history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was the tail end of winter, and the trees outside the train car window were spindly twigs. Behind the bare branches, the sky was alight. To my half-asleep, hardly focusing, hung-over eyes, it was a blurry layer cake of blueberry, raspberry and tangerine. I had boarded the train in Chicago at dusk on Friday, three days before, and had rolled down 926 miles of rail. I’d spent 20 frivolous, indulgent hours in New Orleans, where I’d had fried oysters and fried green tomatoes at Upperline, midnight cocktails at the bar Cure and a hedonistic jazz brunch at Commander’s Palace. Then, before I could acclimate to the warmth and the green, the music and the food, I was on the next northbound train.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/18-cover-top-sf/18-cover-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 538, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/18-cover-top-sf/18-cover-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 538}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/18-cover-top-sf/18-cover-top-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 918, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/18-cover-top-sf/18-cover-top-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1836, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail'