chef behind this new spot offers a restrained take on classic New Mexican ingredients while managing to avoid cliché.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/travel/restaurant-report-josephs-of-santa-fe.html', 'snippet': 'The chef behind this new spot offers a restrained take on classic New Mexican ingredients while managing to avoid cliché.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 7 on an early winter evening, the buzz about Joseph Wrede’s new restaurant, Joseph’s of Santa Fe, had translated into an in-the-flesh dinner rush. The stranger dining next to me, a local who confessed he’d eaten there seven times since the restaurant opened in October, offered me a duck-fat French fry. “You didn’t order them and you have to try one,” he said.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BITES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1575, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/18/travel/SUB18BITES/SUB18BI