ental activist. Nor did she know much about the stock market. She knew even less about asset management and college endowments.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1426, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/business/jimstewart/jimstewart-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Clash of Ideals and Investments at Swarthmore', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Clash of Ideals and Investments at Swarthmore', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Swarthmore College', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endowments', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T18:16:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By James B. Stewart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e516942-de51-50a8-a9ba-e85312afccf7', 'word_count': 1626, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e516942-de51-50a8-a9ba-e85312afccf7'}, {'abstract': 'Most warblers have lovely plumage, but the black-throated blue (Setophaga caerulescens) is something special.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/black-throated-blue-warbler-listen-stop-and-watch/', 'snippet': 'Most warblers have lovely plumage, but the black-throated blue (Setophaga caerulescens) is something special.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has become clichéd to call warblers the butterflies of the bird world, but it is a fair description of these tiny, colorful birds. In breeding plumage, male warblers are decked out in fluorescent reds, brilliant yellows, greens and metallic blues. A long look at a warbler as it flits from branch to branch may last just a few seconds, but even in that brief time, its colors astound.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/nyregion/18NATURE2/18NATURE2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': '