a372-38cb75d52e19', 'word_count': 508, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cdb6e3be-b98e-5580-a372-38cb75d52e19'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Sturtevant, an American in Paris, made deliberately inexact likenesses of work by Andy Warhol, George Segal and Jasper Johns, among others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/17/arts/design/elaine-sturtevant-appropriation-artist-is-dead-at-89.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Sturtevant, an American in Paris, made deliberately inexact likenesses of work by Andy Warhol, George Segal and Jasper Johns, among others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elaine Sturtevant, an American Conceptual artist whose work resembled that of Andy Warhol — and Roy Lichtenstein and Robert Rauschenberg and Marcel Duchamp and Jasper Johns and Keith Haring and a spate of other emblematic figures from the annals of contemporary art — died on May 7 in Paris. She was 89.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/Sturtevant-1-Obit/Sturtevant-1-Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/Sturtevant-1-Obit/Sturtevant-1-Obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 553}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/Sturtevant-1-Obit/Sturtevant-1-Obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 943, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/Sturtevant-1-Obit/Sturtevant-1-Obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1887, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/arts/Sturtevant-1-Obit/Sturte