ate is in “severe drought” or worse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All of California is in “severe drought” or worse, according to the U.S. Drought Monitor, with much of the state in “exceptional drought” — the most extreme level. The National Drought Mitigation Center writes that a heat wave hitting the West “will only serve to exacerbate and accelerate drought impact concerns across the state. Increases on water demand and the increased risk of fire will ramp up as the heat does.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Facts & Figures: California’s Drought', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drought', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T19:29:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editors', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editors'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/06bcb022-5653-5814-b9cc-4e973d3b1bb3', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/06bcb022-5653-5814-b9cc-4e973d3b1bb3'}, {'abstract': 'Plus, the social media response to anorexic mannequins, John Galliano’s next steps and more from the week in style.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/16/chic-in-review-the-row-la-perla-louis-vuitton-galliano-lady-gaga/', 'snippet': 'Plus, the social media response to anorexic mannequins, John Galliano’s next steps and more from the week in style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/16/t-magazine/16chic-gregory/16chic-gregory-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy