r in using forensic anthropology in human rights cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With ghoulish geniality, Clyde Snow liked to say that bones made good witnesses, never lying, never forgetting, and that a skeleton, no matter how old, could sketch the tale of a human life, revealing how it had been lived, how long it had lasted, what traumas it had endured and especially how it had ended.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/17/us/Snow-obit/Snow-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clyde Snow, Sleuth Who Read Bones From King Tut’s to Kennedy’s, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clyde Snow, Bone Sleuth, Is Dead at 86', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snow, Clyde (1928-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forensic Science', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bones', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTHROPOLOGY', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snow, Clyde', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T20:44:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert D. McFadden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/defe69ec-0457-5ad1-988d-edf23f107206', 'word_count': 1534, 'uri': 'nyt://article/defe69ec-0457-5ad1-988d-edf23f107206'}, {'abstract': 'Kyle Crichton, an International Desk editor, discusses coverage of the Ukraine crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/05/16/from-the-international-desk-the-thinking-on-ukraine/', 'snippet': 'Kyle Crichton, an International Desk editor, discusses coverage of the Ukraine crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We talked to Kyle Crichton, who is coordinating coverage of the Ukraine crisis for The Times, about the news that steelworkers and miners are taking control of the streets from separatists and pro-Russian militants in Mariupol and some other cities.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From the International Desk: The Thinking on Ukraine', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': 