mes.com/2014/05/18/fashion/bill-cunningham-turning-heads.html', 'snippet': 'The fashion note at the Women’s Committee of the Central Park Conservancy “hat luncheon” was a one-piece fitted dress with a full skirt, replacing the suit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On May 7, the Women’s Committee of the Central Park Conservancy held its annual “hat luncheon” for 1,200 guests. The event, which garnered $3.5 million and honored Michael Bloomberg, featured whimsical headdresses masking a serious dedication to the restoration of the park and to the judicious spending of the money raised. Lela Rose arrived on her bike, with Gillian Miniter in the sidecar. The fashion note was a one-piece fitted dress with a full skirt, replacing the luncheon suit, and a lovely surprise to the women in orange was the hue of the traditional umbrellas handed out.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Turning Heads', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turning Heads', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Park Conservancy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Lela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hats and Caps', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-16T22:11:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1