ternational', 'middlename': 'Herald', 'lastname': 'Tribune', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/edad2c1e-d0b5-56e8-9367-1b56ccbd5961', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/edad2c1e-d0b5-56e8-9367-1b56ccbd5961'}, {'abstract': 'Group travel and social events are taking a bigger share of M.B.A. students’ time — and money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/business/in-b-school-is-that-a-syllabus-or-an-itinerary.html', 'snippet': 'Group travel and social events are taking a bigger share of M.B.A. students’ time — and money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One weekend in February, about a third of Sean Pool’s classmates at the McCombs School of Business at the University of Texas at Austin went on a three-day ski trip to Park City, Utah. The event included nighttime, après-ski outings in town, as well as time to relax in a hot tub, according to the itinerary posted on Facebook. The Graduate Business Adventure Team, a student-run group, planned the trip. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/business/18-BSCHOOL-1/18-BSCHOOL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/18/business/18-BSCHOOL-1/18-BSCHOOL-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/business/18-BSCHOOL-1/18-BSCHOOL-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/18/business/18-BSCHOOL-1/18-BSCHOOL-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1391, 'width': 20