mont Over Equipment Ruling', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherman, Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York State Gaming Commission', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'California Chrome (Race Horse)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-18T16:38:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/318c4816-244e-5cb8-84c9-5d6a31664dfd', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/318c4816-244e-5cb8-84c9-5d6a31664dfd'}, {'abstract': 'The industrial conglomerate said a new joint venture with a Chinese partner would create the largest auto interiors company in the world.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/johnson-controls-to-spin-off-auto-interiors-unit/', 'snippet': 'The industrial conglomerate said a new joint venture with a Chinese partner would create the largest auto interiors company in the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Johnson Controls, the industrial conglomerate based in Milwaukee, said on Sunday that it would spin off its automotive interiors business into a new joint venture with a Chinese partner.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Johnson Controls to Spin Off Auto Interiors Unit', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'm