'uri': 'nyt://article/efacc4a4-3291-58be-ac2b-9031d0d103d3'}, {'abstract': 'If immigrant children turn 21 before their parents get green cards, they “age out” of the immigration system, a policy that the Supreme Court is reviewing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/nyregion/justices-may-hold-fate-of-children-who-lost-place-in-immigration-line.html', 'snippet': 'If immigrant children turn 21 before their parents get green cards, they “age out” of the immigration system, a policy that the Supreme Court is reviewing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Desperate to fill classroom vacancies, New York City school officials sent recruiting teams around the world in the late 1990s, promising jobs and help in obtaining green cards that would be a path to citizenship.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19YJPNYIMMIG1/19YJPNYIMMIG1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19YJPNYIMMIG1/19YJPNYIMMIG1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19YJPNYIMMIG1/19YJPNYIMMIG1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19YJPNYIMMIG1/19YJPNYIMMIG1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19YJPNYIMMIG1/19YJPNYIMMIG1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':