oints (hands, elbows, knees and shins), grappling sweeps and throws. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos: Old Art, New Title', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Old Art, New Title', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Martial Arts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-19T00:53:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Monroe Adams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'Monroe', 'lastname': 'Adams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0994b03e-13b2-5ae5-8c78-062626ec25ce', 'word_count': 213, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0994b03e-13b2-5ae5-8c78-062626ec25ce'}, {'abstract': 'The European Union must step in to help Italy, which has been rescuing thousands of migrants at sea and shouldering the costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/opinion/europes-migration-emergency.html', 'snippet': 'The European Union must step in to help Italy, which has been rescuing thousands of migrants at sea and shouldering the costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Italy’s interior minister, Angelino Alfano, has given the European Union an ultimatum: Either step in to help Italy cope with the waves of African migrants who risk drowning in the Mediterranean to reach its shores or Italy will begin sending the people it rescues to neighboring European countries. After the sinking of an overloaded boat last week — 206 people were rescued off the coast of Italy, 17 bodies were recovered, and an unknown number are missing — the European Commission responded. It said Italy should communicate what it expects. This is not an acceptable response. ', 'print_