ract': 'A séance unleashes a full Linda Blair like performance from Eva Green.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/18/penny-dreadful-recap-cue-the-seance/', 'snippet': 'A séance unleashes a full Linda Blair like performance from Eva Green.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As anyone who ever had a friend with a Ouija board in high school can tell you, there was invariably at least one party that got a little … discombobulated thanks to said friend’s appearance. Not enough to break any mirrors or conjure any succubi or anything, just enough to have some other friends leave early, muttering about that “weird [gender redacted] [name redacted] acting a fool in the basement.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Penny Dreadful’ Recap: Cue the Seance', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blair, Linda', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carney, Reeve', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Eva (1980- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kinnear, Rory', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Piper, Billie', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-19T03:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Grode', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grode', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c75c0a31-7f5e-5856-8d6c-42b2f40c9092', 'word_count': 831, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c75c0a31-7f5e-5856-8d6c-42b2f40c9092'}, {'abstract': 'Cecily McMillan was convicted two weeks ago of assaulting a police officer during a Zuccotti Park protest in 2012. An array of vocal sympathizers have called for leniency in her case.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/nyregion/sentencing-nears-for-occupy-wall-street-protesters-assault-case.html', 'snippet': 'Cecily McMillan was convicted two weeks ago of assaulting a police officer during a Zuccotti Park protest in 2012. An array of vocal sympathizers have called for leniency in her case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The outrage among Occupy Wall Street sympathizers about the prosecution of Cecily McMillan for assaulting a police officer during a protest in Zuccotti Park has rested largely on a single idea: that zealous prosecutors, seeking to make an example of Ms. McMillan, had refused during negotiations to let her plead guilty to anything less than a felony.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/19/nyregion/19ows1/19ows1-th