 $1.6 billion of cost savings from the acquisition do not quite cover the 30 percent premium AT&T is paying, Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/att-shareholders-on-hold-in-directv-deal/', 'snippet': 'The unexpectedly robust $1.6 billion of cost savings from the acquisition do not quite cover the 30 percent premium AT&T is paying, Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT&T is putting its shareholders on hold to buy DirecTV. Its acquisition of the satellite TV operator, announced on Sunday, brings with it an unexpectedly robust $1.6 billion of cost savings. Even so, those savings will not quite cover the cost of the premium. In any case, AT&T says it will use the money to roll out rural broadband service. Customers and regulators are getting the first call.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/dbpix-att-breakingviews1/dbpix-att-breakingviews1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/business/dbpix-att-breakingviews1/dbpix-att-breakingviews1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/dbpix-att-breakingviews1/dbpix-att-breakingviews1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/dbpix-att-breakingviews1/dbpix-att-breakingviews1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20