e': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franken, Al', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DirecTV', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Communications Commission', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-19T17:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3434f3b-6d97-50fe-8df5-a5e0fdbfd855', 'word_count': 515, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3434f3b-6d97-50fe-8df5-a5e0fdbfd855'}, {'abstract': 'Jack Shainman Gallery opened the doors to the School on Saturday, when the artist Nick Cave helped inaugurate the space with a live performance.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/hudson-valley-art-destination-kinderhook-jack-shainman-nick-cave-soundsuits/', 'snippet': 'Jack Shainman Gallery opened the doors to the School on Saturday, when the artist Nick Cave helped inaugurate the space with a live performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time artwork adorned the walls of the Martin Van Buren school in Kinderhook, N.Y., it had been commissioned at the request of elementary school teachers. On Saturday, however, both new and retrospective pieces by the artist Nick Cave were installed throughout the newly converted 30,000-square-foot building, while dancers costumed in Cave’s idiosyncratic Soundsuits performed outside for a crowd of art-world cognoscenti and local residents. The early evening celebration feted both the opening of what is simply being called The School, Jack Shainman Gallery‘s colossal addition to two gallery spaces in Chelsea, as well as the 30th anniversary of the gallery itself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Art Matters | The Hudson Valley’s Newest Art Destination', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cave, Nick (1959- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hudson River Valley (NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-19T17:30:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Neilson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neilson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abd62ab6-edbb-5371-bc5d-30e044f9112b', 'word_count': 559, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abd62ab6-edbb-5371-bc5d-30e044f9112b'}, {'abstract': 'The fashion educator, who died over the weekend, helped to shape many of the artists who have made London a focal point of international interest.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/19/louise-wilsons-high-standards-shaped-young-designers/', 'snippet': 'The fashion educator, who died over the weekend, helped to shape many of the artists who have made London a focal point of international interest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'London fashion lost one of its most influential champions this weekend with the death of Louise Wilson, the formidable doyenne of Central Saint Martins, one of the city’s, and indeed the world’s, pre-eminent schools for design. She was 52.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Louise Wilson’s High Standards Shaped Young Designers', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'She Put London on th