gestein. Two men were arrested. Iran is a major transit point for heroin from Afghanistan. Iran also is believed to be the world’s third-largest exporter of raisins, behind Turkey and the United States. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Netherlands: Heroin Seized', 'kicker': 'World Briefing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Netherlands: Heroin Seized', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Raisins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-20T03:16:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4690544-72d0-533f-8649-cf9976f80a4d', 'word_count': 81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4690544-72d0-533f-8649-cf9976f80a4d'}, {'abstract': 'Drug organizations have accelerated to meet a rising nationwide appetite for the drug by setting up New York operations that are growing in sophistication and output, the authorities say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/nyregion/new-york-is-a-hub-in-a-surging-heroin-trade.html', 'snippet': 'Drug organizations have accelerated to meet a rising nationwide appetite for the drug by setting up New York operations that are growing in sophistication and output, the authorities say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The flood of heroin coming into and going out of New York City has surged to the highest levels in more than two decades, alarming law enforcement officials who say that bigger players are now entering the market to sell the drug here and to feed a growing appetite along the East Coast.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/nyregion/y-jpHEROIN2/y-jpHEROIN2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Is a Hub in a Surging Heroin Trade', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New York Is a Hub in a Surging Heroin Trade', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heroin', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brennan, Bridget G', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-20T03:32:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8dc29200-6eed-56dc-ad76-b3b132672657', 'word_count': 1021, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8dc29200-6eed-56dc-ad76-b3b132672657'}, {'abstract': 'The fashion designer — who cites Manhattan’s architecture as one of his main inspirations — created the women’s staff attire for the hotel, set to open this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/t-magazine/narciso-rodriguez-uniform-park-hyatt.html', 'snippet': 'The fashion designer — who cites Manhattan’s architecture as one of his main inspirations — created the women’s staff attire for the hotel, set to open this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fashion designer — who cites Manhattan’s architecture as one of his main inspirations — created the women’s staff attire for the hotel, set to open this summer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/t-magazine/20narciso-levine/20narciso-levine-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/t-magazine/20narciso-levine/20narciso-levine-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 