e made way for spring’s set of light, neutral separates and accessories.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/t-magazine/the-year-of-the-safari-look.html', 'snippet': 'Resort’s suede staples in warm earth tones have made way for spring’s set of light, neutral separates and accessories.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year, the classic safari look abounds, but the latest version sports a sleeker, urban edge. We first saw the style in January in a set of suede, cold-weather resort separates. Now it’s back for spring, thanks to ribbon belts, and utilitarian pockets and a Sahara-inspired color palette of dusty neutrals — all design elements adopted by the likes of Bottega Veneta, Alexander McQueen and Givenchy this season. Worn together in a tonal mix or simply paired with a white linen shirt, these neutral, rugged looks for the city set are investment pieces that won’t go out of style.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21market-gilchrist/21market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21market-gilchrist/21market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21market-gilchrist/21market-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21market-gilchrist/21market-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/