nd economic problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is risky to see hopeful trends in the Ukrainian crisis. But a degree of calm seems to have settled over the rebellious southeast, which may bode well for the presidential election scheduled for Sunday. There are many things Moscow and its minions in Ukraine can still do to derail the election, of course, but President Vladimir Putin of Russia has refrained from publicly endorsing the “people’s republics” proclaimed by secessionists. His spokesman said on Monday that he had ordered Russian troops to pull back from the Ukrainian border, though NATO has not seen any change yet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Critical Election in Ukraine', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Critical Election in Ukraine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Poroshenko, Petro Olekseyevich', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tymoshenko, Yulia V', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Akhmetov, Rinat', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kolomoysky, Ihor', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tigipko, Sergey', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-20T11:47:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3ed5e23-a84d-5b61-a787-10deee669bed', 'word_count': 571, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3ed5e23-a84d-5b61-a787-10deee669bed'}, {'abstract': 'Inmarsat said it would publish in the coming days a full record of the communications received from Malaysia Airlines Flight 370 the day it disappeared.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/world/asia/malaysia-airlines-flight-370.html', 'snippet': 'Inmarsat said it would publish in the coming days a full record of the communications received from Malaysia Airlines Flight 370 the day it disappeared.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Amid pressure from the families of the passengers of Malaysia Airlines Flight 370 for more transparency about the search for the missing jet, Inmarsat, the global satellite communications company, confirmed Tuesday that it would soon publish a full record of the communications received from the plane the day it disappeared.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1282, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/20/world/asia/21PLANE/21PLANE-thumbStandar