bstract': 'Tom Wheeler, chairman of the Federal Communications Commission, said the agency needs to look at the type of paid-priority deal that Netflix struck with Comcast.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/lawmakers-voice-concerns-about-f-c-c-stances/', 'snippet': 'Tom Wheeler, chairman of the Federal Communications Commission, said the agency needs to look at the type of paid-priority deal that Netflix struck with Comcast.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The chairman of the Federal Communications Commission said Tuesday that the agency would examine the type of paid-priority arrangements that Netflix recently entered into with Comcast, a deal that created an uproar of accusations that the F.C.C. was allowing companies to buy fast-lane Internet access to consumers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/20bits-fcc2/20bits-fcc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/20/business/20bits-fcc2/20bits-fcc2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/20bits-fcc2/20bits-fcc2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/20bits-fcc2/20bits-fcc2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/20/business/20bits-fcc2/20bits-fcc2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima