ends with boat traffic and ever-changing water conditions while circumnavigating the island of Manhattan.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/on-the-water-a-journey-around-manhattan/', 'snippet': 'A kayaker contends with boat traffic and ever-changing water conditions while circumnavigating the island of Manhattan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My sleeping bag was already damp as I rolled it out in Inwood Hill Park. I had stored the bag in my 16-foot sea kayak’s front compartment, which I learned over the previous five days paddling the Hudson River was not quite watertight.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/nyregion/circumnavigate/circumnavigate-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption':