'nyt://article/45da550c-6889-56b7-921f-1ae33d8c2c97'}, {'abstract': 'Senator Richard J. Durbin will co-host a June 5 Chicago fund-raiser for Ready for Hillary, an outside group designed to build enthusiasm for Mrs. Clinton’s 2016 candidacy, should she decide to run.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/durbin-lends-support-to-pro-clinton-group/', 'snippet': 'Senator Richard J. Durbin will co-host a June 5 Chicago fund-raiser for Ready for Hillary, an outside group designed to build enthusiasm for Mrs. Clinton’s 2016 candidacy, should she decide to run.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Add Senator Richard J. Durbin, Democrat of Illinois, to the growing list of lawmakers who supported Barack Obama in the 2008 Democratic primary and have now pledged early support to his former rival, Hillary Rodham Clinton.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Durbin Lends Support to Pro-Clinton Group', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Durbin, Richard J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Emanuel, Rahm', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Madigan, Lisa', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ready for Hillary PAC', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Illinois', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-20T19:21:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'r