s Pellettieri is working publicly on a Janus-head sculpture at the Museum of Arts and Design that is meant to represent New York’s socioeconomic extremes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/arts/design/chris-pellettieri-creates-a-sculpture-as-museumgoers-look-on.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Pellettieri is working publicly on a Janus-head sculpture at the Museum of Arts and Design that is meant to represent New York’s socioeconomic extremes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tiny limestone skyscrapers and tenements are rising within eyeshot of Christopher Columbus’s weathered marble face at Columbus Circle, in the shadow of billions of dollars of real estate. On the sixth floor of the Museum of Arts and Design, the stone carver Chris Pellettieri has been chipping away at a limestone block, creating miniature buildings that represent New York’s socioeconomic extremes.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/arts/stonecarver1/stonecarver1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/arts/stonecarver1/stonecarver1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 471}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/arts/stonecarver1/stonecarver1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/arts/stonecarver1/stonecarver1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/arts/stonecarver1/stonecarver1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'he