eported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7d05f00-af05-5146-bda5-ff3c05a37468', 'word_count': 1238, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7d05f00-af05-5146-bda5-ff3c05a37468'}, {'abstract': 'Three women died after becoming trapped between the mattress and the portable bed handles, which are widely used in care facilities, the Consumer Product Safety Commission said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/us/safety-commission-recalls-bed-handles-after-deaths.html', 'snippet': 'Three women died after becoming trapped between the mattress and the portable bed handles, which are widely used in care facilities, the Consumer Product Safety Commission said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Consumer Product Safety Commission on Tuesday announced the first recall of adult portable bed handles, devices that are designed to help patients get in and out of bed. The metal handles are widely used in care facilities for older adults and people with disabilities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Safety Commission Recalls Bed Handles After Deaths', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bed Handles Recalled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nixon, Ron', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recalls and Bans of Products', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Protection', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beds and Bedding', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Consumer Product Safety Commission', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-20T22:32:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_na