ntract with the vendor in charge of building it and to rely on the federal enrollment system for at least a year. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Site Under Fire, Nevada Alters Path', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Site Under Fire, Nevada Alters Path', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Xerox Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nevada', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T00:01:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Goodnough', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodnough', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/00fee484-3475-5cd4-8672-1847af63f6d7', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00fee484-3475-5cd4-8672-1847af63f6d7'}, {'abstract': 'Military coups have played a huge role in weakening the country’s democracy and its economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/opinion/the-military-again-takes-over-in-thailand.html', 'snippet': 'Military coups have played a huge role in weakening the country’s democracy and its economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Under the pretext of restoring “peace and order,” the military of Thailand imposed martial law in that politically troubled country early Tuesday morning. It’s the latest in a series of disturbing developments that will further undermine the country’s democracy and its economy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Military, Again, Takes Over in Thailand', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Military, Again, Takes Over in Thailand', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "Coups D'Etat and Attempted Coups D'Etat", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yingluck Shinawatra', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prayuth Chan-ocha', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T00:26:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ce53ede-60f8-5f11-9849-57884d2d64fd', 'word_count': 479, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ce53ede-60f8-5f11-9849-57884d2d64fd'}, {'abstract': 'Ben S. Bernanke, the former chairman of the Federal Reserve, is poised to make millions of dollars from speaking engagements this year.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/20/after-fed-bernanke-offers-his-wisdom-for-a-big-fee/', 'snippet': 'Ben S. Bernanke, the former chairman of the Federal Reserve, is poised to make millions of dollars from speaking engagements this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Tuesday, Ben S. Bernanke spoke in Abu Dhabi; on Wednesday, he was in Johannesburg. By Friday, he was in Houston. That week in March was a particularly busy one for Mr. Bernanke, the former chairman of the Federal Reserve.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/BERNANKE/BERNANKE-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Fed, Bernanke Offers His Wisdom, for a Big Fee', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Fed, Bernanke Offers His Wisdom for a Big Fee', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Speeches and Statements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rosenberg, David A'