'abstract': 'The Obama administration said it acted over human rights abuses, including the detention of a celebrated lawyer who died in custody.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/world/europe/us-imposes-new-sanctions-on-12-russians.html', 'snippet': 'The Obama administration said it acted over human rights abuses, including the detention of a celebrated lawyer who died in custody.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Obama administration on Tuesday leveled sanctions against 12 Russians for human rights abuses including the detention and death of a celebrated lawyer who the United States says sought to expose fraud by Russian officials. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Imposes New Sanctions on 12 Russians', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Imposes New Sanctions on 12 Russians', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon, Michael R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Sanctions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bastrykin, Aleksandr I', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Magnitsky, Sergei L', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 13, '