 year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/us/massachusetts-3-year-sentence-for-theft-from-marathon-fund.html', 'snippet': 'A Troy, N.Y., woman was sentenced on Tuesday to serve up to three years in prison after admitting to stealing from the One Fund Boston, which raised more than $60 million to aid victims of the bombing at the Boston Marathon last year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Troy, N.Y., woman was sentenced on Tuesday to serve up to three years in prison after admitting to stealing from the One Fund Boston, which raised more than $60 million to aid victims of the bombing at the Boston Marathon last year. State prosecutors said Audrea Gause, 27, had falsely claimed that she sustained a brain injury in the blasts and collected $480,000 from the fund. On Tuesday, Ms. Gause pleaded guilty to one count of larceny over $250 in Suffolk Superior Court; Judge Carol Ball signed an order to return the money, which has been recovered, to the fund. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: 3-Year Sentence for Theft From Marathon Fund', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: 3-Year Sentence for Theft From Marathon Fund', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bidgood, Jess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'One Fund Boston', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boston Marathon Bombings (2013)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T02:47:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/df2b6b1b-7231-5574-9daf-6881da99d262', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df2b6b1b-7231-5574-9daf-6881da99d262'}, {'abstract': 'The Kentucky Derby and Preakness winner was the object of attention when he arrived at Belmont Park, and he seemed to take it all in stride.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/sports/california-chrome-shows-star-quality-in-new-york-arrival.html', 'snippet': 'The Kentucky Derby and Preakness winner was the object of attention when he arrived at Belmont Park, and he seemed to take it all in stride.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 10:40 a.m., outside Gate 6 at Belmont Park, a helicopter circled overhead. Past the security gate, a guard directed the unusually heavy traffic in front of the track kitchen. She smiled wide at passers-by and yelled, “Five minutes until he gets here.” Asked if she was excited, the guard replied, “I’m dancing in my shoes.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CHROME/CHROME-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CHROME/CHROME-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CHROME/CHROME-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CHROME/CHROME-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1507, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name'