g returned to the jail, whose conditions have brought growing criticism to New York City’s Correction Department.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/nyregion/inmate-who-fought-with-another-at-rikers-island-dies-after-leaving-hospital.html', 'snippet': 'The inmate died as he was being returned to the jail, whose conditions have brought growing criticism to New York City’s Correction Department.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An inmate at Rikers Island who was taken to the hospital Tuesday morning after a fight with another inmate died hours later as he was being returned to the jail, New York City officials said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Inmate Who Fought With Another at Rikers Island Dies After Leaving Hospital', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inmate Who Fought With Another at Rikers Island Dies After Leaving Hospital', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fitzsimmons, Emma G', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rikers Island Prison Complex', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Elmhurst Hospital Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T03:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e601ee1-ce4c-5db4-9e4e-069ea7405a50', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e601ee1-ce4c-5db4-9e4e-069ea7405a50'}, {'abstract': 'Xavier Grimble of Southern California was passed over because injuries limited his production last season, but the Giants said he was the kind of complete player they were looking for.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/sports/football/giants-look-to-bolster-offense-with-tight-end-grimble.html', 'snippet': 'Xavier Grimble of Southern California was passed over because injuries limited his production last season, but the Giants said he was the kind of complete player they were looking for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Through three days and seven rounds, Xavier Grimble, a tight end at Southern California, waited with family and friends to hear which N.F.L. team would draft him. He had been advised that he might be selected as early as the third round or as late as the sixth. No one ever mentioned that 256 players would be chosen and he would not be among them. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/sports/CITY-GIANTS/CITY-GIANTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 