phere of the emotions. It’s breathtaking and a little scary.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s on Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T05:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/d274661b-7dfe-5dfe-b7f5-a39cc1e51b6d', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d274661b-7dfe-5dfe-b7f5-a39cc1e51b6d'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on May 21, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/pageoneplus/corrections-may-21-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on May 21, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NATIONAL', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 21, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T05:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2662bc6e-0ef9-5eba-ad27-3abec4906296', 'word_count': 637, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2662bc6e-0ef9-5eba-ad27-3abec4906296'}, {'abstract': 'The China Metallurgical Group has announced that four Chinese workers were killed in rioting at a steel mill being built in central Vietnam, a toll from the anti-Chinese unrest last week that would double the overall count previously given by Chinese government officials.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/chinese-company-puts-death-toll-in-vietnam-riots-at-4/', 'snippet': 'The China Metallurgical Group has announced that four Chinese workers were killed in rioting at a steel mill being built in central Vietnam, a toll from the anti-Chinese unrest last week that would double the overall count previously given by Chin...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The recent outburst of violence by anti-Chinese demonstrators in Vietnam took the lives of at least four workers at a Chinese company, the company said, a count that would double the overall toll previously given by Chinese government officials.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21sino-vietnam-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21sino-vietnam-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21sino-vietnam-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21sino-vietnam-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21sino-vietnam-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/world/21sino-vietnam/21s