ion of movies and TV shows has made it a media force in the United States, now has wide eyes for Europe.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Netflix Faces Hurdles, Country by Country, in Bid to Expand in Europe', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Netflix FacesHurdles, Country by Country, in Bid to Expand in Europe', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Telephones and Telecommunications', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T12:07:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'International Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de76ffd0-cf95-5649-b90c-a8f955f828ed', 'word_count': 1232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de76ffd0-cf95-5649-b90c-a8f955f828ed'}, {'abstract': 'Rory McIlroy attended a news conference ahead of the BMW PGA Championship, despite announcing a split from his tennis star fiancée.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/sports/golf/mcilroy-faces-media-after-breakup-with-wozniacki.html', 'snippet': 'Rory McIlroy attended a news conference ahead of the BMW PGA Championship, despite announcing a split from his tennis star fiancée.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VIRGINIA WATER, England — Appearing at times on the verge of tears, Rory McIlroy kept his date with the news media Wednesday in advance of this week’s BMW PGA Championship, the European Tour’s flagship event, holding a news conference the same morning that he announced the end of his five-month engagement to the tennis star Caroline Wozniacki.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1440, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/22mcilroy2/22mcilroy2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'McIlroy’s Engagement Ends as Key Tournament Looms', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'McIlroy’s Engagement Ends as Key Tournament Looms', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McIlroy, Rory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wozniacki, Caroline', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Professional Golfers Assn European Tour', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T12:28:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eea858af-e98e-543a-acd4-e1a45e235fe7', 'word_count': 517, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eea858af-e98e-543a-acd4-e1a45e235fe7'}, {'abstract': 'It’s hard to believe that Kenneth Branagh is only now making his acting debut on a New York stage, in “Macbeth” at the Park Avenue Armory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/theater/thane-of-cawdor-plays-the-armory.html', 'snippet': 'It’s hard to believe that Kenneth Branagh is only now making his acting debut on a New York stage, in “Macbeth” at the Park Avenue Armory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s hard to believe that Kenneth Branagh is only now making his acting debut on a New York stage. Then again, much about Mr. Branagh’s career is difficult to process. He wrote a memoir at the age of 28 (called, to be fair, “Beginning”), and he directed a very silly comedy on Broadway (“The Play What I Wrote”) inspired by the double act Morecambe and Wise. Perhaps the strangest shift is that Mr. Branagh, the wunderkind once considered Laurence Olivier’s heir, is now directing Hollywood action movies (“Thor”). His is a complex, playful career that dabbles in many forms but always returns to what made him famous: Shakespeare. So it’s no surprise that his first starring role here is as Macbeth, in a critically acclaimed production from England, which he directed with Rob Ashford. Ben Brantley of The New York Times called it “utterly assured and intelligent.” “Macbeth” begins performances May 31 in the Park Avenue Armory’s enormous Drill Hall. (Through June 22. 643 Park Avenue, at 67th Street; 212-616-3930, armoryonpark.org.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/theater/25branagh/25branagh-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], '