the lifestyle their clothes tend to accompany. “The idea with the pop-up space is to create an installation as if you were entering a gallery, with clothes, books, objects, furniture, music,” Arbet says. “We’re a multidisciplinary studio and consider ourselves creative directors, curators. Every detail is equally important.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 705}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 872, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1763, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21_etudes/21_etudes-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Store | An Inspired Space to Shop for Men’s Wear', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kick