that McKesson violated German takeover law by paying more to some holders of Celesio’s convertible bonds than it did to shareholders to secure the deal.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/21/hedge-fund-sues-mckesson-unit-over-celesio-deal/', 'snippet': 'Magnetar Capital contends in its lawsuit filed in Germany that McKesson violated German takeover law by paying more to some holders of Celesio’s convertible bonds than it did to shareholders to secure the deal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hedge fund Magnetar Capital sued a subsidiary of the \xa0McKesson Corporation on Wednesday in connection with its acquisition of the German drug wholesaler Celesio, contending that McKesson violated German takeover law by paying more to some holders of Celesio’s convertible bonds than it did to shareholders.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/dealbook/dbpix-singer/dbpix-singer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/business/dealbook/dbpix-singer/dbpix-singer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/dealbook/dbpix-singer/dbpix-singer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/dealbook/dbpix-singer/dbpix-singer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/business/dealbook/dbpix-singer/dbpix-singer-thumbStandard.jpg'