nd, to the runway. The man behind the show, André Leon Talley, is no less a legend in fashion circles. It’s the third exhibition for SCAD overseen by the former Vogue editor. We caught up with Talley, who offered insights into what it means to curate, his Southern upbringing and learning from Diana Vreeland.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 806, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 806}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 763, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1526, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21talley-gilchrist1/21talley-gilchrist1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legac