harbors a world of bacteria that may influence the course of pregnancy and help shape an infant’s health and the bacterial makeup of its gut, a new study has found.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/us/PLACENTA/PLACENTA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Study Sees Bigger Role for Placenta in Newborns’ Health', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Study Sees Bigger Role for Placenta in Newborns’ Health', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pregnancy and Childbirth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grady, Denise', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIBIOTICS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bacteria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Science Translational Medicine (Journal)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Viruses', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fungi', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-21T18:08:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Denise Grady', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Denise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Grady', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a160b5e-dba3-5fae-92a5-0e2490331fd6', 'word_count': 1143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a160b5e-dba3-5fae-92a5-0e2490331fd6'}, {'abstract': 'During a weekend in the capital city, sample everything from meat to music to museums.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/travel/36-hours-in-montevideo-uruguay.html', 'snippet': 'During a weekend in the capital city, sample everything from meat to music to museums.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Uruguay has made a splash in the news in recent months: Lawmakers allowed same-sex couples to marry less than a year ago, marijuana became legal in December and the country’s folksy president, José Mujica, has appeared in many magazine profiles. While some developments can be seen as a continuation of the country’s track record of economic and social liberalism, they also point to a new, bolder attitude, which can be easily glimpsed in Montevideo, the capital. New hotels, cultural spaces, restaurants and a residential building boom have quickened the city’s tranquil pace. Still, the appeal of Montevideo lies not in novelty but in its timeless backdrop of fin-de-siècle architecture, shady plazas and riverside promenades bordered by sandy beaches — places where laid-back residents indulge in life’s simple pleasures.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 538, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 538}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 918, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1836, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/travel/25-hours-promo/25-hours-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '36 Hours in Montevideo, Uruguay', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '36 Hours: Montevideo, Uruguay