 found.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/nyregion/rangel-has-modest-lead-in-democratic-primary-poll-says.html', 'snippet': 'Representative Charles B. Rangel has the support of 41 percent of likely voters compared with 32 percent for his nearest rival, State Senator Adriano D. Espaillat, a new poll found.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charles B. Rangel, the scandal-scarred Harlem congressman seeking a 23rd term in office, holds a modest but meaningful lead in his Democratic primary battle against State Senator Adriano D. Espaillat, a Dominican-American who is hoping to harness the political ambitions of the district’s surging Latino population, a New York Times/NY1/Siena College poll of likely voters has found.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 't