n support from a disparate band of allies, including some Libyans angered by the outsize influence of militias.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/world/africa/prominent-libyans-vow-support-for-general.html', 'snippet': 'The general, who has led a violent campaign against Islamist militias and lawmakers, has won support from a disparate band of allies, including some Libyans angered by the outsize influence of militias.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TRIPOLI, Libya — A Libyan general who has led a violent campaign against Islamist militias and lawmakers drew prominent new supporters to his cause on Wednesday, including the country’s air force commander and its ambassador to the United Nations. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prominent Libyans Vow Support for General', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prominent Libyans Vow Support for General', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Benghazi (Libya)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fahim, Kareem', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hifter, Khalifa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Libya', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-22T02:42:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Suliman Ali Zway and Kareem Fahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Suliman', 'middlename': 'Ali', 'lastname': 'Zway', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kareem', 'middlename': None, 'l