all/young-mets-career-line-2-solid-starts-2-losses.html', 'snippet': 'Jacob deGrom, trying to become the fifth starter in the Mets’ rotation, allowed only four hits in six innings, but three were solo homers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No matter what Jacob deGrom did Wednesday, it would be hard for him to top his major league debut. Last Thursday, he held the Yankees to one run in seven innings. He got a hit, mercifully ending the Mets pitchers’ hitless streak. And he improved as the game went on, showing maturity and poise and guts, keeping the Mets close in a 1-0 game. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1329, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/sports/SUB-CITY-METS/SUB-CITY-METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred