67-66e9e56c299c', 'word_count': 1246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4209a78b-a6bb-5fe5-a567-66e9e56c299c'}, {'abstract': 'Chuck Klosterman writes the Ethicist column for The Times Magazine. Here he reflects on the experience.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/times-insider/2014/05/22/the-ethic-of-the-ethicist/', 'snippet': 'Chuck Klosterman writes the Ethicist column for The Times Magazine. Here he reflects on the experience.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chuck Klosterman is an author, essayist and former rock critic. He writes The Ethicist, a weekly column for The Times Magazine. His responses have sometimes provoked outrage. Klosterman isn’t surprised. We asked him to reflect on writing the column. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/blogs/ethicist/ethicist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/blogs/ethicist/ethicist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/blogs/ethicist/ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/21/blogs/ethicist/ethicist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/blogs/ethicist/ethicist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ethic of The Ethicist', 'kicker': 'Times Insider', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, '