nd Russia vetoed such a move.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/syria-vote-in-security-council.html', 'snippet': 'Beheadings, torture, aerial bombardments of schools and hospitals: The war in Syria represents the very excesses of war that the International Criminal Court was designed to take on. But it won’t, after China and Russia vetoed such a move.', 'lead_paragraph': 'UNITED NATIONS — Beheadings, torture, aerial bombardments of schools and hospitals: The war in Syria, raging for more than three years with no sign of relief, represents the very excesses of war that the International Criminal Court was designed to take on.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/middleeast/23nations/23nations-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'China and Russia Block Referral of Syria to Court', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China and Russia Block Referral of Syria to Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Criminal Court', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-22T14:36:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81b4fa65-5c4e-55d0-9254-2aeb2019bc29', 'word_count': 725, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81b4fa65-5c4e-55d0-9254-2aeb2019bc29'}, {'abstract': 'The annual design trade show in New York revealed a few noteworthy trends, including a new wave of midcentury revivalism, warm materials, simple geometries and smart lighting treatments.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/icff-sight-unseen-four-design-trends/', 'snippet': 'The annual design trade show in New York revealed a few noteworthy trends, including a new wave of midcentury revivalism, warm materials, simple geometries and smart lighting treatments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Design insiders often take a jaundiced view of New York’s International Contemporary Furniture Fair, the less glamorous cousin to the Salone del Mobile in Milan, which took over the Javits Center last weekend, with satellite operations around the city. But while it may be true that there is nothing new under the sun, a survey of items on view revealed four compelling trends worth noting, including a renewed interest in midcentury modern design; an emphasis on materials with warmth and character like copper, brass and marble; the bold use of basic geometric forms; and lighting that explored the limits and possibilities of new technology.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/t-magazine/22icff-delavan-4/22icff-delavan-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/t-magazine/22icff-delavan-4/22icff-delavan-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/t-magazine/22icff-delavan-4/22icff-delavan-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/t-magazine/22icff-delavan-4/22icff-delavan-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/t-magazine/22icff-delavan-4/22icff-delavan-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75,