r of the agenda-setting Pacific Northwest boutique shares her favorite spots in her home city.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/totokaelo-jill-wenger-on-seattle-restaurants-coffee-nearby-getaways-seward-park-travel/', 'snippet': 'The founder of the agenda-setting Pacific Northwest boutique shares her favorite spots in her home city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fashion and design emporium Totokaelo — pronounced Toh-toh-KYE-oh — may be the most innovative boutique in Seattle, but it’s more than just a local institution. The store’s founder, Jill Wenger, has discovered and championed some of the most influential independent designers anywhere, while her elegant e-commerce site is a shopping resource bookmarked by stylish men and women around the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21seattle-wenger2/21seattle-wenger2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21seattle-wenger2/21seattle-wenger2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 801}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21seattle-wenger2/21seattle-wenger2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21seattle-wenger2/21seattle-wenger2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1535, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/t-magazine/21seattle-wenger2/21seattle-wenger2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cro