'}, {'abstract': 'A gay-rights demonstration last weekend marked the return of same-sex marriage to the forefront of political discussion in Taiwan.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/taiwan-activists-push-for-same-sex-marriage-bill/', 'snippet': 'A gay-rights demonstration last weekend marked the return of same-sex marriage to the forefront of political discussion in Taiwan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The young man in a Taiwan military uniform, a clear plastic bag over his head, stood before an array of paper tombstones along Ketagalan Boulevard in Taipei holding a sign that read: “I am a soldier. I am gay. I passed the physical. I’m not allowed to give blood.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1132, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/world/23sino-taiwan01/23sino-taiwan01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnail