', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f12f1e83-0973-5aea-989d-d194db4c3bf4', 'word_count': 226, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f12f1e83-0973-5aea-989d-d194db4c3bf4'}, {'abstract': 'How one shortish, balding Jewish therapist led to another shortish, bald Jewish guy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/fashion/modern-love-transference-ill-take-it.html', 'snippet': 'How one shortish, balding Jewish therapist led to another shortish, bald Jewish guy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was in my early 40s, and my life was finally swinging into shape. I had a steady stream of work and warm, generous friends. But I had yet to find a viable, committed love. I kept falling for handsome artistic narcissists and their beautiful myths, while ordinary guys with decent looks, good jobs and kind natures simply didn’t register on my radar. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25MODERNLOVE/25MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 384, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25MODERNLOVE/25MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 384}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25MODERNLOVE/25MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25MODERNLOVE/25MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1309, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'