age run by Interior Ministry sympathizers.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/22/family-of-detained-egyptian-journalist-say-leaked-images-of-him-were-staged/', 'snippet': 'The family of an Egyptian journalist detained for nine months without charge expressed outrage that images of him were leaked to a Facebook page run by Interior Ministry sympathizers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The family of an Egyptian journalist who has been detained for nine months without charge expressed outrage on Thursday that images of him were leaked to a Facebook page run by sympathizers of the Interior Ministry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Family of Detained Egyptian Journalist Says Leaked Images of Him Were Staged', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hunger Strikes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL JAZEERA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-23T00:26:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34774698-c7a4-5997-8389-5d7dcfe4ff4b', 'word_count': 308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34774698-c7a4-5997-8389-5d7dcfe4ff4b'}, {'abstract': 'Arby’s filmed a brisket being smoked for 13 hours at the smokehouse in Texas that cures its brisket, and that footage will be one long commercial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/business/media/televising-sizzling-meat-to-bump-up-sales-of-a-brisket-sandwich.html', 'snippet': 'Arby’s filmed a brisket being smoked for 13 hours at the smokehouse in Texas that cures its brisket, and that footage will be one long commercial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TELEVISION commercials have  grown shorter over the decades, with 60-second spots the norm at the dawn of the medium, 30-second spots growing popular in the 1970s, and 15-second spots catching on in the 1980s. The number of 15-second ads grew more than 80 percent between 2008 and 2012, according to Nielsen, which notes the popularity of mobile devices, where commercials must impress quickly as users toggle among apps.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 515, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 515}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 1022, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 1022, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/business/ADCO/ADCO-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th