b48822ef92ee'}, {'abstract': 'In “A World Not Ours,” the director, Mahdi Fleifel, interviews generations of family in the crowded Palestinian refugee camp where he lived before moving to Denmark.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/movies/a-world-not-ours-set-in-a-palestinian-enclave.html', 'snippet': 'In “A World Not Ours,” the director, Mahdi Fleifel, interviews generations of family in the crowded Palestinian refugee camp where he lived before moving to Denmark.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Exiles at home, the generations of family depicted in the documentary “A World Not Ours” live in Lebanon without completely being part of it. This affecting, humor-tinged debut feature from Mahdi Fleifel goes back to the old neighborhood in southern Lebanon: the refugee camp Ain al-Helweh, a Palestinian pocket of hemmed-in buildings and stifled hopes.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/arts/23AWORLDNOTOURS/AWORLDNOTOURS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 372, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/arts/23AWORLDNOTOURS/AWORLDNOTOURS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 372}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/arts/23AWORLDNOTOURS/AWORLDNOTOURS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 634, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/arts/23AWORLDNOTOURS/AWORLDNOTOURS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1269, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/arts/23AWORLDNOTOURS/AWORLDNOTOURS-thumbStandard.jpg', '