 of his child.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANTA ANA, Calif. — Ten years after absconding with his girlfriend’s 15-year-old daughter, Isidro Medrano Garcia was charged by prosecutors on Thursday with raping and kidnapping the girl, who subsequently became his wife and the mother of his child and who lived with him for the past decade. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 835, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 835}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 736, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1567, 'width': 1126, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/CALIFORNIA-2/CALIFORNIA-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Felony Charges Are Filed in Case of 2004 Disappearance', 'k