unty district attorney’s office are concerned that criminals will see less of a deterrent to fraud schemes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/us/fraud-unit-gone-some-fear-increased-fuel-tax-evasion.html', 'snippet': 'Former members of the now-closed motor fuels tax fraud division of the Travis County district attorney’s office are concerned that criminals will see less of a deterrent to fraud schemes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Piqued last year over the refusal by the Travis County district attorney, Rosemary Lehmberg, to resign after her drunken driving arrest, Gov. Rick Perry exercised his veto and withheld more than $7.5 million in state money from her office’s public integrity unit.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1003, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1003}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 613, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1840, 'width': 1101, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/us/23ttDIESEL/23ttDIESEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnai