s of the new Indian Lok Sabha, or lower house of Parliament, suggest it is becoming less representative than ever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Satish Chandra Dubey faces charges including murder, attempted murder, rioting armed with a deadly weapon, robbery, theft and killing or maiming cattle, to name but a few.\xa0Mr. Dubey, who is also\xa0suspected\xa0of involvement in drug smuggling and has previously been charged in a\xa0bank robbery, is one of several criminals-turned-politicians in India. He is known as a “bahubali,” or a powerful person.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1252, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/world/asia/23-parliament-indiaink/23-parliament-indiaink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}