gins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b30cf55d-aa00-565c-87cf-327fa8ce8dca', 'word_count': 1814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b30cf55d-aa00-565c-87cf-327fa8ce8dca'}, {'abstract': 'Germain Katanga is only the second person to be convicted by the International Criminal Court in the decade since its work began.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/24/world/africa/hague-court-sentences-congolese-warlord-to-12-years.html', 'snippet': 'Germain Katanga is only the second person to be convicted by the International Criminal Court in the decade since its work began.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The International Criminal Court in The Hague sentenced a Congolese militia leader, Germain Katanga, on Friday to 12 years in prison for his role in an attack on a village in 2003 where, within hours, more than 200 civilians were shot or hacked to death, limb by limb.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/24HAGUE/24HAGUE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/world/24HAGUE/24HAGUE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/24HAGUE/24HAGUE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/24HAGUE/24HAGUE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',