 Godani as the new artistic director.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/william-forsythe-to-no-longer-run-forsythe-dance-company/', 'snippet': 'Starting in September 2015, William Forsythe, widely recognized as one of the most important choreographers working today, will no longer run the company that is named for him. He will continue to be associated as an artistic adviser, a press stat...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Starting in September 2015, William Forsythe, widely recognized as one of the most important choreographers working today, will no longer run the company that is named for him. He will continue to be associated as an artistic adviser, a press statement announced on Friday. Jacopo Godani, a former dancer with Mr. Forsythe’s Ballet Frankfurt who is now a freelance choreographer, was named as the new artistic director.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'William Forsythe to No Longer Run Forsythe Dance Company', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'William Forsythe to Leave Dance Troupe', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Forsythe, William (1949- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Glorya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ballet Frankfurt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Forsythe Co', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Southern California', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Frankfurt (Germany)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-23T17:56:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roslyn Sulcas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roslyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sulcas', 'quali