ired in more than 20 states.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/23/a-closer-look-at-lockdown-drills-in-schools/', 'snippet': 'This week’s Look features pictures taken by Alec Soth during a lockdown drill at a high school in Belle Plaine, Minn. Lockdown or similar types of drills are now required in more than 20 states.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s Look features pictures taken by Alec Soth during a recent lockdown drill at a high school in Belle Plaine, Minn., about an hour southwest of Minneapolis. I was curious to find out more about these drills, so I put a few questions to Kenneth Trump, president of National School Safety and Security Services, which, among other things, evaluates school security and emergency crisis plans.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/22/magazine/Lockdown1/Lockdown1-thumbStandard