-hard-to-leave/', 'snippet': 'What started as a relationship due to proximity evolved, at some point, into genuine affection for a school, a group of children and parents, and an entire small world that my daughter’s graduation means we’ll all leave behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We pull into United Skate for the last school fund-raiser of the year. My friend pulls her minivan in beside mine. “We’re late!” yell the four children between us and we hurry in, pay the $6 per child and head to the skate checkout line. Once all the children are out on the rink, after we have checked our work emails one last time, we turn to lacing up our own skates.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/motherlode-roller-skating-articleLarge.png', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/motherlode-roller-skating-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/motherlode-roller-skating-jumbo.png', 'height': 580, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/motherlode-roller-skating-superJumbo.png', 'height': 580, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/motherlode-roller-skating-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/23/us/motherlode-roller-skating/