'The actors Tyne Daly and Jim Parsons discuss their latest projects, which deal with the AIDS crisis in its early days and its aftermath.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/fashion/tyne-daly-and-jim-parsons-discuss-their-latest-projects.html', 'snippet': 'The actors Tyne Daly and Jim Parsons discuss their latest projects, which deal with the AIDS crisis in its early days and its aftermath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tyne Daly needed a bowl of rice — but not to eat. No, the six-time Emmy-winning actress (four for “Cagney & Lacey” and one each for “Christy” and “Judging Amy”), Tony winner for the Broadway revival of “Gypsy” and current Tony nominee for Terrence McNally’s new play, “Mothers and Sons,” wanted to submerge her ancient flip phone in a bowl of uncooked rice to leach the moisture from it. “My toilet exploded!” she cried. “Water everywhere. All over my outfit and the phone in my pocket.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25TABLE/25TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25TABLE/25TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25TABLE/25TABLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25TABLE/25TABLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1502, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/fashion/25TABLE/25TABLE-thumbStandard.jpg