5a02-b4a8-979ab50ebf33', 'word_count': 2580, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce141548-b2bd-5a02-b4a8-979ab50ebf33'}, {'abstract': 'Jurgen Klinsmann’s exclusion of Landon Donovan from the United States World Cup roster was a bold decision by a coach who knows what the future holds for him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/24/sports/soccer/in-klinsmanns-decision-on-donovan-an-eye-on-now-and-later.html', 'snippet': 'Jurgen Klinsmann’s exclusion of Landon Donovan from the United States World Cup roster was a bold decision by a coach who knows what the future holds for him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In most cases, coaches of national soccer teams are like presidents: one four-year term at a time, with little certainty about how re-election will go until the numbers come in. Unlike political incumbents, though, coaching incumbents do not often receive a boost; coaching a team for two World Cup cycles is not the norm.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/24onsoccer-1/24onsoccer-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/24onsoccer-1/24onsoccer-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/24onsoccer-1/24onsoccer-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/24onsoccer-1/24onsoccer-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1208, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24