e chances, but Adam Dunn of the White Sox unleashed a two-run shot in the ninth inning.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/24/sports/baseball/dunns-homer-ends-game-and-closers-perfect-season.html', 'snippet': 'Yankees closer David Robertson had converted his first nine save chances, but Adam Dunn of the White Sox unleashed a two-run shot in the ninth inning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — All closers know that, despite their best efforts, their jobs will inevitably include the dreaded blown save. Even Mariano Rivera blew save opportunities, sometimes in big games.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1506, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/24/sports/CITY-YANKEES/CITY-YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit':