 jockey for three years, Alan Sherman followed his father Art into horse training and is now the assistant trainer for California Chrome.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/sports/for-alan-sherman-california-chromes-constant-companion-a-journey-from-jockey-to-trainer.html', 'snippet': 'After lasting as a jockey for three years, Alan Sherman followed his father Art into horse training and is now the assistant trainer for California Chrome.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One early morning in late April, the trainer Alan Sherman rested his arms on the rail as he watched one of his horses gallop at Los Alamitos Race Course in California. The call to the post played, but the sound did not come from a bugle. It came from Sherman’s cellphone.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/DOG-belmont/DOG-belmont-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/DOG-belmont/DOG-belmont-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 901}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/DOG-belmont/DOG-belmont-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/DOG-belmont/DOG-belmont-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1364, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/DOG-belmont/DOG-belmont-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/25/spo