a91cc175'}, {'abstract': 'President Michel Suleiman’s term ended Saturday before the country’s political powers could agree on a successor, creating a vacuum of power in the deeply divided nation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/world/middleeast/lebanons-political-standoff-leaves-leadership-vacancy.html', 'snippet': 'President Michel Suleiman’s term ended Saturday before the country’s political powers could agree on a successor, creating a vacuum of power in the deeply divided nation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Waving to television cameras and assembled dignitaries, President Michel Suleiman departed the presidential palace on Saturday, the last day of his six-year term, leaving behind a political vacuum caused by the failure of the country’s political powers to agree on a successor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/world/LEBANON/LEBANON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 847, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/world/LEBANON/LEBANON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 847}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/world/LEBANON/LEBANON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 976, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/world/LEBANON/LEBANON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 976, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/world/LEBANON/LEBANON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail