The forced sale of the Los Angeles Clippers could bring a sale price of $1 billion in an overheated market for N.B.A. teams.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/sports/basketball/in-the-nba-a-billion-dollar-distressed-sale-of-the-clippers.html', 'snippet': 'The forced sale of the Los Angeles Clippers could bring a sale price of $1 billion in an overheated market for N.B.A. teams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Six weeks ago, no one would have suggested that the Los Angeles Clippers could sell for as much as $1 billion. The Lakers, yes. The Clippers, absolutely not.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the N.B.A., a Billion-Dollar Distressed Sale of the Clippers', 'kicker': 'Sports Business', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Billion-Dollar Distressed Sale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Clippers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sterling, Donald', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-24T21:34:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a023271c-0efc-50c9-9c1d-a2c36bb9efeb', 'word_count': 897, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a023271c-0efc-50c9-9c1d-a2c36bb9efeb'}, {'abstract': 'Readers comment on my column about a girl who starved herself to get a degree.', 'web_url': 'https://kristof.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/24/fighting-mom-and-dad-for-an-education/', 'snippet': 'Readers comment on my column about a girl who starved herself to get a degree.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Sunday column is about an inspiring young woman who personifies grit—and also underscores the power of girls’ education. Since the Nigerian schoolgirls’ kidnapping, I’ve been thinking about the issue (and writing about it here, here and here). It’s obviously important to educate boys too, but I do think that there’s evidence that the returns for focusing on girls’ education are particularly high.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Will Faint for School', 'kicker': 'Nicholas Kristof', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-24T21:37:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kristof', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kristof', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a96e889c-c43b-5edc-bc6c-6949e30d6f35', 'word_count': 133, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a96e889c-c43b-5edc-bc6c-6949e30d6f35'}, {'abstract': 'Bale scored the first of three extra-time goals on a header, after Sergio Ramos tied it in the 93rd minute, as Real Madrid beat city rival Atlético Madrid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/sports/soccer/gareth-bales-goal-seals-champions-league-title-for-real-madrid.html', 'snippet': 'Bale scored the first of three extra-time goals on a header, after Sergio Ramos tied it in the 93rd minute, as Real Madrid beat city rival Atlético Madrid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LISBON — Real Madrid Manager Carlo Ancelotti was in the midst of giving a calm, measured response to a question about his team’s tactics when the door to the news conference room burst open. Suddenly, seven of Ancelotti’s players were on the dais wit