2014/05/25/world/europe/turkish-film-winter-sleep-wins-top-honor-at-cannes.html', 'snippet': 'Directed by Nuri Bilge Ceylan, the film explores life and death, good and evil, the beauty of the natural world and the art of conversation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CANNES, France — The 67th Cannes Film Festival came to a restrained close Saturday night when the Palme d’Or was awarded to the Turkish film “Winter Sleep.” Directed by Nuri Bilge Ceylan, the 3 hour and 16 minute philosophical talkfest about life and death, good and evil, the beauty of the natural world and art of conversation, had been a critics’ favorite in a competition lineup many deemed solid if lacking in revelations. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/26/arts/france-1/france-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype