ts/baseball/the-yankees-wait-until-late-to-beat-the-white-sox.html', 'snippet': 'After the Yankees scored three runs to tie the score in the ninth and Jacoby Ellsbury homered in the 10th, closer David Robertson shook off the sting of failure from one night earlier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — As much as every closer claims a short memory and a tough skin as part of his skill set, the sting of a blown save can be agonizing, especially if it lingers for days. When a closer gives up a two-run homer on the road to instantly lose a game, as David Robertson did Friday night, the agony can be intense. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 461}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1572, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/25/sports/yankees/yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima