rk Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wheeler Shakes Off Early Trouble, but Mets Fall to Arizona', 'kicker': 'Diamondbacks 3, Mets 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Step Back Comes Step Forward for Mets in a Defeat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ARIZONA DIAMONDBACKS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheeler, Zack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-25T00:36:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Rohan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rohan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/873d3710-2e90-5d0b-ae94-2124e0143a83', 'word_count': 304, 'uri': 'nyt://article/873d3710-2e90-5d0b-ae94-2124e0143a83'}, {'abstract': 'Eric Campbell has been a reliable hitter so far for the Mets and could serve in several defensive positions, if necessary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/sports/baseball/a-met-finds-a-place-on-the-diamond-everywhere.html', 'snippet': 'Eric Campbell has been a reliable hitter so far for the Mets and could serve in several defensive positions, if necessary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eric Campbell had planned to go golfing with his father. It was June 2008, and as a tall, athletic third baseman from Boston College, Campbell was expected to be selected before the 15th round of the baseball draft. But instead of obsessing over where he would be taken, he decided to ignore the thing. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None,