 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yeager, Bunny (1929-2014)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Playboy Magazine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Miami (Fla)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-25T20:59:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margalit Fox', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margalit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fox', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/75bcb67d-47ac-5505-bdf3-e35d60cf1f62', 'word_count': 905, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75bcb67d-47ac-5505-bdf3-e35d60cf1f62'}, {'abstract': 'While American Ballet Theater’s rendering of “La Bayadère” had plenty of ballet-as-sport spectacle, the leads in the story’s love triangle imbued it with rich dramatic purpose.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/26/arts/dance/american-ballet-theater-performs-la-bayadere.html', 'snippet': 'While American Ballet Theater’s rendering of “La Bayadère” had plenty of ballet-as-sport spectacle, the leads in the story’s love triangle imbued it with rich dramatic purpose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During American Ballet Theater’s spring season, with its panoply of full-length ballets, the business of telling a story can feel more or less urgent, depending on the night. There are works in which the narrative seizes you and sweeps you along, investing you in the fate of each character. And there are others in which the plot, if you could call it that, seems like mere scaffolding for spectacular dancing, an excuse for putting on an extravagant show.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank'