kauer’s book “Into the Wild”; “Stillwater,” a rock theater piece by John Jobson, Ryan McCall and Mr. Tysen, about the residents of a trailer park in Oklahoma; and “At the Beck,” by Chantal Bilodeau, Ms. Dickstein, and Peter Melnick, about two British girls who claim to have taken real pictures of fairies.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rhinebeck Retreat Selects Musicals', 'kicker': 'Arts, Briefly', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rhinebeck Retreat Selects Musicals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bilodeau, Chantal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tysen, Nathan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Melnick, Peter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rhinebeck (NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-25T21:59:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'Compiled by Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/db4be79a-af7f-581d-83f4-6da967c97905', 'word_count': 123, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db4be79a-af7f-581d-83f4-6da967c97905'}, {'abstract': 'The Thai military takes a poll on this week’s coup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/25/opinion/its-unanimous.html', 'snippet': 'The Thai military takes a poll on this week’s coup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Thai military takes a poll on this week’s coup.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/25/opinion/25-iht-edhengart/25-iht-edhengart-article