'_id': 'nyt://article/4bbca7e7-6ea7-5168-8fcd-31e83bb89ac3', 'word_count': 1157, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4bbca7e7-6ea7-5168-8fcd-31e83bb89ac3'}, {'abstract': 'Yankees shortstop Derek Jeter had four hits for the first time since August 2012, a day after catcher Brian McCann predicted as much, while Masahiro Tanaka bounced back from his first loss in a 7-1 road win over the White Sox.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/26/sports/baseball/jeters-four-hits-and-tanakas-solid-outing-help-yanks-roll-past-white-sox.html', 'snippet': 'Yankees shortstop Derek Jeter had four hits for the first time since August 2012, a day after catcher Brian McCann predicted as much, while Masahiro Tanaka bounced back from his first loss in a 7-1 road win over the White Sox.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Brian McCann’s prediction was off by a day, but fairly clairvoyant nonetheless. On Saturday, he told Derek Jeter that Jeter would get four hits in that game.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 438, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/26/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 438}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 747, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/sports/YANKEES/YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1493, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/26/sport