tighten the definition of the V.O.A.’s mission so that its news “is consistent with and promotes the broad foreign policies of the United States.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Pitch of America’s Voice', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Pitch of America&#8217;s Voice', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Voice of America', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Propaganda', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-26T01:03:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ca8abc4-6bfb-5b33-9c12-d71cb80fd345', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ca8abc4-6bfb-5b33-9c12-d71cb80fd345'}, {'abstract': 'The governor is pushing for a natural gas route through New Jersey’s Pinelands, but his state would be the loser.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/26/opinion/gov-christies-pipeline.html', 'snippet': 'The governor is pushing for a natural gas route through New Jersey’s Pinelands, but his state would be the loser.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three years ago, Gov. Chris Christie proposed a natural gas pipeline that would run right through the environmentally sensitive Pinelands of southern New Jersey. It was a faulty plan, and the guardians of that area — the Pinelands Commission — wisely rejected the pipeline in January. Now Mr. Christie and his allies are trying to pack the commission with people who will see things his way.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gov. Christie’s Pipeline', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gov. Christie&#8217;s Pipeline ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pipelines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Christie, Christopher J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pine Barrens (NJ)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-26T01:04:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6e60158-4224-5d56-a641-d0c94e71ba3c', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6e60158-4224-5d56-a641-d0c94e71ba3c'}, {'abstract': 'Evan Williams, founder of Blogger and Twitter, talks to David Carr about his latest venture, Medium.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/100000002899296/evan-williams-on-medium.html', 'snippet': 'Evan Williams, founder of Blogger and Twitter, talks to David Carr about his latest venture, Medium.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Evan Williams, founder of Blogger and Twitter, talks to David Carr about his latest venture, Medium.', 'source': '