rant State Senate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/27/opinion/leadership-on-transgender-civil-rights.html', 'snippet': 'If New York is to fill a gap in its civil rights protections, the governor will have to work on the recalcitrant State Senate.', 'lead_paragraph': '“We are closer today to creating that open, respectful, inclusive world that we want for all of our children,” Maryland’s Democratic governor, Martin O’Malley, said of the law making Maryland the 18th state to extend civil rights protections to transgender people. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leadership on Transgender Civil Rights', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Leadership on Transgender Civil Rights', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexual', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-27T00:47:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b864d4e4-59fc-57ba-8167-6c51f8b929cd', 'word_count': 402, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b864d4e4-59fc-57ba-8167-6c51f8b929cd'}, {'abstract': 'Steven Banks, the commissioner of the Human Resources Administration, wants to take the nation’s largest municipal poverty agency in a new direction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/27/nyregion/in-a-new-role-a-champion-of-the-homeless-looks-to-prove-his-critics-wrong.html', 'snippet': 'Steven Banks, the commissioner of the Human Resources Administration, wants to take the nation’s largest municipal poverty agency in a new direction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not long after Mayor Bill de Blasio appointed him as commissioner of the nation’s largest municipal poverty agency, Steven Banks got a fat raspberry of a hello from The New York Post.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/nyregion/GOTHAM/GOTHAM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbL