5-076f-5221-830f-51cccd27b4f0'}, {'abstract': 'My mother’s essay in this blog drew outrage and a bit of sympathy for her children. Here’s the rest of the story.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/27/she-wasnt-so-ungrateful-after-all/', 'snippet': 'My mother’s essay in this blog drew outrage and a bit of sympathy for her children. Here’s the rest of the story.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last November, the week of my mother’s 86th birthday, her essay ran in this blog under the headline, “A Very Ungrateful Old Lady.” She explained — somewhat humorously, more than a little bitterly — that because of her very limited vision and her weakening, aging body, she was increasingly dependent on her children, and that it made her feel like a burden to be cared for and tended, even when the care came with love.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/health/klass_noa/klass_noa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/27/health/klass_noa/klass_noa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/health/klass_noa/klass_noa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/health/klass_noa/klass_noa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1197, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/health/klass_noa/klass_noa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2