'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meyers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9f909ea-0724-56d8-8a56-a44c38ed4ca0', 'word_count': 933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9f909ea-0724-56d8-8a56-a44c38ed4ca0'}, {'abstract': 'The latest housing numbers show a big jump in home prices in the 12 months leading up to March 2014. Those gains aren’t likely to continue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/upshot/another-reason-to-consider-renting.html', 'snippet': 'The latest housing numbers show a big jump in home prices in the 12 months leading up to March 2014. Those gains aren’t likely to continue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s new house-price numbers are another reason for people in many markets to think seriously about renting. Home prices in the 20 largest metropolitan areas rose a whopping 12.4 percent between March 2013 and March 2014, according to the the S&P/Case-Shiller Home Price Indices. That’s clearly unsustainable, and it’s a reminder of how strongly home prices have rebounded in many markets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/upshot/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315-articleLarge-v6.png', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/21/upshot/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315-articleLarge-v6.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/21/upshot/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315/buy-rent-calculator-1400716516315-jumbo-v6.png', 'height': 620, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit