b7aa-55cc-a897-5e44259bcfa9', 'word_count': 303, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab715e11-b7aa-55cc-a897-5e44259bcfa9'}, {'abstract': 'When finances fall through, a planned move home to the United States falls through as well.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/27/when-a-family-move-falls-through-who-died-and-made-me-not-boss/', 'snippet': 'When finances fall through, a planned move home to the United States falls through as well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Matt and I found out that income we were depending on — related to his books — fell through. We sat for hours going over the figures. A day earlier, we had asked a real estate agent in Rockland County, N.Y., to visit a property. “Can you hear the noise from the Palisades Parkway?” we wrote. The rent was a little higher than we had wanted, but it was on a cul-de-sac, and after apartment living I imagined the kids being in heaven there.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/us/motherlode-box/motherlode-box-articleLarge.png', 'height': 435, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/27/us/motherlode-box/motherlode-box-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 435}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/us/motherlode-box/motherlode-box-jumbo.png', 'height': 649, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/us/motherlode-box/motherlode-box-superJumbo.png', 'height': 649, 'width': 896, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/27/us/motherlode-box/motherlode-box-thumbStandard.png', 'heig