-and-spike-lee-to-team-up-at-the-apollo/', 'snippet': 'Spike Lee will be the director of a Pharrell Williams concert at the Apollo Theater on June 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pharrell Williams’s debut at the Apollo Theater on June 3 is bound to be an occasion. After working behind the scenes for more than two decades as a songwriter and producer, the 41-year-old singer is having his moment, with a hit album (“G I R L”), a single that has been at or near the top of the chart for weeks (“Happy”), a Vivienne Westwood mountain hat that has been an unmistakable trademark ever since he turned up at the Grammy Awards wearing it in January, and a children’s book – plus an online interactive game – in the works.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 662, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1324, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28ARTS1/28ARTS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':