Life & Crimes of Doris Payne” tells the story of a career criminal, a jewel thief now in her 80s, who pretends to be one of the rich in order to steal from them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/movies/the-life-crimes-of-doris-payne-about-a-real-jewel-thief.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “The Life & Crimes of Doris Payne” tells the story of a career criminal, a jewel thief now in her 80s, who pretends to be one of the rich in order to steal from them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fleet-fingered jewel thief, compulsive liar, one-woman race crusader, parasite, parent, performer: Doris Payne could be identified in many ways (in addition to her multiple aliases). But she has also clearly had the time of her life. “The Life & Crimes of Doris Payne,” a rough-edged, brief documentary about this octogenarian career criminal, sketches a peppy and beguiling portrait of a convict whose defiant streak of independence has a way of outshining her wrongdoing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28LIFE2/28LIFE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28LIFE2/28LIFE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28LIFE2/28LIFE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/arts/28LIFE2/28LIFE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1196, 'width': 1546, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28