omaiya', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/20f16019-7883-51d3-a9cb-796d245ce3b3', 'word_count': 338, 'uri': 'nyt://article/20f16019-7883-51d3-a9cb-796d245ce3b3'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Yong Kim said his goal was to break down regional “silos” and squeeze out inefficiencies, but staff members describe the changes as a nightmare.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/business/international/world-bank-revamping-is-rattling-employees.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Yong Kim said his goal was to break down regional “silos” and squeeze out inefficiencies, but staff members describe the changes as a nightmare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The World Bank, a famously bureaucratic institution, is undergoing its first restructuring in nearly two decades. The overhaul is intended to keep it relevant at a time when even the poorest countries can easily tap the global capital markets, but with just weeks to go, the process has turned into what several staff members described as a nightmare, stalling their work and sapping morale.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28worldbank/28worldbank-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28worldbank/28worldbank-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28worldbank/28worldbank-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28worldbank/