 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 526, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 526}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 898, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1796, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/sports/CITY-MONTREAL/CITY-MONTREAL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Stepan Roars Into Fray With Broken Jaw and Comes Away With Two Goals', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stepan Roars Into Fray With Broken Jaw and Comes Away With Two Goals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stepan, Derek', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jaw (Body Part)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Rangers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Montreal Canadiens', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T03:38:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/983f26d1-28c6-5ad1-8573-e6b8a68401af', 'word_count': 726, 'uri': 'nyt://article/983f26d1-28c6-5ad1-8573-e6b8a68401af'}, {'abstract': 'Just in time for the beauty frenzy surrounding Angelina Jolie\'s intensely sculpted face in the new film "Maleficent," Jolie\'s secret beauty weapon Toni G explains how to work with the growing crop of face-defining cosmetics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/t-magazine/angelina-jolie-makeup-artist-on-how-to-use-the-new-cheekbone-contouring-products-mac-maleficent.html', 'snippet': 'Just in time for the beauty frenzy surrounding Angelina Jolie\'s intensely sculpted face in the new film "Maleficent," Jolie\'s secret beauty weapon Toni G explains how to work with the growing crop of face-defining cosmetics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last month, the British makeup artist Charlotte Tilbury visited the States to introduce her beauty line, which arrives here later this year, and proudly present her Filmstar Bronze & Glow product to a small group of beauty editors. It’s a miracle-working compact designed to make the roundest of facest appear toned, and is filled with two kinds of powder: a darker one, which creates depth when brushed into the hollows of the cheeks, and a lighter, shimmery one, which makes the cheekbones rise and pop. These nature-defying contouring and highlighting products have cropped up on beauty counters everywhere in recent months, like the Nars Contour Blush palettes, introduced back in March, and the MAC Maleficent Sculpting Powder, unveiled earlier this month as part of the brand’s new collection inspired by the Disney blockbuster of the same name, which stars Angelina Jolie and hits theaters this Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28cheek-beddie/28cheek-beddie-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Angelina’s Makeup Artist on How to Use the New Cheekbone-Contouring Products', 'kicker': 'On Beauty', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TDesign', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alainna Lexie Beddie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alainna', 'middlename': 'Lexie', 'lastname': 'Beddie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e17c94f-7df0-5479-bfcd-dda2f3debd06', 'word_count': 492, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e17c94f-7df0-5479-bfcd-dda2f3debd06'}, {'abstract': 'Made with natural oak and brass, the house’s newest offerings will find a place in almost any home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/t-magazine/calvin-klein-furniture-collection.html', 'snippet': 'Made with natural oak and brass, the house’s newest offerings will find a place in almost any home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Calvin Klein is known for its sleek, streamlined apparel. And since 1995, when the company first opened its flagship store designed by the architect John Pawson, the brand has offered home furnishings with a similar aesthetic. But you don’t have to live in a temple of minimalism to enjoy its latest furniture collection. Individually or together, the brass-plated Radiant accent table ($2,000) and the Facet folding stool made of natural oak ($1,100) possess a warmth and materiality that will find a place in almost any home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28klein-delavan/28klein-delavan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/t-magazine/28klein-delavan/28klein-delavan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xla