ense Holiday Retires Prior to Belmont', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Horse Racing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Intense Holiday Is Retired', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hoppert, Melissa', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starlight Racing', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T04:30:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Hoppert', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoppert', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e2da8b4-51b8-5150-8e6e-68a42ffd2b97', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e2da8b4-51b8-5150-8e6e-68a42ffd2b97'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on May 28, 2014.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/pageoneplus/corrections-may-28-2014.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on May 28, 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 28, 2014', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T04:32:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0fdf0703-6018-52f5-8c47-80d60d47d0e3', 'word_count': 576, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0fdf0703-6018-52f5-8c47-80d60d47d0e3'}, {'abstract': 'Television highlights.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/arts/television/whats-on-wednesday.html', 'snippet': 'Television highlights.', 'lead_paragraph': '10 P.M. (NBC) INSIDE THE MIND OF EDWARD SNOWDEN In this NBC News exclusive, Brian Williams travels to Moscow to conduct the first interview for American television with Mr. Snowden (above right, with Mr. Williams), the former National Security Agency contractor who leaked documents about the government’s surveillance. Mr. Williams then speaks with Mr. Snowden together with Glenn Greenwald, the journalist and lawyer who published articles based on those documents in The Guardian, his employer at the time.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Wednesday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T05:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f898d29-1271-5e0a-b2a0-97d9a7a0af84', 'word_count': 732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f898d29-1271-5e0a-b2a0-97d9a7a0af84'}, {'abstract': 'India Ink spoke with the Aam Aadmi chief spokesman about what he regards as his party’s disappointing performance in the national elections.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/a-conversation-with-yogendra-yadav-a-leader-of-the-aam-aadmi-party/', 'snippet': 'India Ink spoke with the Aam Aadmi chief spokesman about what he regards as his party’s disappointing performance in the national elections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A scholar of the science of elections, Yogendra Yadav, 50, has become one of the most prominent faces of the Aam Aadmi Party, which won only four seats in the Indian Parliament, a disappointing result for a party that had a surprisingly strong showing in the state elections in Delhi in December.\xa0The party was able to lead the state government there, with its leader, Arvind Kejriwal, as the chief minister, but he resigned after only 49 days in office.\xa0', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: Yogendra Yadav, a Leader of the Aam Aadmi Party', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legislatures and Parliaments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gandhi, Rahul', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kejriwal, Arvind', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aam Aadmi Party (India)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chhattisgarh (India)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delhi (India)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Haryana (India)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madhya Pradesh (India)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Odisha (India)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T05:13:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vaibhav Vats', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vaibhav', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vats', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d3212cb-d462-5bb1-920e-d411ea3a90ec', 'word_count': 1234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d3212cb-d462-5bb1-920e-d411ea3a90ec'}, {'abstract': 'As a politically volatile summer nears, Hong Kong’s leader floats the idea of reducing the number of visits by mainland Chinese.', 'web_url': 'https://sinosphere.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/hong-kong-considers-limits-on-mainland-chinese-visitors/', 'snippet': 'As a politically volatile summer nears, Hong Kong’s leader floats the idea of reducing the number of visits by mainland Chinese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The politically sensitive idea of reducing the number of mainland Chinese visitors to Hong Kong seemed, until last week, a far-fetched notion. But that changed on Monday, when the territory’s chief executive, Leung Chun-ying, was quoted as saying that a 20 percent cut in mainland visitors was one option being considered by a government panel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/28sino-TOURISTS/28sino-TOURISTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/23/world/28sino-TOURISTS/28sino-TOURISTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/28sino-TOURISTS/28sino-TOURISTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/28sino-TOURISTS/28sino-TOURISTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/23/world/28sino-TOURISTS/28sino-TOURISTS-thumbStand