ntial companies in tech, also learned a few things from PARC.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/even-sun-microsystems-had-its-roots-at-xerox-parc/', 'snippet': 'Most in the tech industry know how Apple and Microsoft owe (at least) inspiration to the famed research laboratory. Not many know that Sun, once one of the most influential companies in tech, also learned a few things from PARC.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. — As a Stanford University graduate student in 1978, Andy Bechtolsheim took full advantage of a consulting appointment at Xerox’s fabled Palo Alto Research Center. He was able to experience the Xerox Alto, a then-revolutionary office workstation which would become the prototype for the modern PC.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 1239, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/28/business/28bits-parc3/28bits-parc3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Sun Microsystems Had Its Roots at Xerox PARC', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bechtolsheim, Andreas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jobs, Steven P', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Joy, William', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Khosla, Vinod', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNealy, Scott G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simonyi, Charles', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Palo Alto Research Center (PARC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sun Microsystems Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Xerox Corporation', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mountain View (Calif)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T11:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Markoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Markoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b428577-6ee6-5bc9-bd8e-734e6f6f1521', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b428577-6ee6-5bc9-bd8e-734e6f6f1521'}, {'abstract': 'I emphasized to the workers that we will need to spend more time collecting data, but that this is O.K. Better data will help us all make more money.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/my-pricing-problems-continued-responding-to-readers/', 'snippet': 'I emphasized to the workers that we will need to spend more time collecting data, but that this is O.K. Better data will help us all make more money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I would like to thank everyone who took time to offer guidance as I addressed my pricing problems. As usual, I received a range of answers after I asked whether it is a good idea to mess with a system that is, on aggregate, producing numbers that allow us to make a profit, but that on closer inspection is not working very well.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Pricing Problems Continued: Responding to Readers', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tables', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Downs, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paul Downs Cabinetmakers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T11:00:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Downs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62e2b793-88db-5e83-922f-8e897ec2c1ee', 'word_count': 1484, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62e2b793-88db-5e83-922f-8e897ec2c1ee'}, {'abstract': 'Raising the possibility of a hostile takeover, the drug maker said it would increase the amount of cash it would pay Allergan to $58.30 a share.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/valeant-raises-bid-for-allergan/', 'snippet': 'Raising the possibility of a hostile takeover, the drug maker said it would increase the amount of cash it would pay Allergan to $58.30 a share.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals is prepared to play the waiting game as it pursues what would be its largest and most transformative acquisition yet.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Threatening a Proxy Battle, Valeant Raises Its Offer on the Botox Maker Allergan', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Threatening a Proxy Battle, Valeant Raises Its Offer on the Botox Maker Allergan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Botox (Drug)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ALLERGAN INC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals International Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T11:06:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gelles and Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gelles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/952c6043-2dfc-50f8-be2d-8e32b3e7d21a', 'word_count': 973, 'uri': 'nyt://article/952c6043-2dfc-50f8-be2d-8e32b3e7d21a'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama said the United States could play a vital role in world affairs without resorting to unilateral force or retreating to isolationism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/29/us/politics/obama-foreign-policy-west-point-speech.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama said the United States could play a vital role in world affairs without resorting to unilateral force or retreating to isolationism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEST POINT, N.Y. — President Obama tried once more to articulate his vision of the American role in the world on Wednesday, telling graduating cadets here that the nation they were being called to serve would seek to avoid military misadventures abroad, even as it confronts a new set of terrorist threats from the Middle East to Africa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/politics/PREXY/PREXY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/us/politics/PREXY/PREXY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/politics/PREXY/PREXY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/politics/PREXY/PREXY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/politics/PREXY/PREXY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar