 Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/28/valeants-latest-move-disappoints/', 'snippet': 'In its pursuit of the maker of Botox, Valeant Pharmaceuticals has more work to do to reclaim the role of aggressor, writes Jeffrey Goldfarb of Reuters Breakingviews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Valeant Pharmaceuticals International comes off oddly defensive in its latest advance on Allergan.\xa0A sweetened, $49 billion bid for Allergan, the Botox maker, disappointed investors in both companies. The use of a messy financial instrument probably didn’t help, especially after the target pushed back hard on the deal math and compared its suitor to Tyco. Valeant has more work to do to reclaim the role of aggressor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/business/dbpix-valeant/dbpix-valeant-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/business/dbpix-valeant/dbpix-valeant-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 444}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/business/dbpix-valeant/dbpix-valeant-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/business/dbpix-valeant/dbpix-valeant-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1036, 'width': 1401, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/business/dbpix-valeant/dbpix-valeant-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/29/business/d