2.5 million light-years from here. They tentatively diagnosed it as the collision of two neutron stars, the dense remnants of dead stars. Such collisions are among the most violent known conflagrations in the universe, but they rarely occur so close to our own neck of the cosmic woods.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Andromeda and the Milky Way: A Merger of Galactic Proportions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stars and Galaxies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Space and Astronomy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Aeronautics and Space Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Milky Way Galaxy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-28T19:31:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Space & Cosmos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Overbye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Overbye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21a6672e-868b-5e07-9d62-560ce7a7d894', 'word_count': 341, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21a6672e-868b-5e07-9d62-560ce7a7d894'}, {'abstract': "Did the president address his critics' fears about America's decline on the world stage?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2014/05/28/did-obamas-speech-at-west-point-make-his-case/', 'snippet': "Did the president address his critics' fears about America's decline on the world stage?", 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Did Obama Make His Case?', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyw