', 'lead_paragraph': 'JULIA WOLFE: ‘Steel Hammer’Bang on a Can All-Stars; Trio Mediaeval(Cantaloupe)There’s grit in Julia Wolfe’s “Steel Hammer.” No, really. The blue-collar song cycle is scored for the versatile forces of the Bang on a Can All-Stars and the ethereally pure female voices of Trio Mediaeval, but a recurring sound is that of sand, pouring down the inside of wooden tubes. The result is a fiercely beautiful homage to manual labor, its endless repetitions and occasional moments of magical transformation. (Corinna da Fonseca-Wollheim)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 615, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1229, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/classical-can-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/arts/classical-can/cla