/05/29/us/politics/primary-loss-means-end-of-era-for-world-war-ii-veterans-in-congress.html', 'snippet': 'After Representative Ralph M. Hall lost his bid, he and Representative John D. Dingell, who is giving up his seat, will be the last two World War II veterans to serve. The next Congress will have none.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Combat veterans of World War II have served in every Congress for the last 70 years, shaping foreign policy and a vision of the United States as the world’s benevolent leader, willing to use its economic and military might as a global force for freedom.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/us/HALL/HALL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 1