d_count': 940, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e37aabf2-8dce-5344-ad93-2ff7a677e5c1'}, {'abstract': 'A man who carried out a suicide bombing Sunday was believed to be the first American involved in such an attack, U.S. officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/29/world/middleeast/us-citizen-in-suicide-act-in-syria-officials-say.html', 'snippet': 'A man who carried out a suicide bombing Sunday was believed to be the first American involved in such an attack, U.S. officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A United States citizen working in Syria with a militant group backed by Al Qaeda conducted a suicide bombing there Sunday, in what is believed to be the first time an American has been involved in such an attack, American officials said Wednesday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Suicide Bomber in Syria Was U.S. Citizen, Officials Say', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Suicide Bomber in Syria Was U.S. Citizen, Officials Say', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schmitt, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Nusra Front', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abusalha, Moner Mohammad', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-29T01:11:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Schmitt and Ben Hubbard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmitt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': ''