ractive/f81ffd1f-eaf6-5109-8295-7769acfb9fb2'}, {'abstract': 'A state audit of the Churchill School and Center, a taxpayer-supported Manhattan school for special education students, said the school rang up more than $3 million in improper expenses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/29/nyregion/state-audit-faults-spending-reports-by-a-manhattan-school.html', 'snippet': 'A state audit of the Churchill School and Center, a taxpayer-supported Manhattan school for special education students, said the school rang up more than $3 million in improper expenses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A state audit released on Wednesday said that a taxpayer-supported Manhattan school for special education students rang up more than $3 million in improper expenses, including bonuses, executive salaries, alcohol and trips.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '33', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State Audit Faults Spending Reports by a Manhattan School', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Audit Faults Spending by a School in Manhattan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Special Education', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Office of the Comptroller (NYS)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Private and Sectarian Schools', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'DiNapoli, Thomas P', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Education Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Churchill School and Center (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-29T03:15:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_des