les are updated with laser cutouts and bold new takes on eyelet lace.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the oldest style rules in the book says that one should only wear white between Memorial Day and Labor Day. While fashion is all about breaking rules, summer’s unofficial start certainly marks the time for a palette cleanse. Lacy cutouts — whether laser-cut or embroidered — turn summer whites into bona fide statement pieces. These ventilated items from the likes of Tod’s, Isabel Marant and Tabitha Simmons allow the wearer to keep cool in the heat, while their graphic patterns prove that eyelet fabric doesn’t always have to be sweet and innocent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29market-gilchrist/29market-gilchrist-thumbSt