/2014/05/29/upshot/senates-legislative-inactivity.html', 'snippet': 'How does the Senate compare to the House in the number of bills introduced in this Congress? It has introduced even fewer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The House has introduced fewer bills this Congress, but what about the Senate? The number of legislative proposals in that chamber has fallen by 23 percent compared with the last Congress, an even steeper decline than in the House. But in other respects, the changes in bill introductions in the Senate have roughly mirrored what has happened in the House.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Senate’s Legislative Inactivity', 'kicker': 'Capital Field Notes', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-29T14:25:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Derek Willis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Derek', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Willis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2cbde70-c902-55a2-8148-6dcdc1968dcc', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2cbde70-c902-55a2-8148-6dcdc1968dcc'}, {'abstract': 'The satellite television provider announced on Thursday that it will begin allowing its 14 million subscribers to pay in Bitcoin later this year.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2014/05/29/dish-network-to-accept-bitcoin/', 'snippet': 'The satellite television provider announced on Thursday that it will begin allowing its 14 million subscribers to pay in Bitcoin later this year.', 'lead_paragraph'