88-7470-544c-8690-5c3a7f1abf71'}, {'abstract': 'Los Angeles police arrested a Ukrainian man after he struck Mr. Pitt in the face, they said.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2014/05/29/brad-pitt-punched-at-maleficent-premiere/', 'snippet': 'Los Angeles police arrested a Ukrainian man after he struck Mr. Pitt in the face, they said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brad Pitt was signing autographs outside the El Capitan Theater in Hollywood on Wednesday evening, on his way to the premiere of “Maleficent,” which stars his partner, Angelina Jolie, when suddenly, for a few seconds, it seemed as if he were back in “Fight Club.” While Mr. Pitt was signing and Ms. Jolie was posing for photographs, someone jumped over a metal barrier and took a swing at Mr. Pitt, striking him in the face. The alleged assailant, whom the police identified as Vitalii Sediuk, 25, was led away in handcuffs. Gus Villanueva, a spokesman for the Los Angeles Police Department, told Reuters that he was being held in lieu of $20,000 bail.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/arts/29artsbeat-pitt1/29artsbeat-pitt1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 965, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/30/arts/29artsbeat-pitt1/29artsbeat-pitt1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 965}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/arts/29artsbeat-pitt1/29artsbeat-pitt1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 637, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/arts/29artsbeat-pitt1/29artsbeat-pitt1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2010, 'width': 1250, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', '