antime with a delightful EP of reinterpreted lost classics. T debuts a remix of one of the tracks.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Now is the time for me to make a record only I could make,” says the inimitable Roisin Murphy. The 40-year-old singer is speaking in a charming Irish brogue over Skype, with birds singing in the background, about the full-length album of original material she plans to release later this year after a seven-year absence. But the comment could just as easily refer to her current project, “Mi Senti” —\xa0an EP of electronic covers of Italian pop standards made famous by ’60s and ’70s icons like Mina and Patti Pravo, plus one Italian-language original. A remix of a track from the release, “Ancora Ancora Ancora,” debuts here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29murphy-dorris/29murphy-dorris-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29murphy-dorris/29murphy-dorris-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29murphy-dorris/29murphy-dorris-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29murphy-dorris/29murphy-dorris-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/29/t-magazine/29murphy-dorris/29murphy-dorris-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'image