et an A in Philanthropy Class, Give Away $50,000', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Get an A in Philanthropy Class, Give Away $50,000', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grants (Corporate and Foundation)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nonprofit Organizations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Raynor, Geoffrey P', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Q Investments Limited', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-29T21:38:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a5c35e3-92f4-5284-8fc9-b126ada10324', 'word_count': 1371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a5c35e3-92f4-5284-8fc9-b126ada10324'}, {'abstract': 'Summer may not be endless, but the number of free offerings in New York City almost seems to be.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/30/nyregion/summertime-frolicking-in-new-york.html', 'snippet': 'Summer may not be endless, but the number of free offerings in New York City almost seems to be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Summer sure sneaked up on the Miser, who was looking forward to a nice long public whine about the brutality of the winter just past. But here we are, a couple of days from June, and there’s no time for looking back. Not with months of fun FREE events on the way. Herewith, a summer Miser’s guide to New York City.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0