 led to policies that harmed women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WITH a sensational story of surviving child sex slavery in Cambodia, Somaly Mam became a worldwide icon, the best-selling author of a memoir and the head of a foundation raising millions in the name of saving girls and women from the sex trade, victims she recounted rescuing in dramatic brothel raids. Last year, introducing the State Department’s annual “Trafficking in Persons” report, Secretary of State John Kerry called Ms. Mam “a hero every single day.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Price of a Sex-Slave Rescue Fantasy', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Price of a Sex-Slave Rescue Fantasy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mam, Somaly', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grant, Melissa Gira', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Trafficking', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prostitution', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cambodia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T00:09:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Gira Grant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': 'Gira', 'lastname': 'Grant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/58b654ac-0c4c-5776-9f25-0d2b43a867ad', 'word_count': 929, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58b654ac-0c4c-5776-9f25-0d2b43a867ad'}, {'abstract': 'Many people believe there is not enough regulation of banks and they want tougher rules and more stringent enforcement of those rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/30/business/after-crisis-a-new-spirit-of-reining-in-the-banks.html', 'snippet': 'Many people believe there is not enough regulation of banks and they want tougher rules and more stringent enforcement of those rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It is widely believed that there has long been something that could be called a regulator-banker complex. People with similar views on the proper level of regulation move back and forth between the two groups. Their hats change, but not their policy preferences.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/norrispic/norrispic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/norrispic/norrispic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/norrispic/norrispic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/01/31/business/norrispic/norrispic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/01/31/business/norrispic/norrispic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After Crisis, a New Spirit of Reining In the Banks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Crisis, a New Spirit of Reining In 