84fd-09f23150f8a3', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7774a80-bc71-5747-84fd-09f23150f8a3'}, {'abstract': 'In response to the backlog problem, the Department of Veterans Affairs has a new plan to make it easier for veterans to use private facilities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/30/opinion/a-lifeline-for-veterans-waiting-for-care.html', 'snippet': 'In response to the backlog problem, the Department of Veterans Affairs has a new plan to make it easier for veterans to use private facilities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the wake of revelations that patients have waited for months to see a primary care doctor at a veterans’ medical center in Phoenix, the Obama administration announced in the past few days some reasonable steps to mitigate the problems. One important measure will move veterans who have been stuck too long up the waiting list. Another will offer those still facing waits of more than 30 days the option of using private hospitals and clinics. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Lifeline for Veterans Waiting for Care', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Lifeline for Veterans Waiting for Care', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Phoenix (Ariz)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T01:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The