hose cars safer for everyone in their path. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Time to Move on Dangerous Tank Cars', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Time to Move on Dangerous Tank Cars', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroad Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Railroads', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T01:02:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3b89a8f-2af8-5a70-8e20-081095c613b7', 'word_count': 322, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3b89a8f-2af8-5a70-8e20-081095c613b7'}, {'abstract': 'The weather may be the biggest challenge facing California Chrome as he tries to become the first Triple Crown winner since 1978.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/30/sports/at-belmont-no-bets-on-race-weather.html', 'snippet': 'The weather may be the biggest challenge facing California Chrome as he tries to become the first Triple Crown winner since 1978.', 'lead_paragraph': 'California Chrome has continued to train with ease at Belmont Park, and after a routine two-mile gallop Thursday, he schooled in the paddock for the first time since his arrival 10 days ago.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'ima