 sell the Los Angeles Clippers to Ballmer, the former chief executive of Microsoft, for $2 billion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/31/sports/basketball/steven-ballmer-buys-los-angeles-clippers-from-rochelle-sterling.html', 'snippet': 'Rochelle Sterling agreed Thursday night to sell the Los Angeles Clippers to Ballmer, the former chief executive of Microsoft, for $2 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Steve Ballmer, the former Microsoft chief executive, has agreed to pay $2 billion for the Los Angeles Clippers, according to a statement released by Rochelle Sterling, a co-owner of the team. If approved by the National Basketball Association, the sale would end a troubling situation for the league and rank as one of the largest deals in sports history.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/sports/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/30/sports/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/sports/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/sports/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/30/sports/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING/SUB-CITY-JP-STERLING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name