of prepares to debut a new show, “The Leftovers,” it’s all he can think about.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/magazine/damon-lindelof-leftovers-lost.html', 'snippet': 'For a long time, the ending of the series was all anyone could talk about. Now, as Lindelof prepares to debut a new show, “The Leftovers,” it’s all he can think about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few months ago, inside a house in Douglaston, Queens, Justin Theroux, the star of the new HBO show “The Leftovers,” was in the kitchen, having his feet blow-dried. Theroux had been shooting a scene in which he had to run outside in the snow in bare feet, jump a fence, then put out a fire — over and over. When he retreated to the living room between takes, a conversation about the limitations of human feet ensued among the various people assembled, which led seamlessly to a vigorous and enthusiastic discussion about the magician David Blaine, who was once frozen in a giant block of ice.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01lindelof1/mag-01Lindelof-t_CA0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Damon Lindelof Promises You His New Show Won’t End Like ‘Lost’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Post-Finale Stress Disorder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lindelof, Damon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Leftovers (TV Program)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Lost (TV Program)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Leftovers (Book)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T14:30:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Taffy Brodesser-Akner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Taffy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brodesser-Akner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d6de9932-1259-5a57-82b6-3dd1ddf29e02', 'word_count': 4313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d6de9932-1259-5a57-82b6-3dd1ddf29e02'}, {'abstract': 'The l