n am I a hypocrite for paying someone else to do my “dirty work”? Is it ethical to pay someone else to kill an animal because I can’t, or don’t want to know what’s involved? M. R., NORTH CAROLINA', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-articleLarge-v14.jpg', 'height': 352, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-articleLarge-v14.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 352}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-jumbo-v15.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-superJumbo-v15.jpg', 'height': 1201, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/magazine/01ethicist/01ethicist-thumbLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Slaughter for Hire', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Slaughter for Hire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': 