author’s letters home to her sister while working as a live-in nanny and rubbing elbows with London’s literary royalty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/books/review/love-nina-by-nina-stibbe.html', 'snippet': '“Love, Nina” consists of the author’s letters home to her sister while working as a live-in nanny and rubbing elbows with London’s literary royalty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This book seems to have been written specifically for me. Which is not quite the same as saying it was written for you. There is a chance, of course, that you too lived in London in the 1980s while studying for a degree in English literature, in which case you will get every cultural and political reference it contains. It’s possible you are actually English yourself. If that is so, you (like me) will laugh aloud at the understated humor while enjoying the nostalgic mentions of TV shows and sporting events of years gone by.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '46', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/books/review/01SUBBSTIBB/01SUBBSTIBB-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 888, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/books/review/01SUBBSTIBB/01SUBBSTIBB-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 888}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/books/review/01SUBBSTIBB/01SUBBSTIBB-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 692, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/books/review/01SUBBSTIBB/01SUBBSTIBB-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1384, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '