 {'abstract': 'Prime Minister Shinzo Abe said he wanted Japan to shed its postwar passiveness and discourage China’s assertive territorial claims.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/31/world/asia/japan-china-abe.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister Shinzo Abe said he wanted Japan to shed its postwar passiveness and discourage China’s assertive territorial claims.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TOKYO — Saying that his nation will play a larger role in regional security, Prime Minister Shinzo Abe of Japan said on Friday that his government would support Vietnam and other nations that have territorial disputes with China by providing patrol ships, training and military surveillance equipment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Japan Offers Support to Nations in Disputes With China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Assn of Southeast Asian Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ABE, SHINZO', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Far East, South and Southeast Asia and Pacific Areas', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T18:04:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martin Fackler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fackler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8ce1c2d-b76d-5c56-8867-b85ef6cc5b9e', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8ce1c2d-b76d-5c56-8867-b85ef6cc5b9e'}, {'abstract': 'The former Goldman Sachs director, convicted on insider trading charges, sought to remain free on bail while he appeals h