 hellbent to conquer fashion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The black leather biker’s jacket is hellbent to conquer fashion. It has already achieved major status for daytime. And this spring, it has zoomed into the evening, topping long dresses, delicate prints and lace. One woman wore one over her long gown. Another woman, above, had a printed jacket that matched her dress.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Cunningham | Pack Mentality', 'kicker': 'On the Street', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pack Mentality', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cunningham, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leather and Leather Goods', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-30T20:49:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Cunningham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cunningham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f636f31c-097c-57d4-9c73-62826e65c20a', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f636f31c-097c-57d4-9c73-62826e65c20a'}, {'abstract': 'The pianist Jacob Sacks displayed his versatility by leading a trio and then pairing with a vocalist in a concert on Wednesday at Weill Recital Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/31/arts/music/jacob-sacks-and-friends-in-concert-at-weill-recital-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The pianist Jacob Sacks displayed his versatility by leading a trio and then pairing with a vocalist in a concert on Wednesday at Weill Recital Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pianist Jacob Sacks is