exhibition at the North Carolina Museum of Art; Steve Magnante’s 1001 Muscle Car Facts is a thoughtfully assembled collection of trivia.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/31/automobiles/two-new-books-on-porsche-and-muscle-cars.html', 'snippet': 'Porsche by Design is tied to an exhibition at the North Carolina Museum of Art; Steve Magnante’s 1001 Muscle Car Facts is a thoughtfully assembled collection of trivia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s Automobiles section, readers will find reviews of a selection of books that delve into topics including design, history, motor sports and vintage motoring advice. Choosing the books to be reviewed is always a hand-wringing task here, a pleasant chore of sorting through publishers’ offerings to provide a balance of interests and formats.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/automobiles/porsche-cover/porsche-cover-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/31/automobiles/porsche-cover/porsche-cover-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 514}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/automobiles/porsche-cover/porsche-cover-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/automobiles/porsche-cover/porsche-cover-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1755, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/automobiles/porsche-cover/porsche-cover-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta