 if “peace, order and reform” are achieved, democracy could return.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/05/31/world/asia/thai-junta-expects-to-rule-for-more-than-a-year.html', 'snippet': 'In a proclamation tightening control, the leader said that if “peace, order and reform” are achieved, democracy could return.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — Thailand’s military junta tightened its control on Friday with a far-reaching plan to appoint an interim government, write a new constitution and carry out large-scale public works projects. The junta also disclosed for the first time how long it intended to remain in charge — at least into the second half of 2015.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 792, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 792}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 776, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1552, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/05/31/world/THAILAND/THAILAND-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '