orate governance criteria have experienced explosive growth in the last five years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/business/the-surge-in-investing-by-conscience.html', 'snippet': 'Investment funds that take into account environmental, social and corporate governance criteria have experienced explosive growth in the last five years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Financial risk and return may be the main focus of most investments. But strategies with an explicit social component are growing rapidly, according to the most current data from the industry association that supports and tracks this field: US SIF — the Forum for Sustainable and Responsible Investment. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/business/01datapoints_graphic/01datapoints_graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 625, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/business/01datapoints_graphic/01datapoints_graphic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 625}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/business/01datapoints_graphic/01datapoints_graphic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 879, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/business/01datapoints_graphic/01datapoints_graphic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 879, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/business/01datapoints_graphic/01datapoints_graphic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'