 None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86100dff-2de9-5263-8a54-a3d2c7bc6f8d', 'word_count': 1262, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86100dff-2de9-5263-8a54-a3d2c7bc6f8d'}, {'abstract': 'Veterans have expressed frustration with delayed access to health care and an impenetrable and unresponsive bureaucracy at Veterans Affairs hospitals and clinics.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/us/many-veterans-praise-health-care-but-all-hate-the-wait.html', 'snippet': 'Veterans have expressed frustration with delayed access to health care and an impenetrable and unresponsive bureaucracy at Veterans Affairs hospitals and clinics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Marc Schenker, an Air Force veteran in Fort Lauderdale, Fla., is having surgery this month to remove a golf-ball-size hernia — but not at a veterans hospital. Mr. Schenker, 67, said he had given up on the Veterans Affairs hospital in Miami after waiting months to get the procedure scheduled and had turned to a private surgeon instead, using Medicare.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/us/VETERANS/VETERANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/06/01/us/VETERANS/VETERANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 916}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/us/VETERANS/VETERANS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/06/01/us/VETERANS/VETERANS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2001, 'width': 1310, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': Non