/what-veterans-say-about-their-health-care.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Times asked veterans around the country to share their experiences at V.A. hospitals and clinics.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Amid reports of delayed access to care at Department of Veterans Affairs hospitals, The New York Times asked veterans and others to share their stories about the quality of care at the agency’s facilities across the country. A selection of submissions appears below. We invite you to share your story here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Veterans Tell Us About Their Care', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Veterans Affairs Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2014-05-31T21:22:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1f29fe1-c89e-54bc-b198-5de40c3b474c', 'word_count': 813, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1f29fe1-c89e-54bc-b198-5de40c3b474c'}, {'abstract': 'Masahiro Tanaka remained modest after allowing four hits in eight innings and lowering his earned run average to 2.06 as the Yankees beat the Twins.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2014/06/01/sports/baseball/tanaka-continues-his-dominance-winning-for-the-eighth-time.html', 'snippet': 'Masahiro Tanaka remained modest after allowing four hits in eight innings and lowering his earned run average to 2.06 as the Yankees beat the Twins.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after Masahiro Tanaka signed a seven-year, $155 million contract in January, Yankees General Manager Brian Cashman said in a radio inter